### Quest Lines ###


## Quest Line: LV1 - Early Game
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.name=Рів1 - Початок гри
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.desc=Це початок моду HBM's Nuclear Tech. У цьому розділі ви дізнаєтесь про основні механіки моду, як про поради та фішки, які допоможуть вам у прогресі.

# Quest: Storage Drawers
betterquesting.quest.-7rSSbm6Q-qSPUPH2dapXA.name=Шухляди
betterquesting.quest.-7rSSbm6Q-qSPUPH2dapXA.desc=Шухляди§r - це простий і недорогий спосіб зберігати велику кількість предметів. Їх можна вдосконалювати, щоб збільшити місткість, а також отримати інші можливості, наприклад, здатність до позбавлення. Крім того, їх можна §dобтесати§r, щоб змінити породу деревини.%n%n§2Велика кількість ящиків може спричинити падіння кадрів у грі.

# Quest: You WILL eat ze bugs!
betterquesting.quest.-FdHmQJDSNCih5noZiI5-w.name=Ти БУДЕШ їсти зих жуків!
betterquesting.quest.-FdHmQJDSNCih5noZiI5-w.desc=Вітаємо. Ти це зробив. Ти справді це зробив.%n%nПоки решта світу відчайдушно чіплялася за свою яловичину та хліб, ти - так, саме ТИ - заглянув у свій інвентар, дістав §6Шовкопряда§r і подумав: «Так. Тепер це їжа». Клаус пишається тобою. Клаус, насправді, розчулений. Десь у швейцарському%nшале по його водолазці котиться одинока сльоза. Ви нічого не будете мати. У вас не буде шкали голоду. Тай ти будеш щасливий.

# Quest: Stirling Engine
betterquesting.quest.-OxoBRz7Spqm0rVUNxRVpA.name=Двигун Стірлінга
betterquesting.quest.-OxoBRz7Spqm0rVUNxRVpA.desc=§3Двигун Стірлінга§r використовує тепло від §3нагрівальної печі§r або §3§r§3топки§r для вироблення енергії. Якщо для нагрівання двигуна Стірлінга використовувати нагрівальну піч, він, ймовірно, перегріється і вийде з ладу, а головна шестерня відлетить. Важкий двигун Стірлінга не має цієї проблеми.%n%nТопка, що працює на вугіллі з двигуном Стірлінга, виробляє §e2kHE/s§r, тоді як нагрівальна піч з важким двигуном Стірлінга виробляє §e10kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Additional Fluid Tools
betterquesting.quest.0-Ws1mY3SeeFcyIcv2LKNQ.name=Додаткові інструменти для рідин
betterquesting.quest.0-Ws1mY3SeeFcyIcv2LKNQ.desc=§6Сифон§r це інструмент, який використовується для вилучення вхідних рідин з машини. Клік правої кнопки миші вміст вхідних танків заповнить будь які рідини, універсальні танки або трубопроводи (якщо сума рідини не може заповнювати будь-який з попередніх варіантів).%n%n§6Піпетки§r можна використовувати для введення певних сум рідин. Натискання правою клавішею або Shift-правою кнопкою збільшить або зменшить суму рідини.

# Quest: Steam Engine
betterquesting.quest.1WdjJYUsRMKgt4MYnlmM7A.name=Паровий Двигун
betterquesting.quest.1WdjJYUsRMKgt4MYnlmM7A.desc=The §3Steam Engine§r is an early game method of turning §bSteam§r into energy. It requires an external source to provide steam and a way to dump or reprocess the §bLow-Pressure Steam§r it produces. It only handles regular-pressure steam - denser steam needs a turbine.%n%nThe Steam Engine has an energy efficiency of §e85%%§r, making it better than the §3Stirling Engine§r. However, it still has a throughput limit as it can only hold up to 2000 mB of steam. Its maximum processing rate is 2000 mB/t, producing a considerable §e3400 HE/t§r or §e68 kHE/s§r. It is therefore the best generator available before §3Steam Turbines§r.%n%nA boiler being heated up by a heating oven using coal will produce §e17kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Automatic Thresher
betterquesting.quest.3o6RE2fyQyaYt65j_dZ2HQ.name=Автоматична молотарка
betterquesting.quest.3o6RE2fyQyaYt65j_dZ2HQ.desc=§3Автоматична молотарка§r збирає урожай наприклад §6Пшениця§r, §6Конопля§r, §6Цукрова тростина§r, у 7х7 радіусі коли поставляється паливом. Вона буде викидувати всі елементи заду.%n%n[F1] для отримання додаткової інформації.

# Quest: Abandoned Structures
betterquesting.quest.4d7s5-1MQxyI3YcrDSL98g.name=Покинуті споруди
betterquesting.quest.4d7s5-1MQxyI3YcrDSL98g.desc=Будівлі з’являються по всьому світу і є одними з найкращих джерел ресурсів на початку гри. Якщо їх розграбувати, не вкладаючи значних коштів у виробництво, можна заощадити чимало часу та матеріалів.%n%n§2Дослідження окупаються вже на початку гри - огляньте околиці, перш ніж витрачати час на збір ресурсів, які можна знайти безкоштовно.§r

# Quest: Flare Stack
betterquesting.quest.4i9qqJhbSgC0UQ8pB9PD4g.name=Факельна вежа
betterquesting.quest.4i9qqJhbSgC0UQ8pB9PD4g.desc=The §3Flare Stack§r is a generator that produces energy by burning flammable liquids and gases. Any fluid tagged as Flammable can serve as fuel - supply it through pipes or directly via containers.%n%nOperation uses three steps. First, fill the internal buffer (capacity: §e64,000 mB§r) with fuel. Second, open the §6Flow Valve§r at the top of the middle section to release fuel from the buffer into the combustion system. Third, enable the §6Ignition§r switch at the bottom of the middle section to ignite the fuel and begin power generation.%n%nEfficiency is low: gases burn at §e50%%§r and liquids at only §e10%%§r. Output also varies by fuel type.%n%nTwo upgrades are available: the §6Speed Upgrade§r increases throughput, and the §6Effectiveness Upgrade§r improves fuel efficiency.

# Quest: Batteries
betterquesting.quest.5Cydbu41QH-GnEo1um0Qjw.name=Батареї
betterquesting.quest.5Cydbu41QH-GnEo1um0Qjw.desc=§3Роз'єм для батарей§r призначений для розміщення §6батарей§r  або §6конденсаторів§r.%n%nБатареї мають більший запас енергії, але повільніше віддають заряд, що означає, що в мережу можна подати лише невелику частину накопиченої енергії.%n%nНатомість конденсатори мають менший запас енергії, але віддають заряд швидше.

# Quest: Stone Age
betterquesting.quest.63Mkw5ZqT6iefbQvFZ_EDQ.name=Кам'яний вік
betterquesting.quest.63Mkw5ZqT6iefbQvFZ_EDQ.desc=Ласкаво просимо до Кам'яного віку. На цьому етапі ви ознайомитеся з основними механізмами виживання, необхідними для проходження гри, а також із низкою змін, внесених до базової версії Minecraft, які впливають на ігровий процес із самого початку.%n%nВиконайте завдання цього розділу, щоб набрати необхідний досвід, перш ніж рухатися далі.%n%n§2Виконайте ці завдання, перш ніж продовжувати - на наступних етапах передбачається, що ви вже знаєте цей матеріал.§r

# Quest: Nailed It!
betterquesting.quest.6l98ozdcQFqJOan6BC4kMA.name=Молоток!
betterquesting.quest.6l98ozdcQFqJOan6BC4kMA.desc=§6Молот§r - це інструмент з §dEx Nihilo§r, який використовується для подрібнення блоків до дрібніших форм. Його основна роль - виробництво матеріалів, необхідних для §3Сита§r: бруківка подрібнюється на гравій, гравій - на пісок, а пісок - на пил, кожен з яких можна просіяти для отримання різних ресурсів.%n%nЩоб ним скористатися, просто розбийте цільовий блок за допомогою §6Молота§r, як ви це робите за допомогою кайла. Молотки бувають стандартних рівнів - від%nдерева до діаманта - і відрізняються лише міцністю. Їх можна зачарувати, хоча доступні зачарування відрізняються від тих, що є для кайла.%n%nРуду також можна подрібнювати за допомогою багатоетапного ланцюга подрібнення. Кожен крок має невеликий шанс дати бонусний%nmaterіал, що робить §6Молот§r базовим засобом розмноження руди до появи спеціалізованих машин для її обробки.%n%n§2Процес розбивання можна автоматизувати за допомогою машин, що імітують руйнування блоків, таких як Auto Hammer від §dEx Compressum§r.%n§2Перевірте JEI, щоб дізнатися повний ланцюжок подрібнення будь-якого блоку.

# Quest: Cable Network Analysis Tool
betterquesting.quest.9FPuQxhjSHmPmrCwdfRZRw.name=Інструмент для аналізу кабельних мереж
betterquesting.quest.9FPuQxhjSHmPmrCwdfRZRw.desc=§6Інструмент для аналізу кабельних мереж§r використовується для перевірки цілісності електромереж та аналізу їх основних функціональних компонентів. Щоб виконати тест, клацніть правою кнопкою миші на аналізаторі, розташованому на дротах або механізмах в електромережі. Пристрій відображає такі дані:%n%n§eЗв'язки§r - до них належать дроти та механізми, здатні проводити енергію (наприклад, накопичувачі енергії, опори ліній електропередач).%n%n§cПостачальники§r - усі механізми, здатні виробляти енергію та/або подавати її в мережу (накопичувачі енергії в режимах «§aзелений§r» та «§6помаранчевий§r», турбіни тощо). %n%n§9Отримувачі§r - все, що поглинає енергію з мережі (акумулятори в режимі «§9blue§r», подрібнювачі та інші механізми).%n%n§2Аналізатор не тільки відображає вищезазначені компоненти, а й підраховує їх. Кожній мережі присвоюється унікальний код.%n%nЧастинки з’являються лише в радіусі 20 блоків!

# Quest: Pipe Anchors
betterquesting.quest.9wRpAnjXSrGWFWSwKoTOhg.name=Фіксатори труб
betterquesting.quest.9wRpAnjXSrGWFWSwKoTOhg.desc=§3Фіксатори труб§r - це гнучкі трубопроводи для рідин, які можна використовувати замість звичайних трубопроводів.

# Quest: Automatic Buzz Saw
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0A.name=Автоматична циркулярна пила
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0A.desc=With the §6§3Automatic Buzz Saw§r one can automatically farm trees for their §6Wood§r, as well as plants such as §6Hemp§r.%n%n§3Fans§r, when powered by redstone, can be used to push the dropped items into hoppers or conveyors for storage. Use a §6Drill§r on them to remove the diminishing behaviour of pushing force.

# Quest: Industrial Mixer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0w.name=Промисловий змішувач
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0w.desc=The §3Industrial Mixer§r is a machine that is used to mix a fluid with an item and/or another fluid. It can be used instead of a §3Chemical Plant§r for some recipes. Set the output fluid with a §6Fluid Identifier§r and switch recipes with the [C] button.

# Quest: Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAw.name=Ковадло
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAw.desc=§3Anvils§r are a tiered crafting station that allows for the creation of various machines, structures, and items in some cases. There are multiple tiers of anvils with greater anvil tier primarily corresponding to a greater quantity of recipes being available. The top slots are for smithing, the bottom section for construction.

# Quest: Burner Press
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABA.name=Твердопаливний прес
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABA.desc=The §3Presses§r are machines that can be used to make §6Plates§r, §6Wires§r, §6Circuits§r, §6Bullet Casings§r as well as §6Compressing§r non-smeltable powders back into their normal form. They require §6Stamps§r to work, which are converted from the basic §6Flat Stamp§r into plate or wire stamps using the template folder. The burner press burns solid fuel like coal to run.%n%n§2A preheater can be placed next to the Burner Press to increase its speed.

# Quest: Blast Furnace
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQ.name=Доменна піч
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQ.desc=The §3Blast Furnace§r is a furnace that only burns hot fuels like coal, coke or solid fuel, used to create different alloys out of two inputs. The main starter alloys are: §6Minecraft Grade Copper§r and §6Steel§r. Inserting §bHot Air Blast§r, made by putting §bCompressed Air§r in a §3Boiler§r, grants all recipes a §e3x§r boost.%n§bFlue Gas§r produced from operating the machine can be burnt for energy or vented into the atmosphere.%n%nSteel tools come equiped with vein mining, making them an excellent early-game tool.%n%n§2For more advanced tools later on, pressing the ALT key will bring up a menu from which one can select multiple abilities at once.§r

# Quest: Trench Mask
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADA.name=Захисна маска
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADA.desc=§6Захисна маска§r - це базова маска, яка захистить користувача від деяких небезпечних частинок у повітрі під час видобутку корисних копалин. Щоб її виготовити, спочатку потрібно дістати §6Тканину§r, а потім помочитися на неї, клацнувши правою кнопкою миші, тримаючи її в руці.%n%n§2Нитки можна легко отримати, зібравши коноплі, які ростуть у дикій природі.%n%n§rМені неприємно це казати, але, по суті, ви вдихаєте власну сечу...

# Quest: Hazmat Suits
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADw.name=Захисні костюми
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADw.desc=§6Захисні костюми§r забезпечують захист від багатьох небезпек, насамперед від радіації. §6Захисна тканина§r може бути додатково зміцнена для створення більш міцних захисних костюмів.%n%nДля додаткового захисту від небезпек навколишнього середовища необхідний §6Фільтр для протигаза§r, який можна встановити, клацнувши по ньому правою кнопкою миші.

# Quest: Energy Cables
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQ.name=Енергетичні кабелі
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQ.desc=Найпростішим блоком для передачі енергії є §3Червоний мідний кабель§r, який випускається у двох варіантах: у вигляді блоку та у вигляді більш тонкого кабелю. Блок також має версію, яку можна пофарбувати, що допоможе йому краще вписатися у Ваш дизайн.%n%nДля кращого зовнішнього вигляду, а також для передачі енергії на більші відстані можна використовувати §l§r§6Кабельний барабан§r з §3Електричними з'єднувачами§r. Ці лінії електропередачі не є суцільними і можуть проходить крізь підлоги та стіни.%n%n

# Quest: Pollution Detector
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEg.name=Детектор забруднення
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEg.desc=§6Детектор забруднення§r буде відстежувати та відображати рівень забруднення навколишнього середовища. Високий рівень забруднення знизить видимість, накладе на гравця негативні ефекти та надасть позитивні ефекти мобам, зокрема скелетам, які з’являються з вогнепальною зброєю.

# Quest: Electricity
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEw.name=Електроенергія
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEw.desc=§dHBM's NTM§r - це промисловий мод, тому для продовження подорожі Вам знадобиться §eЕлектроенергія§r. Енергія вимірюється в §6HE (Енергія HBM)§r.%n%n§2Якщо дров'яного генератора недостатньо, у лівій частині цього квестбука можна розблокувати більш досконалі джерела енергії, такі як §3Двигун Стірлінга§2, §3Сонячний баштовий котел§2 або §3Двигун з радіальним розташуванням§2.§r

# Quest: Analog Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFA.name=Аналогова друкована плата
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFA.desc=§6Аналогова друкована схема§r - це перша справжня друкована плата, яка використовується для виготовлення деяких важливих машин та інструментів, таких як §6Детектор нафтових родовищ§r, §3Хімічний завод§r та §3Електродугова піч§r.%n%n§2Якщо у вас є подрібнювач - то стане доступним дешевший рецепт виготовлення конденсаторів.

# Quest: Assembly Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQ.name=Збиральна машина
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQ.desc=The §3Assembly Machine§r is used in every stage of the game, with it being used to manufacture practically every other complex machine. Recipes for it can be chosen inside the GUI. The machine itself is built in an §3Anvil§r from §6plates§r made in a §3Press§r.%n%n§2Some unique recipes require blueprints, that can be found in dungeons and/or bought from Bobmazon.

# Quest: Shredder
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGg.name=Подрібнювач
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGg.desc=The §3Shredder§r is a machine that shreds resourses into their powder form, or in many cases, their crafting materials. It can also be used to double ores.%n%n§2It needs two shredder blades (§6desh§r blades never break) and processes one item from every slot at the same time.

# Quest: Soldering Station
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHA.name=Паяльна станція
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHA.desc=The §3Soldering Station§r is the machine in which §6§rcircuit components§r can be combined§6§r into §6Circuits§r and where §6Machine Upgrades§r can be created. Most circuits consume §6lead solder§r - keep lead on hand.

# Quest: Crucible
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHQ.name=Тигель
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHQ.desc=The §3Crucible§r is an important machine as it is the central component of metallurgy. It is used as a method of ore processing, alloying, and metal casting. It requires an external heat source to melt the inputs into liquids and when filled, it emits a consistent amount of soot that can cause a fair amount of pollution that cannot be mitigated. Some alloys, as mentioned before, can be made alternatively using a §3Blast Furnace§r, however this is generally slower. For example, high-speed steel is alloyed from steel, tungsten and cobalt and must be cast, and stainless steel can be made here or in a blast furnace.%n%n[F1] For more information.

# Quest: Arc Welder
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHw.name=Дуговий зварювальник
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHw.desc=The §3Arc Welder§r is a machine needed for the creation of many components, such as §6Welded Plates§r, §6Missile Parts§r and more. Some Recipes will require a fluid inserted into the welder to work. Make one §6dense copper or gold wire§r here first - it unlocks the crucible casting mold.

# Quest: Combination Oven
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIQ.name=Коксова піч
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIQ.desc=The §3Combination Oven§r is a unique type of furnace that transforms items into their respective product and produce liquid byproducts. It needs heat from below (firebox or heating oven). For example, coal gives creosote and coke, logs or sawdust give wood oil, cryolite gives aluminium.

# Quest: Chemical Plant
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIg.name=Хімічний комплекс
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIg.desc=The §3Chemical Plant§r is a machine needed for several processes, turning fluids into other fluids, synthesis of different compounds, etc. Key early recipes: desh, polymer, hydrogen peroxide and sulfuric acid. Like the §3Assembly Machine§r, recipes can be selected entirely within the GUI.

# Quest: Strand Caster
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJA.name=Машина безперервного лиття заготовок
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJA.desc=§3Машина безперервного лиття заготовок§r — це велика чаша, яка дозволяє виготовляти предмети партіями по 9 штук. Для роботи пристрою також потрібна §bВода§r, з якої вона виробляє §bПару низького тиску§r, яка може бути перетворена назад на воду.

# Quest: High-Speed Steel
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJQ.name=Швидкорізальна сталь
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJQ.desc=§6High-speed steel§r is an advanced and specialized form of standard steel. It is alloyed from §6steel§r, §6tungsten§r and §6cobalt§r in a §3Crucible§r and must be cast from liquid metal. It used in many recipes, such as the §3Oil Derrick§r and the §3Industrial Mixer§r.

# Quest: Settings Tool
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMQ.name=Settings Tool
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMQ.desc=The §6Settings Tool§r is used to copy settings of machines. It is especially useful when making large refineries.

# Quest: Backpacks and Exploration
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOQ.name=Backpacks and Exploration
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOQ.desc=Exploration is an important part of the §dNTM§r experience as salvaging abandoned structures is a viable strategy for early game. Large caverns also exist in this modpack, so dont hesistate going caving.%n%n§dBackpacks§r will be a massive help, as they can be used to carry around more loot. Crates can also be used to transport items, but backpacks also come packed with dedicated tool slots, a crafting table, a bed aswell as fluid tanks.%n%nA §dNature's Compass§r can be used to easily locate biomes of interest.%n%nA §6Hose§r can be used to quickly input and output fluids stored in the backpack.

# Quest: Rotary Furnace
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPQ.name=Rotary Furnace
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPQ.desc=The §3Rotary Furnace§r is a large furnace which is powered by both §bSteam§r and §6§rsolid fuel. §rIt outputs molten material which can be cast similarly to the outputs of the §3Crucible§r and §3Arc Furnace§r. The Rotary Furnace is the only machine that can produce §6Saturnite§r and §6Weapon Steel§r. It outputs §blow-pressure steam§r (vent it or condense it back), has alternate §6gunmetal§r and §6steel§r recipes, and §6Weapon Steel§r additionally requires §bcoker gas§r from a §3Coker Unit§r.

# Quest: Boiler and Steam Condenser
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVQ.name=Boiler and Steam Condenser
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVQ.desc=The §3Boiler§r, when receiving heat from below, heats up fluids. Two important uses of the boiler are for §bSteam§r and §bOil§r processing which will come later on. Standard copper Boilers can explode if their output is full, while industrial ones simply stop; destroyed boilers cannot be repaired. Set the input fluid with a §6Fluid Identifier§r.%n%nSteam, when used by machines, such as reactors sending steam through §3Turbines§r or §3Cracking Towers§r produce §bLow-Pressure Steam§r. The low-pressure steam can be recycled back to retrieve 100%% of the water by using a §3Steam Condenser§r. Closed water loops are recommended for reactors.

# Quest: Solar Tower Boiler
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYg.name=Solar Tower Boiler
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYg.desc=The §3Solar Tower Boiler§r is an earlygame machine that can use sunlight from heliostat mirrors to boil water and therefore turn it into steam.%n%nThe Solar Tower Boiler gets heat from heliostat mirrors pointed at it. Aiming a mirror at the boiler can be done using the mirror adjustment tool, right-click on the boiler will save its position to the tool, and subsequently clicking on mirrors will aim them at the linked boiler. The maximum range for mirrors is 25 blocks, mirror efficiency does not degrade with range. A boiler consumes 1mB of water for every 12.5 mirrors each tick at full sunlight level, and 100mB of steam per mB of water consumed. However, the water consumption rate is rounded down to the millibucket. Thus it takes 13 mirrors to raise your first 100mB/t of steam, 12 mirrors for the next hundred, then 13, 12, and so on.%n%nAs the heat provided by each mirror is based on sunlight, mirrors with solid blocks above them will not work, and the amount of heat diminishes with the amount of light in the evening until it produces no heat at night.%n%nThe solar tower boiler can only produce regular steam, and thus the liquid type cannot be changed using fluid identifiers.

# Quest: Ammo Press and Guns
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaA.name=Ammo Press and Guns
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaA.desc=With casting available through the §3Crucible§r, many gun parts can now be created such as §6Barrels§r and §6Grips§r. An §3Ammo Press§r is used to create the various ammunitions guns use.%n%nA §3Weapon Modification Table§r can be used to install weapon mods, such as §6Silencers§r and §6Scopes§r.%n%nThe §6Bullet Casing Bag§r will retrieve some of the casings when guns are fired. Start with black-powder loads; HE, express and starmetal rounds wear guns faster, starmetal is for the anti-materiel rifle only, and smokeless magnum shot is notably stronger than black-powder magnum.

# Quest: Mining Charge
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhQ.name=Mining Charge
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhQ.desc=The §3Mining Charge§r is an explosive made with the express purpose of mining, as such it's commonly used to mine depth ores, since it doesn't destroy drops, before getting a pickaxe that can do the same. Mining Charges are a great way of obtaining §6Zirconium§r from depth ores for nuclear fuel rods.%n%nIt has an explosion radius of about 3 blocks and explodes instantly upon being powered by redstone, while exploding it does no damage to entities.%n%nThere are two other variants of this, being the §3Timed Mining Charge§r and the §b§3Semtex Mining Charge§r, they are both timed explosives with the semtex one being stronger than the regular one and having §eFortune 3§r, meanwhile the timed mining charge does not seem to have enhanced capabilities, other than being timed and thus more convinient to use.

# Quest: Steel Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuw.name=Steel Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuw.desc=An upgraded version of the §3Anvil§r, [T2], which unlocks additional recipes. It works like the basic anvil (top slots smithing, bottom construction) with more recipes.

# Quest: Pollution and Smokestack
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAyg.name=Pollution and Smokestack
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAyg.desc=§6Pollution§r is a mechanic affecting several machines related to industrialization. It must be properly mitigated, lest suffer the consequences of a polluted world. There are 3 subtypes of pollution - soot, poison and heavy metal.%n%n§6Soot§r is most common, produced by fossil fuel burning and some other sources. It increases generic mob health and strength. At high enough levels, it becomes visible as smog.%n%n§6Poison§r harms unprotected entities at high enough levels, and is produced exclusively as the consequence from spilling fluids such as CO2 or various oil products.%n%n§6Heavy metal§r comes from the combustion of leaded fuels. It also increases mob strength, but also harms them at high enough levels.%n%nIt can also be harmful to entities and players if they aren't wearing gas protection.%n%nCompatible machines can be connected to special exhaust pipes, which are effectively specialized box-ducts, to output to a §6Smokestack§r to reduce the amount of pollution.%n%nThe §3Smokestack§r is used to reduce pollution made from machines. §3Exhaust Pipes§r, made in anvils, can be used to transport the fumes to the Smokestack. The §3Industrial Smokestack§r is needed to produce §6Fine Soot§r, required for making §6Fullerite§r in the late game.%n%nAn §3Ashpit§r can be installed beneath the Smokestack which will collect §6Ash§r, that can be used as a cheap black dye alternative as well as in the creation of §6Industrial Fertilizer§r.

# Quest: Player Decontaminator
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABCw.name=Player Decontaminator
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABCw.desc=The §3Player Decontaminator§r will remove Rads received while standing on it. It can be very cost efficient, as other methods such as §6RadAways§r require constant replenishment.

# Quest: Machine Upgrade Template
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABSA.name=Machine Upgrade Template
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABSA.desc=The §6Machine Upgrade Template§r is the baseline for all machine upgrades. Machine upgrades are not only used to increase the efficiency of machines but also to unlock new functions.

# Quest: Drainage Pipe
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABdg.name=Drainage Pipe
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABdg.desc=The §3Drainage Pipe§r allows the dumping of fluids and gasses into the environment at the cost of pollution.

# Quest: Do a Barrel!
betterquesting.quest.Ba9zHp22SvGkBCr8xF5oQQ.name=Do a Barrel!
betterquesting.quest.Ba9zHp22SvGkBCr8xF5oQQ.desc=§3Barrels§r are storage blocks that can hold both fluids and solid blocks. Wooden barrels will leak liquids over time and burn down if filled with lava, so use a stone barrel for those recipes.%n%nBarrels placed under open sky will collect rainwater during downfall.%n%nWhen filled with organic material, a barrel will begin composting once completely full. After roughly 100 seconds it produces a dirt block, ejected by right-clicking. Dirt left near mycelium will slowly convert into a mycelium block, no Silk Touch needed.%n%nA wooden barrel filled with §bWater§r placed next to cobblestone will slowly convert it into mossy cobblestone, costing §e100 mB§r per block. The surrounding blocks must be unaffected by rain. Placing a barrel on mycelium converts its water into §5Witch Water§r, though the barrel itself may disappear in the process. Water flowing above a barrel filled with lava transforms into obsidian.%n%nStone barrels can spawn creatures when tapped with a doll: a barrel of lava with an Angry Doll summons a Blaze, and a barrel of §5Witch Water§r with a Creepy Doll summons an Enderman.%n%nBarrels can convert items using fluids: §5Witch Water§r turns sand into soul sand, lava turns redstone into netherrack or glowstone dust into end stone, and §bWater§r can turn dust into clay, milk into slime balls, or mushroom stew into §5Witch Water§r.%n%n§2Hoppers can be used to insert and eject items from barrels, making composting easy to automate.§r

# Quest: Sieving
betterquesting.quest.CAGBwqHLQBStKodq03kwyw.name=Sieving
betterquesting.quest.CAGBwqHLQBStKodq03kwyw.desc=The §3Sieve§r filters gravel, dirt, stone, and other blocks to yield useful material fragments - including iron, copper, lead, and more.%n%nUse §3Heavy Sieve§r with §6Compressed Blocks§r to get more fragments.%n%n§2Use NEI to list all possible drops.

# Quest: Charm of Protection
betterquesting.quest.D0bv2vfWSkK1soyqHDwqjQ.name=Charm of Protection
betterquesting.quest.D0bv2vfWSkK1soyqHDwqjQ.desc=The §6Charm of Protection§r diverts meteorites away from the player and prevents them from destoying blocks. It is recommended that one is obtained as soon as possible as to prevent costly damages in the future.

# Quest: Diesel Generator
betterquesting.quest.Eh_ylJU8TiiScjLN2_qmMA.name=Diesel Generator
betterquesting.quest.Eh_ylJU8TiiScjLN2_qmMA.desc=The §3Diesel Generator§r is a compact, single-block generator that burns liquid fuels to produce energy. Its small footprint and compatibility with common oil-processing byproducts make it a strong choice for early- and mid-game power.%n%nIt holds up to §b4,000 mB§r of fluid internally, consumed at a steady rate of §e20 mB/s§r. It also carries a §e50 kHE§r energy buffer - but combustion does not pause when the buffer is full, so any excess energy is wasted. To avoid this, ensure your machines are drawing power consistently.%n%nFuel can be supplied via fluid ducts or by placing barrels in the internal item slots. A §6Fluid Identifier§r can be inserted to lock the accepted fuel type. Not all fuels are equal - effectiveness varies by grade: medium-grade fuels run at §e50%%%%§r efficiency, high-grade at §e75%%§r, and aviation fuels at just §e10%%§r. Low-grade and gaseous fuels are rejected entirely. It can be stopped with a redstone signal.%n%n§2Tip: High-grade fuels like diesel, gasoline, and biofuel get the best return - prioritize refining your oil into these where possible.§r

# Quest: Wood-Burning Generator
betterquesting.quest.Ek7Xr3XfSm-U7BYuBOACSA.name=Wood-Burning Generator
betterquesting.quest.Ek7Xr3XfSm-U7BYuBOACSA.desc=The §3Wood-Burning Generator§r is basic method of producing energy by burning wood. It can run on any burnable items but provides burn time bonuses to logs and wood. It can also run on any flammable fuel by clicking on the arrow below the on/off switch, but it is considerably more inefficient than other fluid burning generators.%n%nBurning logs in the generator produces §e2kHE/s.§r

# Quest: Flint Tools
betterquesting.quest.F5fyyqAZREWe-rhgYcbXZg.name=Flint Tools
betterquesting.quest.F5fyyqAZREWe-rhgYcbXZg.desc=§6Flint Tools§r are required to obtain first wood and stone. Break some tree leaves and get saplings, to recraft them into sticks.%n%nAxes automatically break tree blocks from top to bottom to prevent floating trees. Hold Shift to disable this and break blocks normally.

# Quest: Steel Furnace
betterquesting.quest.GOACXA8jRc-SMNzk2CsNUQ.name=Сталева піч
betterquesting.quest.GOACXA8jRc-SMNzk2CsNUQ.desc=§3Сталева піч§r, на відміну від інших печей, працює на §eTU§r. Вона також може обробляти до 3 предметів одночасно, але кожен слот споживає більше TU, що робить її повільною без потужного джерела тепла. Вона також має бонусний вихід для руд та деревини, де кожен переплавлений предмет додає §e25%%§r до лічильника бонусного виходу, що означає, що кожні 4 предмети дають додатковий 5-й предмет безкоштовно (§e+15 предметів з одного стака§r).

# Quest: Electric Furnace
betterquesting.quest.HONUf7SQRl-jcf3BC5242A.name=Електрична піч
betterquesting.quest.HONUf7SQRl-jcf3BC5242A.desc=§3Електрична піч§r - це піч, що працює на електроенергії. Вона дещо швидша за стандартну піч без модернізацій. Вона споживає від §e1 kHE/s§r без модернізацій до §e4 kHE/s§r.%n%nОскільки вона лише трохи швидша за стандартну піч, її не часто використовують після початкової стадії гри, але її можна застосовувати в автоматизації, якщо швидкість не є головним пріоритетом.

# Quest: Storage Drawer Keys
betterquesting.quest.HTaQEgJ8QCWYNMB8n7Awug.name=Ключі від шухляд
betterquesting.quest.HTaQEgJ8QCWYNMB8n7Awug.desc=§dКлючі від шухляд§r можна використовувати для різних налаштувань ящиків.%n%n§dКлюч блокування§r блокує ящики, тому в порожній ящик неможливо додати нові типи предметів.%n%n§dКлюч приховування§r приховує іконки предметів у ящиках.%n%n§dКлюч кількості§r показує кількість предметів у ящиках.%n%n§dПерсональний ключ§r захищає ящики від інших гравців (поза межами претензій). %n

# Quest: Bobmazon
betterquesting.quest.IAP1AGA2TV-TtMAv_QMrIA.name=Бобмазон
betterquesting.quest.IAP1AGA2TV-TtMAv_QMrIA.desc=§6Бобмазон§r - це ігровий магазин, де гравці можуть витрачати §6Кришки від пляшок§r на придбання різноманітних предметів, таких як будівельні блоки, рослини, ресурси та багато іншого. Щоб придбати предмети, потрібно розблокувати досягнення, перелічені нижче як «Рейтинги».

# Quest: Servo Set
betterquesting.quest.IZ2vyQHDRneeRMbWhPrzXw.name=Servo Set
betterquesting.quest.IZ2vyQHDRneeRMbWhPrzXw.desc=The §6Servo Set§r is an armor modification which grants various buffs, such as §eHaste§r, §eStrength§r, §eSpeed§r and §eJump Boost§r. It can be equiped both for the chestplate and leggings.%n%nIt can later be upgraded with §6Desh§r to further boost its buffs.

# Quest: Charcoal Automation
betterquesting.quest.ItX_qnZpQCuDSxSoHuKmsA.name=Автоматизація деревного вугілля
betterquesting.quest.ItX_qnZpQCuDSxSoHuKmsA.desc=§6Wood§r obtained from a tree farm can be smelted or processed in a §3Combination Oven§r to produce §6Charcoal§r, which has many uses, such as fuel for §3Furnaces§r, §6Flux§r or §6Carbon§r in a Crucible for §6Steel§r production, or even §6Gunpowder§r for ammunition.

# Quest: HE to RF Converter
betterquesting.quest.JcBabPI8RzGGmai3SwlcLw.name=Перетворювач HE на RF
betterquesting.quest.JcBabPI8RzGGmai3SwlcLw.desc=§3Перетворювач HE на RF§r перетворює енергію, що генерується машинами NTM, у корисну потужність як для мережі §dMatter Energy Network§r, так і для §dOpenComputers§r. Він має дуже великий внутрішній енергетичний буфер, тому для обмеження пропускної здатності рекомендується використовувати діод.

# Quest: Fluids
betterquesting.quest.K-eTce6PTLGe1htaZlPiHg.name=Fluids
betterquesting.quest.K-eTce6PTLGe1htaZlPiHg.desc=Fluids are measured in §emB§r (§emilli-Buckets§r) and §eB§r (§eBuckets§r).%n%n1 bucket = 1000mB.%n%nThere are two fluid systems - §6Forge Fluids§r, which is the system that most of the mods are using, and §6NTM Fluids§r, which is the fluid system that is exclusive to NTM.%n%nThe §6Multi Fluid Identifier§r is used to select the type of NTM fluid one needs. Shift-Click while holding it to select a fluid.%n%nThose two systems are fully compatible between each other! Feel free to automate your factory with AE2 and other mods!

# Quest: Known Issues
betterquesting.quest.MNH6qakfTrC7Jbky4i_Epw.name=Відомі проблеми
betterquesting.quest.MNH6qakfTrC7Jbky4i_Epw.desc=Not a bug, a &q&zFEATURE§r!%n%nWhen you consume food your hands may shake weirdly, as if Steve was EXTREMELY happy for that lunch.%n%nIf you experience any stutters/micro-lags while playing, try turning Vsync on/off. If that does not help, contact in Discord #help.%n%nCurrently we have no idea how to fix those bugs, but we are trying our best!

# Quest: Additional NTM Modes
betterquesting.quest.MWwrY8PcTaam9T_sc4yDtQ.name=Додаткові режими НТМ
betterquesting.quest.MWwrY8PcTaam9T_sc4yDtQ.desc=§cNTNH§r - це модульний модпак, тож ви можете вільно додавати, видаляти чи змінювати налаштування та моди, якщо це працює!%n%n§dNTM§r пропонує дуже модульний файл конфігурації, який також містить додаткові режими, що можна активувати. Їх можна увімкнути у файлі hbm.cfg.%n%n§2Дорогий режим§r робить усе дорожчим, вимагаючи не лише більше ресурсів, а й нових компонентів. Книга квестів не відображатиме зміни у прогресі, якщо цей режим увімкнено.%n%n§2528 режим§r вводить ворота у вигляді шаблонів, які розблоковуються шляхом знищення певної кількості предметів у §3Знищувач§r. Крім того, виготовлення деяких предметів, переважно схем, тепер залежить від відсотків. Та крім того, є й інші зміни, що ускладнюють гру, такі як поява §6Танталу§r лише у певній зоні, частіша поява наземних мін та те, що всі блоки §dAE2§r §4ВИБУХАЮТЬ§r при використанні.%n%nБагато ймовірностей переробки §3Точного збирача§r значно знижуються при увімкненому дорогому режимі, що значно збільшує ефективну вартість.%n%n§2Режим скаженості§r робить гліфідів дуже великою загрозою, оскільки забруднення тепер робить їх набагато сильнішими та агресивнішими. Нові, більш руйнівні типи гліфідів також стануть більш поширеними. Якщо рівень забруднення досягне достатньо високого рівня, розвідники-гліфіди можуть з’являтися автоматично, тому для запобігання утворенню нових вуликів необхідні автоматизовані системи захисту.%n%n§2Для модів, що передбачають зміни рецептів, рецепти з модпаку потрібно додати заново після створення нової папки hbmrecipes та увімкнення модів.§r %n

# Quest: Charging Station
betterquesting.quest.OlMZZGTaSz6VhzaeJdR6QQ.name=Зарядна станція
betterquesting.quest.OlMZZGTaSz6VhzaeJdR6QQ.desc=§3Зарядна станція§r заряджатиме як електроінструменти, так і електрокостюми, якщо вони знаходяться поруч із нею. Якщо розмістити кілька таких станцій поруч одна з одною, швидкість заряджання предметів збільшиться.

# Quest: Packing Tape
betterquesting.quest.RBJS7D2ATpq7GUingAewuQ.name=Пакувальна стрічка
betterquesting.quest.RBJS7D2ATpq7GUingAewuQ.desc=Завдяки §6Пакувальній стрічці§r можна розкладати та переміщати шухляди, не боячись, що всі речі випадуть на підлогу.

# Quest: Depth Ores
betterquesting.quest.Ss4wOkCPR6OsjwT8BQs1XA.name=Depth Ores
betterquesting.quest.Ss4wOkCPR6OsjwT8BQs1XA.desc=§6Depth Ores§r are large ore deposits found at bedrock level. There are many types of deposits, most of them giving ore crystals which can be smelted for 3 ingots per. §3Mining Charges§r of any kind are required to extract the resources from the depth rock.%n%nTwo important resources found in depth deposits are §6Borax§r, which can later be put in an §3Arc Furnace§r or §3Acidizer§r to yield §6Boron§r used in reactors, and §6Zirconium§r which is used in reactor fuel rods.

# Quest: Cladding
betterquesting.quest.UKkcpXk3SEWHXLIVC5VTDg.name=Покриття
betterquesting.quest.UKkcpXk3SEWHXLIVC5VTDg.desc=§6Cladding§r is one of the most important armor modifications which reduce radiation intake. It can be inserted to all armor pieces. It is crafted with rubber (or latex) and lead.

# Quest: Ore Generation System
betterquesting.quest.VMLB88YjRb26RVJcRmvxeA.name=Система генерації руди
betterquesting.quest.VMLB88YjRb26RVJcRmvxeA.desc=In §6NTNH§r, ore generation has been §ocompletely§r overhauled and is still receiving updates and fixes. If you don’t like it and/or find it too complicated, you have two options:%n1) Report it to us, the developers%n2) Disable the Custom Ore Generation mod and configure ore generation in hbm.cfg to your liking (ask for help with this on the Discord server)%n%n[warn]Important![/warn]%nThe old online Google Docs spreadsheet was DEPRECATED, use the one in the Guide Book.

# Quest: Dosimeter
betterquesting.quest.X1wMtj-xQR6M4Qzm6Rk2vA.name=Дозиметр
betterquesting.quest.X1wMtj-xQR6M4Qzm6Rk2vA.desc=§6Дозиметр§ - це прилад для виявлення радіації та оцінки радіоактивного забруднення.%n%nЗа своїм призначенням він схожий на §6Лічильник Гейгера§, але збирає набагато менше даних - лише загальні показники радіаційного забруднення навколишнього середовища. Доступна лише портативна версія дозиметра. Щоб отримати інформацію про радіацію, клацніть правою кнопкою миші, тримаючи дозиметр.%n%nЯк і лічильник, він видає характерний тріск при виявленні радіації.%n%n§2Максимальне значення радіації, що відображається, становить 3,6 РАД/С.%n%nНе добре, але й не страшно.

# Quest: Borax
betterquesting.quest.X2y9x1t8TU2ou8QN6k-24g.name=Borax
betterquesting.quest.X2y9x1t8TU2ou8QN6k-24g.desc=§6Borax§r is found as depth deposits near bedrock - bring explosives to mine it. It can also be extracted from bedrock ores. Acidize it with §bsulfuric acid§r in an §3Ore Acidizer§r for §6boron§r (best yield with effectiveness upgrades), or run it through an §3Electric Arc Furnace§r. Borax is also an efficient §6flux§r and an ingredient of the §6saturnite§r blend in a §3Rotary Furnace§r (reformate gas, copper and high-speed steel powder).

# Quest: Radial Performance Engine
betterquesting.quest.XNHsXFGWTvW9dhuen9iEFg.name=Двигун з радіальним розташуванням
betterquesting.quest.XNHsXFGWTvW9dhuen9iEFg.desc=§3Двигун з радіальним розташуванням§r - це двигун внутрішнього згоряння, що перетворює рідке паливо на електроенергію. Для роботи йому потрібно щонайменше §e3§r §6поршнів§r, а в гніздах для поршнів можна встановити до §e9§r. Додаткові поршні лінійно збільшують як вихідну потужність, так і витрату палива.%n%nДвигун працює на паливі різних марок з різним коефіцієнтом корисної дії. §bМазут§r та §bПромислове масло§r спалюються з ефективністю §e75%%§r, §bПетроїл§r - з §e50%%§r, а §bДизель§r та §bБензин§r - з §e25%%§r. Авіаційне паливо та газоподібне паливо несумісні. Потужність виводиться з нижньої поверхні, а двигун накопичує всередині до §e250 kHE§r або §e2,5 MHE§r під час роботи на §bСверхпаливі NITAN 100-октан§r.%n%nОднак двигун є найефективнішим із найважчими, найменш рафінованими видами палива. Легші рафіновані палива виробляють менше потужності на мБ, незважаючи на вищий сорт.%n%n§2Вказана ефективність є множником базової енергії згоряння кожного палива. Палива вищого сорту можуть мати вищу базову енергію, тому перевірте показник HE/t у графічному інтерфейсі, перш ніж зупинитися на певному паливі.

# Quest: Hazards
betterquesting.quest.Zd1HNIsxSRees_4of0ezDw.name=Небезпеки
betterquesting.quest.Zd1HNIsxSRees_4of0ezDw.desc=Цей мод додає кілька небезпек навколишнього середовища, які можуть призвести до вашої загибелі, якщо їх ігнорувати.%n%n§6Радіація§r вимірюється в РАД. Ефекти починають проявлятися при рівні §e200 РАД§r і поступово посилюються - миттєва смерть настає при рівні §c1000 РАД§r. Використовуйте §6лічильник Гейгера§r для контролю отриманої дози. Радіаційно-стійка броня та §6Rad-X§r зменшують надходження РАД; §3Дезактиватор гравця§r або §6Антирад§r видаляють накопичену дозу.%n%n§lМезотеліома§r розвивається внаслідок впливу азбесту. Предмети з міткою §c[Містить азбест]§r та певні блоки, такі як хризотил, виділяють частинки азбесту. Без лікування призводить до смерті.%n%n§lЧорні легені§r розвиваються внаслідок впливу вугільного пилу. Основними джерелами є видобуток вугільної руди та перенесення предметів з міткою §c[Вугільний пил]§r. Також є смертельним.%n%nГазова маска одночасно захищає як від мезотеліоми, так і від чорних легеней. Обидві хвороби виліковуються за допомогою §6Ліки від раку SIOX§r або, на початку гри, §6Трав'яна паста§r - остання є слабшою та має побічні ефекти.

# Quest: Stirling Sawmill
betterquesting.quest._qJt02i4ST2iccmkHudKCg.name=Лісопильня Стірлінга
betterquesting.quest._qJt02i4ST2iccmkHudKCg.desc=§3Лісопильня Стірлінга§r використовує тепло для розпилювання дерев'яних виробів, при цьому утворюється §6Тирса§r. Тирсу можна використовувати для отримання §6Паперу§r, а після подальшої обробки в §3Комбінованій печі§r її можна перетворити на §6Деревне вугілля§r.

# Quest: Rock Mill
betterquesting.quest.a45q5izgTseDEdlAlTOVWg.name=Rock Mill
betterquesting.quest.a45q5izgTseDEdlAlTOVWg.desc=The §3Rock Mill§r is an early game material grinding machine which grinds down stones into finer items while producing additional byproducts, such as §6Boron§r, §6Niobium§r and §6Titanium§r. It is also used to get big amounts of §bColloid§r, which can be used for making clay.%n%nThe machine consumes §e500HE/s§r.

# Quest: Chainsaw
betterquesting.quest.bKzHBx2ZTBWFD1BGHBfHWg.name=Бензопила
betterquesting.quest.bKzHBx2ZTBWFD1BGHBfHWg.desc=§l§c§lБільпила.§r%n%nХоча §6Бензопила§r за своїми функціями схожа на §6сокиру§r, її можливості набагато ширші. За замовчуванням бензопила просто видобуває блоки, але вона також має два додаткові режими роботи: §eШовковий дотик§r та §eМасове Видобувництво (5)§r.%n%nВона працює на багатьох видах §bпалива§r (перелік див. в описі предмета). Видобуток одного блоку споживає 1 мБ§r палива.%n%nОкрім свого основного призначення, бензопила також може слугувати непоганою зброєю ближнього бою, оскільки завдає значної шкоди та має модифікатори: §eБільпила§r та §eОбезголовлювач§r.

# Quest: Strawberry Ice Cream
betterquesting.quest.bXgPsVSbTy6Az8yENEF99w.name=Полуничне морозиво
betterquesting.quest.bXgPsVSbTy6Az8yENEF99w.desc=Уявіть собі, що один і той самий хімічний завод використовується як для виробництва сірчаної кислоти, ТАК І для виробництва полуничного морозива...

# Quest: Heating Oven/Firebox
betterquesting.quest.cUWyKdzATTSYaMg1MxZqYw.name=Опалювальна піч/Топка
betterquesting.quest.cUWyKdzATTSYaMg1MxZqYw.desc=The §3Firebox§r and the §3Heating Oven§r are machines capable of producing heat from solid fuels for any machines that require heat to operate.%n%nHeat is measured in §eTU§r (§eThermal Units§r).%n%nBoth machines are similar in operation. In order for them to transfer heat, another machine for receiving the heat must be placed on top, such that the copper heat plate on the receiving machine sits on top of the copper heat plate of the heat producing machine.%n%nOnce constructed, these machines can be filled with solid fuel, which will burn until either the fuel runs out, or the heat buffer is filled. No fuel will be consumed if its buffer is full - as such, both machines are fairly efficient at conserving fuel.%n%nThe primary difference in these two machines lie in their speed: the firebox burns fuel much slower at full efficiency, whilst the heating oven produces five time the heat (but eight times faster). Despite its inefficiency, the heating oven is often preferred for its much higher heat outputs and heat capacity. However, it cannot heat a stirling engine, as its base output (500 TU/t) will automatically over-speed the engine; the heavy stirling engine does not have this issue.%n%nAdditionally, the heating oven can receive heat from other heat producing machines placed underneath it: multiple can be stacked for heat-hungry machines like the crucible. The heat received, however, is halved when transferring to the machine above.

# Quest: Recycling
betterquesting.quest.ceT8V2MeRz2u-FR9Uckarw.name=Перероблення
betterquesting.quest.ceT8V2MeRz2u-FR9Uckarw.desc=Тепер, коли у вас є краще ковадло, Ви можете почати §eпереробляти§r деякі речі, знайдені в підземеллях.

# Quest: NOT FOR CASUALS
betterquesting.quest.dvDFzAjEQVucAjcynrfkhA.name=НЕ ДЛЯ ПОВЕРХНЕВИХ
betterquesting.quest.dvDFzAjEQVucAjcynrfkhA.desc=Цей модпак - це §cСКЛАДНО§r, і він постійно оновлюється, тож готуйтеся до того, що вам добряче надіруть дупу.

# Quest: Numbers in the Corner?
betterquesting.quest.eTdu9EpCStqHAh8ubFCmQw.name=Numbers in the Corner?
betterquesting.quest.eTdu9EpCStqHAh8ubFCmQw.desc=What's with the §6numbers in the corner§r? That is the §dIn-Game Info (IGI)§r mod. Some of the info it gives is useful right away, some of it shines later on in progression.%n%nIf you want to hide it, type "§6/igi disable§r"§r in the chat. Type "§6/igi enable§r" if you want to turn it back on.%n%nThe command "§6/igi config§r" opens the configuration window to control its position, scale, and size.%n%nIf you need suggestions on solving TPS/FPS problems, feel free to ask for help in the NTNH Discord.

# Quest: Dairy Processing Tank
betterquesting.quest.fkSdZg90QZ6gAvDWMSZbbQ.name=Dairy Processing Tank
betterquesting.quest.fkSdZg90QZ6gAvDWMSZbbQ.desc=The §3Dairy Processing Tank§r, while it can be crafted earlier, is very useful on Minmus because of the infinite §bMilk§r production from §3Pumps§r. It can be used to process milk into different liquids, which can then be used to make food items.

# Quest: Better Furnaces
betterquesting.quest.gKQiP_zES4KokMmon9bDQg.name=Better Furnaces
betterquesting.quest.gKQiP_zES4KokMmon9bDQg.desc=The §3Bricked Furnace§r is almost the same as the vanilla furnace, but it can smelt construction materials faster, such as §6Sand§r and §6Cobblestone§r being smelted at double the speed. §6Clay§r and §6Fire Clay§r can be smelted at §e§rquadruple§r the speed, which means that making a full brick block can be done within a vanilla furnace operation. It can also make §6Charcoal§r at double the speed. It can also collect Ashes from burnt fuel.%n%nThe §3Iron Furnace§r has the base smelting speed §e20%%§r faster than the vanilla furnace, which means it can complete an operation within 8 seconds instead of 10 seconds. Besides being able to smelt faster, it consumes fuel only during operation, so the fuel is never wasted. It also has burn time bonuses for various kinds of fuel, ranging from §e+25%%§r for lignite to §e+100%%§r for solid fuel.%n%n§dEt Futurum Requiem§r also backports modern furnaces, such as the §3Smoker§r, which cooks food faster, and the §3Blast Furnace§r, which smelts ores faster. Note: this is not the NTM §3Blast Furnace§r alloy furnace.

# Quest: Infinite Water Sources
betterquesting.quest.gWyCk5zlQlWAPGdwFXhTaQ.name=Infinite Water Sources
betterquesting.quest.gWyCk5zlQlWAPGdwFXhTaQ.desc=Tired of using buckets to give §bWater§r to your machines? Try using water pumps or infinite water tanks!%n%n§6Infinite Water Tank§r will give §e50mb/t%n%n§6Large Infinite Water Tank§r will give §e500mb/t%n%n§6Steam-Powered Groundwater Pump§r will give §e1000mb/t§r but requires §bSteam§r to operate (which is obvious). Pumps must sit below Y:70; the Electric Groundwater Pump moves up to 10,000 mB/t.

# Quest: Geological Survey
betterquesting.quest.i978VfQyRr6TncUvwFr6iA.name=Geological Survey
betterquesting.quest.i978VfQyRr6TncUvwFr6iA.desc=This is an advanced mineral exploration technique for professional miners, providing very detailed information. The §3Geological Surveyor§r machine uses a controlled explosion to send seismic waves into the ground, and by analysing the echoes that come back, builds a map of underground ore densities.%n%nAs well as the Geological Surveyor itself, you will also need the following:%n%n1. At least 3 §3Geophones§r placed in a suitable arrangement around the Geological Surveyor. The geophones must be within 16 blocks of the Surveyor, but no closer than 8 blocks to the Surveyor or to each other.%n2. Supplies of §6P§6aper, Ink§r and §6Gunpowder§r in the appropriate slots of the Surveyor.%n%nWhen all the necessary conditions are satisfied, the Surveyor wil show "§6Ready§r" in the GUI. The Surveyor is trigged by a button in its GUI or redstone signal.%n%nAnalysing the results and printing the map will take several seconds, during which time the machine will show a flashing §agreen light§r. When finished, two steady green lights will appear. Then the results can be seen at your World Map (default keybind is M).%n%nOn the left there is a button to toggle the geological survey map. Shift-clicking that button will open a selection menu, where you can select the ores that you want to be displayed.%n%nA §cred light§r indicates an error condition; open the GUI to find out more information.%n%n§2Note: there are several tiers of this machine, the higher the level is the more accurate the map is.

# Quest: Earth? Fake news
betterquesting.quest.k52bjd5MTbefEXwVh0HLiw.name=Earth? Fake news
betterquesting.quest.k52bjd5MTbefEXwVh0HLiw.desc=This modpack makes it possible to complete the entire game in §6Martian mode§r! If you notice any gaps in the progression or logic, please post in the #help channel on the NTNH Discord server.

# Quest: Oily Sand
betterquesting.quest.kdNKd7NDSPiURFtLonc50g.name=Oily Sand
betterquesting.quest.kdNKd7NDSPiURFtLonc50g.desc=§6Oily Sand§r is a surface-level block that generates among normal sand, typically in deserts. It acts as a marker for §bBedrock Oil§r deposits directly beneath it - if you find it, there is oil underground.%n%nShred polluted blocks from fracking in a §3Shredder§r into §6oily scraps§r, then treat them with §bhigh-performance solvent§r in an §3Ore Acidizer§r to obtain §6Arsenic§r - a really important mid-game material.

# Quest: Highway To Hell
betterquesting.quest.ljMurUJIT7OuwaBx_fb3EA.name=Highway To Hell
betterquesting.quest.ljMurUJIT7OuwaBx_fb3EA.desc=§6The Nether§r is §c§lACTUALLY HOT§r causing your skin to burn.%n%n§6Fire Proximity Armor Set§r is essential for your first Nerther trip, as it protects you from burning fire.

# Quest: Blood Moon
betterquesting.quest.npgCRfZdSFeBom6eL3qIMg.name=Blood Moon
betterquesting.quest.npgCRfZdSFeBom6eL3qIMg.desc=§dRandomThings§r adds §cBlood Moons§r, semi-rare events where mob spawning is increased and the player cant sleep. Blood Moons can be quite useful, if one is prepared, as rare mob drops such as §6Launch Codes§r and §6Geiger Counters§r can be obtained early on.

# Quest: The Actual Beginning
betterquesting.quest.npi9qvVzRleG6SsA5DQozg.name=The Actual Beginning
betterquesting.quest.npi9qvVzRleG6SsA5DQozg.desc=Now you are ready to fully begin your journey in this modpack! Happy gaming!

# Quest: Graphite
betterquesting.quest.pbwyXfgDRaCxA1R8YmlTIQ.name=Graphite
betterquesting.quest.pbwyXfgDRaCxA1R8YmlTIQ.desc=§6Graphite§r is a crystalline carbon allotrope, consisting of stacked layers of graphene. Graphite is the most stable form of carbon, and is useful in many environments. It's ability to moderate neutrons makes it indispensable for §3nuclear reactors§r that rely on thermal neutrons to maintain criticality. It's ability to withstand high temperatures and electrical conductivity make it useful as electrodes in the §3Arc Furnace§r and §3Arc Welder§r. Press §6coke§r to make it; it is also used as carbon in crucible recipes.

# Quest: From Flint to Oil - USA Simulator
betterquesting.quest.rKlGBLXDR2CgX_rUy5rBVw.name=From Flint to Oil - USA Simulator
betterquesting.quest.rKlGBLXDR2CgX_rUy5rBVw.desc=The §6Oil Reservoir Detector§r will help one in the search for an §eOil Deposit§r by pointing it out in chat. Leave the deposit in place and build a §3Derrick§r or §3Pumpjack§r on the surface above it; the detector scans a small radius and signals when a deposit is directly below.

# Quest: Long Distance Energy Transportation
betterquesting.quest.s8lSFTDKSpqK44PLhdfusw.name=Long Distance Energy Transportation
betterquesting.quest.s8lSFTDKSpqK44PLhdfusw.desc=For greater distances, and improved aesthetics, a new distribution node is available, the §3Large Electricity Pylon§r.%n%n§3Substations§r are needed to step up/down the voltage that the line carries.%n%nThese Pylons can prove useful as favorable §eBedrock Ore§r or §eOil deposits§r may be located far away from the main base.%n

# Quest: Primitive Crucible
betterquesting.quest.wSdG_vGlTD-9Q8OW6Bzeiw.name=Primitive Crucible
betterquesting.quest.wSdG_vGlTD-9Q8OW6Bzeiw.desc=The §3Crucible§r is a block from §dEx Nihilo§r used to melt solid blocks down into fluids. It is crafted first as an §6Unfired Crucible§r from §6Porcelain Clay§r, then fired in a furnace to produce a usable §3Crucible§r.%n%nTo operate it, place the §3Crucible§r above a heat source and right-click it with an eligible block to load it. The block will slowly melt into fluid over time. The speed of melting depends entirely on the heat source below - stronger heat sources melt faster. Burning §6Netherrack§r is among the most efficient vanilla options.%n%nThe primary output is §blava§r, produced by melting cobblestone, stone, and similar blocks. The §3Crucible§r can hold fluids indefinitely, making it a cheap fluid storage vessel in a pinch. Drain it using fluid pipes connected to its side or bottom.%n%n§2A bank of Crucibles over burning Netherrack is a reliable early lava farm.

# Quest: Air Intake
betterquesting.quest.yFAvMtetRDaFwz6i_ry-RQ.name=Air Intake
betterquesting.quest.yFAvMtetRDaFwz6i_ry-RQ.desc=The §3Air Intake§r, when powered, produces §bCompressed Air§r needed in §3Pneumatic Pipes§r and §bHot Air Blast§r.

# Quest: Silkworm
betterquesting.quest.yfQ7hs9tTwSE5FpNCoeGAA.name=Silkworm
betterquesting.quest.yfQ7hs9tTwSE5FpNCoeGAA.desc=§6Silkworms§r are items from §dEx Nihilo§r and the primary way to produce §6String§r on resource-limited maps. They cannot be crafted - the only way to obtain one is as a rare drop when breaking leaves with a §6Crook§r.%n%nTo use a §6Silkworm§r, right-click it onto any leaves block. The leaves will slowly become infested, turning white over time, and the infestation will spread on its own to adjacent leaves. Fully white leaves produce more §6String§r than partially infested ones, so it is worth waiting.%n%nOnce the leaves are fully infested, break them with a §6Crook§r or your fist to collect §6String§r and additional §6Silkworms§r, keeping the process renewable. Note that infested leaves do not drop saplings or apples, so keep spare saplings set aside before%ninfesting a tree.%n%n§2Silkworms can also be composted in a Barrel if you have a surplus.

# Quest: Industrial Hemp & Mustard Willow
betterquesting.quest.ztJLZeOsSq6hpRyKY55CDg.name=Industrial Hemp & Mustard Willow
betterquesting.quest.ztJLZeOsSq6hpRyKY55CDg.desc=Walking around the world, you can find a §6Mustard Willow§r on dead or §6Oily Dirt§r. The willow itself will not be needed anytime soon, but it is better to collect it and the soil underneath it.%n%n§6Industrial Hemp§r is used to craft ropes, strings and biomass.


## Quest Line: LV2 - Oil Age
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQ.name=LV2 - Oil Age
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQ.desc=Process Oil and begin Bedrock Ore Harvesting. This chapter revolves around the refining of Oil, aswell as the creation of plastics, more advanced circuits and other strong materials.

# Quest: Balefire
betterquesting.quest.8OusetROQiyH-66QbewmNQ.name=Balefire
betterquesting.quest.8OusetROQiyH-66QbewmNQ.desc=§6Багаття§r — це надзвичайно радіоактивна речовина, яку можна використовувати для виготовлення потужного палива для §3РБМК§r, а також §bРакетне жар-паливо§r для виробництва електроенергії. Для зберігання цієї речовини необхідне обладнання з високою радіаційною стійкістю. §6Термоядерний попіл§r можна стабільно отримувати як побічний продукт при виробництві §bАнтиматерії — ракетного жар-палива§r.%n%nВисокотехнологічний пристрій для знешкодження бомб дозволяє вилучати осколки Багаття з нерозірваних бомб.

# Quest: Delinquent 2: Delinquent Harder
betterquesting.quest.8R4pAa2BSWGGBdYOaobEMA.name=Delinquent 2: Delinquent Harder
betterquesting.quest.8R4pAa2BSWGGBdYOaobEMA.desc=Be meaner.

# Quest: Aluminium Processing
betterquesting.quest.8Z2F5EPIRPGvasjKDWd4tA.name=Aluminium Processing
betterquesting.quest.8Z2F5EPIRPGvasjKDWd4tA.desc=§6Bauxite§r and §6Cryolite§r can be further processed to obtain §6Aluminium§r, with additional byproducts of §6Iron§r, §6Titanium§r and §bMercury§r.

# Quest: Cyclotron
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1g.name=Cyclotron
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1g.desc=The §3Cyclotron§r is a machine that bombards element powders with element boxes to get heavier elements. Operating the machine will consume§e 20MHE/s§r.%n%nIt can also create §bAntimatter§r as a byproduct for certain operations, which makes it a reliable but expensive method of large-scale advanced material production.%n%n§2Consider installing the highest level of Power Saving and Speed upgrades to reduce both recipe time and power consumption.§r

# Quest: Desh Servo Set
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACw.name=Desh Servo Set
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACw.desc=§6Desh Servos§r are an armor modification which give incredibely strong buffs when used, such as increased strength, mining speed and jump boost.

# Quest: M1TTY Environment Suit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADg.name=M1TTY Environment Suit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADg.desc=The §6M1TTY Environment Suit§r is a cheap electric armor set that comes with many abilities. It is an excellent armor set for exploring as it comes with very high speed buffs as well as fast swimming speed.

# Quest: Antimatter
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGw.name=Антиматерія
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGw.desc=§bАнтиматерія§r — це небезпечна речовина, яку можна отримати за допомогою §3Циклотрона§r або §3Прискорювача частинок§r. Якщо її впустити на підлогу, відбудеться потужний вибух. Антиматерію неможливо зберігати у звичайних резервуарах, тому для цього потрібен §3Магнітний контейнер антиматерії§r.

# Quest: Electric Arc Furnace
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHg.name=Електродугова піч
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHg.desc=§3Електродугова піч§r — це велика автоматизована багатоблокова установка, яка може виконувати функції §3тигля§r та автоматизованої плавильної печі; вона є необхідною для просування в грі, оскільки це єдиний пристрій, здатний виробляти §6кремній§r з різних джерел, таких як §6пісок§r, §6кремень§r, §6скловолокно§r та §6азбест§r.%n%nДля роботи цієї машини потрібні як електроенергія, так і виготовлені §7§6Електроди§r. Щодо електроенергії, машина має максимальну ємність накопичення §e2,5MHE§r і споживає §e20kHE/s§r під час роботи, що робить її досить енергоємною. Щодо електродів, необхідних для роботи, доступні чотири типи, і для запуску машини необхідно встановити хоча б три.%n%nЦя машина може працювати у двох різних режимах: «Твердий» режим, який є найпростішим у налаштуванні та використанні, чудово підходить для початкового виготовлення, та «Рідкий» режим, який виробляє розплавлені руди, що піддаються литтю, подібно до тигля, з невеликим бонусом до виходу, що підвищує ефективність видобутку з різних руд.

# Quest: Integrated Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIA.name=Плата інтегральної схеми
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIA.desc=§6Плата інтегральної схеми§r є першою друкованою платою, у якій застосовано §6Кремній§r; вона широко використовується в машинах середини гри, пристроях автоматизації, ракетах та різних невеликих приладах, таких як §6лічильник Гейгера§r.

# Quest: Military Grade Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIw.name=Друкована плата військового класу
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIw.desc=§6Військова друкована плата§r — це сучасна друкована плата, яка використовується в більш складних машинах, таких як §3Газова центрифуга§r.

# Quest: Impact Drill
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKQ.name=Ударна дриль
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKQ.desc=«§6Ударна дриль§r» — це електричне кайло, яке має вбудовані зачарування та здібності. Це дуже корисний інструмент, який значно підвищить ефективність видобутку корисних копалин.%n%nАналогічні електричні інструменти існують також для сокири та лопати.

# Quest: Derrick
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKw.name=Вишка
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKw.desc=§3Нафтова вишка§r видобуває §bсиру нафту§r та §6§bприродний газ§r із §eнафтових родовищ§r, що знаходяться безпосередньо під нею. Після підключення до джерела живлення вона почне бурити вниз, доки не досягне межі або не натрапить на нафтове родовище. Після виявлення родовища вона буде безперервно видобувати з нього нафту та газ, доки родовище не буде повністю вичерпано.

# Quest: Bedrock Ore Processing
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALA.name=Переробка руди з корінних порід
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALA.desc=§eBedrock Ore Deposits§r are an infinite source of resources which can be obtained by using a §3Large Mining Drill§r and a §3Bedrock Ore Processor§r.%n%nOperating the drill will consume§e 200kHE/s§r.%n%nBefore excavation can happen, the §eDepth Rock§r covering the bedrock ore deposit needs to be removed. An easy way of doing that is blowing up the rock with §6Mining Charges§r.%n%nThe large mining drill is used to excavate §6Raw Bedrock Ores§r from their deposits. The drill requires a §6Drillbit§r to work§r, which can be upgraded to increase the speed at which it operates at. §eFortune§r on a drillbit affects the quality of mined bedrock ore, each level of fortune adds §e10%%§r of the value to the item.%n%nThe bedrock ore processor takes §6§rraw bedrock ore obtained from the drill and breaks it down into smaller pieces, each with different products that can be obtained from them. %n§a§bOre Slop§r, which is created when the machine is operating, can be processed into many useful products, especially when it is sent through an §3Electrolysis Machine§r.%n%nThe §6Bedrock Ore Density Scanner§r shows information on the composition of Bedrock Ore deposits.%n%nBedrock ore processing can be both an energy and resource expensive operation so it is recommended that it is explored after having good infrastructure. Ore-acidizer yields rise with solvent tiers up to §bhigh-performance solvent§r (reformate gas + chlorine).%n%n§2Consider adding a Power Saving Upgrade to the drill as it only reduces power without affecting the mining speed. Additionally, installing an Effectiveness Upgrade on the ore slopper will make it give out more resourses.§r§r

# Quest: Basic Oil Processing
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALw.name=Базова переробка нафти
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALw.desc=Before §bCrude Oil§r can be processed, it must be heated up in a §3Boiler§r.%n%nThe §3Oil Refinery§r splits Hot Crude Oil(or later on §bCracked§r) into four different fluid products and one solid byproduct.%n%nAfter that, those fluids can be sent through a §3Fractioning Tower§r to obtain different kinds of fuels, such as §bKerosene§r and §bDiesel§r. A §3Fractioning Tower Separator§r can be used to stack fractioning towers ontop of eachother. Set the boiler and fractioning-tower inputs with a §6Fluid Identifier§r (lowest tower segment), heat the boiler with a firebox or similar, and pipe §bhot crude oil§r to the refinery.%n

# Quest: Polymer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg.name=Полімер
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg.desc=§6Polymer§r is a basic plastic material needed for many recipes. Important uses of it are the §3Centrifuge§r, the §3Catalytic Cracking Tower§r and the §3Electric Arc Furnace§r. It requires §bpetroleum gas§r from basic oil refining and is fully interchangeable with §6Bakelite§r.

# Quest: Catalytic Cracking Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOw.name=Колона каталітичного крекінгу
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOw.desc=The §3Catalytic Cracking Tower§r is a large oil processing multiblock machine which produces many fluids, such as §bAromatic Hydrocarbons§r used for §6Bakelite§r. It consumes §bsteam§r and emits §blow-pressure steam§r - condense it back into water for a closed loop; set the input with a §6Fluid Identifier§r.

# Quest: Desh Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPA.name=Деш ковадло
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPA.desc=An upgraded version of the §3Anvil§r, [T3], which unlocks additional recipes.%n%nAlternatively, the §3Desh Anvil§r can be skipped by making a §3Ferrouranium Anvil§r, [T4], from scavenged §e§r§6Uranium-238§r found in structures.

# Quest: Industrial Boiler
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPw.name=Промисловий котел
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPw.desc=§3Промисловий котел§r є вдосконаленою версією котла, що має більший об’єм для рідини. Крім того, він не вибухає.

# Quest: Rubber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQA.name=Гума
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQA.desc=§6Rubber§r is an essential material used in many crafting recipes. It is created in a §3Chemical Plant§r from §bunsaturated hydrocarbons§r and §6sulfur§r; unsaturateds need at least a §3Catalytic Cracking Tower§r.%n%n§6Latex§r is a rubber alternative which can be used in all rubber recipes instead of normal rubber (but not vice versa). It can be created early on using a §3Burner Press§r by processing dandelions or jungle wood.%n%n§2The first rubber needs cracked oil for unsaturated hydrocarbons.

# Quest: Bakelite
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQQ.name=Бакеліт
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQQ.desc=§6Bakelite§r is an alternative to Polymer and can be used for the same recipes. Since it doesnt require any §6Coal Powder§r or §6Fluorite§r to be made, it is easier and more convenient to automate than §6Polymer§r. It needs §baromatic hydrocarbons§r from cracked oil (advanced oil processing with a §3Catalytic Cracking Tower§r).

# Quest: Desh
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQg.name=Деш
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQg.desc=§6Desh§r — це сплав, що складається з 9 рідкоземельних металів, який формується у суміш, що потім затвердіває та очищується за допомогою §bРтуті§r та §bЛегкої нафти§r на §3Хімічному заводі§r.Деш — це практично неруйнівний матеріал, тому інструменти з нього мають нескінченний термін служби. %n%n§a§2Деш також можна виготовити за допомогою ГотовіДеш™ у роторній печі або, пізніше, у кислотній печі для руди.§r%n%nНа цьому етапі гри ртуть можна отримати шляхом центрифугування §eРуди редстоуну§r або поміщення §eКіноварі§r у §3Коксову піч§r. Великі жили кіноварі можна знайти як руду на глибині.%n%nПізніше ртуть можна отримати шляхом переробки §bрудної суміші§r або §bвітріолу§r в §3електролізері§r.

# Quest: Industrial Steam Turbine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARA.name=Промислова парова турбіна
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARA.desc=§3Промислова парова турбіна§r — це багатоблочна машина, яка є значно більшою та потужнішою версією звичайної §3Парової турбіни§r. Її ККД становить §e100%%§r, а вихідна потужність поступово зростає при подачі §bпари§r і поступово знижується при його відключенні.

# Quest: Coker Unit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARQ.name=Коксова установка
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARQ.desc=§3Коксова установка§r — це установка, яка перетворює нафтопродукти на §6Нафтовий кокс§r, що за своїми властивостями не відрізняється від інших видів коксу, а також на додаткові рідини як побічні продукти. Для роботи установки коксування необхідне зовнішнє джерело тепла, подібно до §3Тигля§r.%n%n§2§r§2Поряд з §2§r§2§r§2Електродуговою піччю, установка коксування є однією з найбільш забруднюючих машин модифікації. Вона поширює 20 осаду на секунду, що робить її небезпечною для використання поблизу гнізда гліфідів.

# Quest: Auxiliary Cooling Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASA.name=Auxiliary Cooling Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASA.desc=The §3Auxiliary Cooling Tower§r is a larger version of the Steam Condenser able to process up to 1,000 mB/t of §bLow-Pressure Steam§r.

# Quest: Refinery Power
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASw.name=Енергія нафтопродуктів
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASw.desc=Oil products can be combusted or burnt to produce massive amounts of energy.%n%nThe §3Industrial Combustion Engine§r combusts fuels, such as §bHeating Oil§r or §bDiesel§r to produce power. Various piston sets exist, which are needed for the engine to work, each one giving its own efficiency bonuses to fuel grades. Check the fuel-grade table: each fuel grade has an optimal piston set.%n%nThe §4§3Turbofan§r is the best place to use aviation type fuels, such as §bKerosene§r, as it provides §e100%%§r power efficiency. Be careful not to stand infront of it while its operational!%n%nThe §3Combined Cycle Gas Turbine§r is the only generator that can burn gaseous fuels at §e100%%§r efficiency. The CCGT uses §3§bEngine Lubricant§r, and produces §bDense Steam§r.%n%nThe §3Flare Stack§r is used for burning gasses such as §bUnsaturated Hydrocarbons§r for power, as well as dealing with excess fluids.%n%nThe §3Fluid Burner§r is a much more efficient way of producing power from gases. Place a §3Boiler§r ontop and run the §bSteam§r through a turbine to generate power.%n%nConsider installing a §6Muffler§r on some of these machines as they are very loud. Shift-Click on a machine while holding a Muffler to apply.

# Quest: Pumpjack
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATg.name=Насосна вишка
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATg.desc=§3Насосна вишка§r є більш ефективною версією §3Нафтової вишки§r, яка видобуває 750 мб §bСирої нафти§r та випадкову кількість §bПриродного газу§r у межах від 50 до 250 мб за цикл тривалістю 1,25 секунди. Це вичерпує один блок родовища після видобутку випадкової кількості циклів нафти, яка в середньому вдвічі більша порівняно з вишкою.%n%nЗагалом це означає, що насосна вишка в середньому втричі ефективніша у видобутку нафти та втричі швидша, виробляючи при цьому таку саму кількість природного газу, як і нафтова вишка.

# Quest: Ore Acidizer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATw.name=Підкислювач руди
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATw.desc=The §3Ore Acidizer§r is a useful machine, used for processing various items for utility, ore multiplication, and more. It is powered by electricity and requires various solvents depending on the item. Typical oil-chain solvents: §bsolvent§r then §bhigh-performance solvent§r for bedrock ores, §bsour gas§r for latex into rubber. The acidizer is quite the power hungry machine, consuming §e20kHE/s§r. %n%n

# Quest: Hydraulic Fracking Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUQ.name=Гідравлічна вежа гідророзриву
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUQ.desc=The §3Hydraulic Fracking Tower§r is used to extract infinite oil from a §eBedrock Oil Deposit§r. To operate, the machine needs §bFracking Solution§r. During its operation, the surrounding environment will sustain considerable damage. §6Oily Dirt§r and §6Oily Sand§r mark infinite bedrock deposits (pumping is slower but never depletes); the tower also works on regular deposits. Shred its polluted blocks in a §3Shredder§r into §6oily scraps§r for §6Arsenic§r via the §3Ore Acidizer§r with §bhigh-performance solvent§r.%n%nOperating the hydraulic fracking tower will consume §e100kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Centrifuge
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUg.name=Центрифуга
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUg.desc=The §6§3Centrifuge§r allows for the separation of ores, giving back more items than the usual mining method. It also separates items into their respective items. Additionally, they are used in processing §e§6Bedrock Ores§r.%n%nOperating the centrifuge will consume §e4kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Electric Groundwater Pump
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUw.name=Електричний ґрунтовий насос
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUw.desc=§3Електричний ґрунтовий насос§r можна використовувати для швидкого отримання §bВоди§r, що робить його дуже корисним у подальшому для наповнення великих §3Резервуарів§r та реакторів. Для роботи насоса необхідний куб ґрунту розміром 3x3 безпосередньо під ним, і він повинен бути розташований нижче рівня Y:70, інакше він не працюватиме.

# Quest: Industrial Solidification Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVw.name=Промислова машина затвердіння
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVw.desc=§3Промислова машина затвердіння§r — це універсальне обладнання для твердіння різних рідин. Одним із основних продуктів, що випускаються цією машиною, є §6Дьоготь§r, який можна використовувати для виготовлення §3Резервуарів§r.

# Quest: Industrial Liquification Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWA.name=Industrial Liquification Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWA.desc=The §3Industrial Liquification Machine§r is a general use machine for the liquifying various items. It becomes very useful for cobblestone generation, and thus §6Silicon§r automation.

# Quest: Tank
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXg.name=Tank
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXg.desc=§3Tanks§r and §3Barrels§r are useful storage devices that can hold various fluids in various amounts. Each tank and barrel supports holding different types of corrosive, hot, or exotic fluids, and knowing which ones can hold your desired fluids can be vital to your fluid processing and storage facilities.%n%nTanks can hold up to 256,000mb of fluids, while a Steel Barrel can hold 16,000.%n%n§4§2Tanks cant hold highly Antimatter and Corrosive fluids and as such a Big-Ass Tank 9000 or a Magnetic Tank is needed respectively.

# Quest: Geiger Counter
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXw.name=Geiger Counter
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXw.desc=The §6Geiger counter§r is a device used to measure §eRAD/s§r, in order to inform the player of any eventual radiation. It is an upgrade to the §6Dosimeter§r. It can measure three different types of radiation, those types being chunk radiation, environmental radiation and player contamination.%n%nIt can be used in one of two forms, either as a hand-held item or in its block form.%n%nHolding it in the inventory will show a meter on the bottom left of the screen, and right clicking while holding it will send a message in chat showing the various doses of radiation.%n%nIt will also click whenever it reads any kind of radiation, a signature function of any dosimeter.

# Quest: Survey Scanner
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYA.name=Survey Scanner
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYA.desc=The §6Survey Scanner§r is a handheld device that will point out underground resourse deposits, such as §eDepth Rock§r and §eBedrock Ores§r.

# Quest: Launch Pad
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaw.name=Launch Pad
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaw.desc=The §3Launch Pad§r is the main launch table for most missiles. This is the missile launch table, not the §3Rocket Launch Pad§r used for space rockets. Although it is the earliest available, missiles must first be erected before launch, resulting in a small delay.%n%nThe §3Silo Launch Pad§r is a miniaturized version of the launch pad. It can launch every generic missile with a delay of only 5 seconds. A rusted variant can be found in the naturally-occurring silo structure, holding the damaged Doomsday Missile.

# Quest: Electrolysis Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAzA.name=Electrolysis Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAzA.desc=The §3Electrolysis Machine§r enables the separating of elements from fluids and the advanced processing of ores, making it an important machine in ore processing. Operating the machine consumes §e200kHE/s§r.%n%nThe electrolysis machine has 2 functions: one for the separation of fluids and one for ore processing.%n%nIn the first mode, the machine will take in a compatible fluid and separate it into 2 other fluids.%n%nIn the second mode, it will require §bNitric Acid§r and will process any kind of ore-derived crystal, allowing the maximum yield of the ore. There are 2 outputs, for the molten main product the outlet marked green and the secondary the one marked red, plus a byproduct kept in its item form. The outlets follow the same mechanics as the §3Crucible§r.%n%n§2Consider installing a Power Saving upgrade above level 2 on the electrolysis machine as it will significantly reduce the power consumption with only a minimal speed penalty.

# Quest: Sodalite and Sodium
betterquesting.quest.APBKQg85Qha1VtT4cWTK9A.name=Sodalite and Sodium
betterquesting.quest.APBKQg85Qha1VtT4cWTK9A.desc=§6Sodalite§r is a gem recovered as a §3Centrifuge§r byproduct of many ores. Run lapis through a §3Combination Oven§r to get §bChlorine Gas§r plus sodium§r. Melt sodium down to §bLiquid Sodium§r: a powerful §3Pressurized Water Reactor§r coolant, far stronger than water loops. Stockpile it before your first PWR core.

# Quest: Semtex
betterquesting.quest.D6A-to-oSe29nf5qIu4h_w.name=Semtex
betterquesting.quest.D6A-to-oSe29nf5qIu4h_w.desc=§6Semtex§r is an explosive that is used in conjunction with C-4 in many crafts.%n%nSemtex is used in many crafts of various ammunition and mines, such as the §6Stinger missile§r, §6anti-personnel mines§r, and so on. In all crafts that use Semtex (except, of course, the Semtex block and Semtex bar, as well as the explosive reactive armor plate), it can be replaced with a C-4 bar.%n%nIt is used to create the bomb of the same name.%n%n§2Semtex can be eaten, making you feel like a real American soldier.§r

# Quest: Microchip
betterquesting.quest.Lc9HRIDwRZa0u-M3Ze6ZiQ.name=Microchip
betterquesting.quest.Lc9HRIDwRZa0u-M3Ze6ZiQ.desc=§6Microchips§r are one of the most important components of future circuits and will be used in bulk throughout progression. They are made from §6silicon wafers§r pressed with a circuit stamp.

# Quest: Fiberglass
betterquesting.quest.Q3y_TPhGTWe6JvLSRDrfBw.name=Fiberglass
betterquesting.quest.Q3y_TPhGTWe6JvLSRDrfBw.desc=Пісок у §3Підкислювачі руди§r можна перетворити на §6Скловолокно§r, що забезпечує в §3Дуговій пічі§r у §e4x§r разів більше §6Кремнію§r. Крім того, це чудовий рецепт для виготовлення ізоляторів.

# Quest: Powered Drill
betterquesting.quest.UWNifpoeQfypMwfGniM40w.name=Powered Drill
betterquesting.quest.UWNifpoeQfypMwfGniM40w.desc=The §6Powered Drill§r is a modular mining device which can make resourse gathering and excavation much faster than normal pickaxes. %n%nVarious modifications can be attached in the §3Weapon Modification Table§r, such as new drillbits for a larger mining radious or even new engines, which let it run on electricity.

# Quest: Ilmenite
betterquesting.quest.VxU7Oz3BRwapgbxJ9UnpaQ.name=Ilmenite
betterquesting.quest.VxU7Oz3BRwapgbxJ9UnpaQ.desc=§6Ilmenite§r is a mineral that serves as a natural source of titanium. It is produced by centrifuging §6Titanium Ore§r. By itself, it can be placed in an §3Arc Furnace§r to produce 3 §6Titanium Ingots§r, or it can be further processed in a §3Chemical Plant§r using §bTitanium Tetrachloride§r to increase its yield. The most efficient recipe is in the §3Pyrolysis Oven§r, where on top of giving the most titanium per Ilmenite, it also recycles back all the §bChlorine§r.%n%nQuest requirements: Obtain §6Ilmenite§r by centrifuging §6Titanium Ore§r. Build an §3Arc Furnace§r, §3Chemical Plant§r, or §3Pyrolysis Oven§r. Produce at least one §6Titanium Ingot§r from §6Ilmenite§r. For maximum efficiency, use the §3Pyrolysis Oven§r and recover §bChlorine§r.%n%n[F1] For more information.

# Quest: Redstone Fluid Overflow
betterquesting.quest.ZTrtIRiyRO2J5jHQ4sroaQ.name=Redstone Fluid Overflow
betterquesting.quest.ZTrtIRiyRO2J5jHQ4sroaQ.desc=§6§6§3Redstone-Over Radio§r in combination with a §3Redstone Fluid Valve§r can be used to detect when a tank is starting to fill up, and release the insides. This is useful for having buffers without having all the fluids being wasted.%n%n§2Here is an exmaple of a tank that will only output fluid once its full:§r%n%nFirstly, place a §6ROR Transmitter§r on one port of the tank, provide an ID and enable Polling.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Fluid1.png[/img]%n%nAfter that, place a §6ROR Logic Receiver§r next to the fluid valve and input the desired settings. Make sure that your signal is >= of your desired buffer. One redstone level equals to 16k mb.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Fluid2.png[/img]%n%nA §3Fluid Control Pump§r can also be used to limit throughput of fluids and to also add priorities.

# Quest: Electric Press
betterquesting.quest.jNW_k5hLQY-vdrAMMgVd5w.name=Electric Press
betterquesting.quest.jNW_k5hLQY-vdrAMMgVd5w.desc=The §3Electric Press§r is a version of the §3Burner Press§r which runs on electricity. It runs on the max speed, so there is no need to wait for it to heat up and go faster. It also has upgrade slots inside it.

# Quest: Jetpack
betterquesting.quest.l6zSmdfhSw6aTqiJsNDiHg.name=Jetpack
betterquesting.quest.l6zSmdfhSw6aTqiJsNDiHg.desc=The §6Jetpack§r can be used to travel upwards. It can be upgraded to unlock additional abilities, and can be equiped as an armor modification.

# Quest: Solid Fuel
betterquesting.quest.l7cvDxEiTg6v1RvTk-ynTw.name=Solid Fuel
betterquesting.quest.l7cvDxEiTg6v1RvTk-ynTw.desc=§6Solid Fuel§r is a compact solidified petroleum product with superior burn time and heat output compared to coal. Make it in an §3Industrial Solidifier§r or §3Pyrolysis Oven§r; it burns twice as long as coal and is used in solid rocket propellant.

# Quest: Delinquent
betterquesting.quest.nwCUMdHpQjykUlIVNW7Bcw.name=Delinquent
betterquesting.quest.nwCUMdHpQjykUlIVNW7Bcw.desc=Be mean.

# Quest: Teleporter
betterquesting.quest.refh8r3gQyavrC4KgSeWkw.name=Teleporter
betterquesting.quest.refh8r3gQyavrC4KgSeWkw.desc=The §3Teleporter§r can be used to teleport players, and entities in general, to a specific location.%n%nRight-click a block with the §6Telelinker§r to set the desired exit position, then shift-click the teleporter with the telelinker to configure the teleporter.%n%n§2The teleporter is a one way trip so it is advised that multiple are made.%n%nInterdimensional teleportation using teleporters requires a very expensive type of fuel, so it is recommended that other teleportations methods are used, such as AE2 Spatial. For fuel-free same-dimension travel, see the §3Xenium Resonator Satellite§r quest.

# Quest: Pinwheels
betterquesting.quest.t6tkjZliTEKxH0W6y39auQ.name=Pinwheels
betterquesting.quest.t6tkjZliTEKxH0W6y39auQ.desc=The §6Chlorine Pinwheel§r is a yellow propeller capable of producing chlorine indefinitely.%nAcquisition%n%nIt cannot be crafted, but can be found in structures (e.g., in a starship).%n%nThe chlorine spinner is an endless source of §bChlorine§r; to use it, simply place it in a container slot (e.g., in a barrel). The item will produce chlorine indefinitely, although the production rate is low (1 mb/t or 20 mb/s).%n%nThe §6Oxygen Pinwheel§r is analogous to the Chlorine Pinwheel, producing §bOxygen§r instead of §bChlorine§r.

# Quest: Precision Assembly Machine
betterquesting.quest.tKyjXZ3KQa6y3FLlxcC2_A.name=Високоточна збиральна машина
betterquesting.quest.tKyjXZ3KQa6y3FLlxcC2_A.desc=§3Високоточна збиральна машина§r — це машина, яка може виготовляти §6Креслення§r. Оскільки рецепти мають низький рівень успішності, рекомендується автоматизувати процес отримання інгредієнтів.%n%nРибу фугу можна отримати, кинувши у воду §6Рибальський динаміт§r.

# Quest: Weapon Steel
betterquesting.quest.xADm9gLETmCgiS3amOTUcQ.name=Weapon Steel
betterquesting.quest.xADm9gLETmCgiS3amOTUcQ.desc=§6Weapon steel§r is a steel alloy made by further refining steel in a §3Rotary Furnace§r. As its name implies, it is used in the crafting of weapons and ammunition. It is the next tier of weapons grade alloy after §6Gunmetal§r. It requires §bcoker gas§r from a §3Coker Unit§r as the rotary furnace fluid input.

# Quest: Mining Laser
betterquesting.quest.zYS6AlyFSuuMUErAJqPcTg.name=Mining Laser
betterquesting.quest.zYS6AlyFSuuMUErAJqPcTg.desc=The §3Mining Laser§r is a laser drill which can be used to quickly dig large areas. It has a §e100 MHE§r internal power buffer and a 64,000mB internal §bCrude Oil§r buffer. Its default radius is 3, which can be increased by the use of an effectiveness upgrade. It can also be equiped with various upgrades to unlock new functions such as shredding or voiding.


## Quest Line: LV3 - Reactors Age
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAg.name=LV3 - Reactors Age
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAg.desc=As energy needs increase, more powerful energy sources will be needed. This chapter covers Nuclear Reactors aswell as other advanced machines needed to produce ever stronger materials.

# Quest: Tungsten Carbide
betterquesting.quest.-KF6RRqRSdG58hgsbtwsgg.name=Tungsten Carbide
betterquesting.quest.-KF6RRqRSdG58hgsbtwsgg.desc=§6Tungsten Carbide§r is an alloy made from §6Tungsten§r and §bSyngas§r in a §3Pyrolysis Oven§r. It is mainly used in crafting neutron reflectors for reactors and nukes.

# Quest: Plasma Forge
betterquesting.quest.29WtP39ZRSClYLinoAxQpQ.name=Plasma Forge
betterquesting.quest.29WtP39ZRSClYLinoAxQpQ.desc=The §3Plasma Forge§r is a large and advanced assembler that requires a running fusion reactor to work. It can weld plates at twice the speed of a normal welder. It does not accept upgrades, however, it can use up otherwise useless fission fragments and unstable isotopes to gain a temporary §ex4§r speed bonus with no penalty.

# Quest: Gas Centrifuge
betterquesting.quest.2JMb-t2STTKM5sxV5Z7WOQ.name=Gas Centrifuge
betterquesting.quest.2JMb-t2STTKM5sxV5Z7WOQ.desc=The §3Gas Centrifuge§r is used to centrifuge §bUranium/Plutonium Hexafluoride§r to obtain enriched fuel for bombs and reactor fuel.%n%nTwo gas centrifuges in a row will yield §6Uranium-238§r and §6Uranium Fuel§r used in reactors. The uranium hexafluoride processing line does not consume the §6Sulfur§r and §6Fluorite§r, so loops are recommended.%n%nThe §6Gas Centrifuge Overclocking Upgrade§r is needed to obtain §6Uranium-235§r. Four gas centrifuges will have to be placed in a row and the upgrade on the last of them to obtain uranium-235 nuggets.%n%n[F1] For more information.%n

# Quest: Nuclear Fuel Processing
betterquesting.quest.7rFMNl3iSCOD-dpsKLAANQ.name=Nuclear Fuel Processing
betterquesting.quest.7rFMNl3iSCOD-dpsKLAANQ.desc=Завдяки §3Баку для відпрацьованого палива§r, призначеному для охолодження відпрацьованого ядерного палива §3ЗІРНОКС§ або §3ПВР§r, а також технології §3П'юрекс§r для його подальшої переробки, зараз доступно багато нових матеріалів.

# Quest: Wideband Radio Emission Detector Satellite
betterquesting.quest.7xvtGouAQxKJ5rWXHykczg.name=Wideband Radio Emission Detector Satellite
betterquesting.quest.7xvtGouAQxKJ5rWXHykczg.desc=The §3Wideband Radio Emission Detector Satellite§r monitors the entire map for high-energy events with no range limit, returning only an approximate location. Use it as a first-pass detection layer - once a hit is found, follow up with the §3Narrowband Emission Scanning Satellite§r or §3Spy Satellite§r to pinpoint the source.%n%nEvents are grouped by intensity. LOW covers mini-nuke detonations, accurate to within 10,000 m. MEDIUM covers active radars and particle accelerators, accurate to within 2,500 m. HIGH covers nuclear explosions, accurate to within 500 m. MEDIUM events persist for only half a second while others last up to a minute, so rapid repeated scans are recommended.%n%nRoR commands: "esurvey" collects all active results; "ecount" writes the total to RX; "egettype" writes LOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH for a given index; "egetposition" writes approximate X/Z coordinates for a given index.%n%n§2Route this satellite's output through an §3AUTOCAL§r§2 to automatically cue more precise instruments when a hit is detected.

# Quest: Fusion Reactor
betterquesting.quest.8DXv-b9sRxalmY8yovSQuw.name=Термоядерний реактор
betterquesting.quest.8DXv-b9sRxalmY8yovSQuw.desc=§3Термоядерний реактор§r — це великий, дорогий і високотехнологічний тип реактора, який працює за рахунок синтезу різних видів плазми з метою отримання тепла.%n%nОсновна частина термоядерного реактора, §3«Торус»§r, має чотири з'єднувальні порти для підключення зовнішніх компонентів. Для роботи йому потрібна електрика та охолодження §bперфторметилом§r.%n%n§3Клистрон§r — це основне джерело живлення термоядерного реактора, яке використовує електрику та стиснене повітря для генерації вхідної енергії, §eKyU§r, для підключеного торуса. Він перейде в режим обмеження потужності, якщо запас електроенергії або стисненого повітря впаде нижче §e50%%§r, а якщо він впаде нижче необхідного рівня вхідної потужності торуса, плазма згасне.%n%nРізні типи плазми також генерують різні корисні побічні продукти та різні рівні потоку нейтронів для розмноження великих обсягів матеріалів, таких як §6Літій§r у §6Тритій§r.%n%nДля зварювання котушок знадобиться §6паяльна лампа§r або §6ацетиленовий зварювальний пальник§r.%n%n§2Щодо додаткових компонентів та методів генерації енергії, будь ласка, ознайомтеся з двома квестами нижче.§r

# Quest: Supercomputer
betterquesting.quest.8H2PVtL2St-WzTCmhZfCNg.name=Supercomputer
betterquesting.quest.8H2PVtL2St-WzTCmhZfCNg.desc=The §3Supercomputer§r is a late-game machine essential for processing both §6Flash Drives§r and §6Disk Drives§r. It is made in an §3Assembly Machine§r. The machine measures 12x5x9 blocks and requires energy to operate, with consumption depending on the operation. It does not require heat.%n%nFlash Drives are inserted into the §3Supercomputer§r and can be made into §eFlight Simulation Data§r, used in making the §6Soyuz§r and §6Orbital Module§r, or §eParticle Simulation Data§r, used in the §3Fusion Reactor§r.%n%nMost of the Supercomputer's operations work like those of the §3Precision Assembly Machine§r: they have a chance of returning a broken version of the input, which can be recycled for a portion of its materials. Operations involving data drives require cooling. Compatible coolants, from slowest to fastest, are §bWater§r, §bCold Perfluoromethyl§r, and §bHelium-4§r. Faster fluids speed up the process substantially but also increase the chance of a broken output. Overall, this makes for more successful outputs on average. The Supercomputer can also manufacture cheaper §6Blueprint Booklets§r and §6Klaus§r.%n%n§2Processing drives is extremely time consuming. The fastest operations take 60 seconds, while the longest can take up to 1 hour of real time. Plan your resource and energy usage accordingly.%n%nQuest requirements: Build a §3Supercomputer§r, supply it with §bWater§r, §bCold Perfluoromethyl§r, or §bHelium-4§r as coolant, and process at least one §6Flash Drive§r into §eFlight Simulation Data§r or §eParticle Simulation Data§r.%n%n[F1] For more information.

# Quest: Large Factory Multiblocks
betterquesting.quest.8XHLo-wQRN28gu4AwCtHVQ.name=Великі мультиблочні заводи
betterquesting.quest.8XHLo-wQRN28gu4AwCtHVQ.desc=§3Хімічний завод§r — це збільшена версія §3Хімічного комплексу§r, здатна паралельно виконувати 4 рецепти. Він працює вдвічі швидше за хімічний комплекс, але споживає вдвічі більше енергії. Крім того, вона споживає §bВоду§r як охолоджувач і виробляє §bПару низького тиску§r, тому рекомендується використовувати замкнутий водяний цикл.%n%n§3Зборочний завод§r — це велика версія §3Збиральної машини§r, здатна виконувати 4 рецепти одночасно. Він працює так само, як хімічний завод.

# Quest: Starmetal Pickaxe
betterquesting.quest.8sIzBzykSPqskvhCp-Tsmw.name=Зірметалеве кайло
betterquesting.quest.8sIzBzykSPqskvhCp-Tsmw.desc=§6Зірметалеве кайло§r використовується як компонент для виготовлення §6Розплавленого§r та §6Бісмутового кайла§r, які не ламаються та мають багато здібностей. Крім того, обидва кайла можна використовувати для видобутку §Глибинної породи§r.%n

# Quest: Cadmium
betterquesting.quest.9BjXTD5CSTOQ-_OroVdJmg.name=Кадмій
betterquesting.quest.9BjXTD5CSTOQ-_OroVdJmg.desc=§6Cadmium§r is a material needed to make §6Cadmium Steel§r, which is a substitute of §6Technetium Steel§r.%n%nCadmium can be obtained by smelting cadmium powder, which can be obtained acidizing 10 §6Mustard Willow leaves§r with 250mB of §bHigh-Performance Solvent§r in the §3Ore Acidizer§r.%n%nThe mustard willow is a plant that can be found near §eBedrock Oil Deposits§r. When it's fully matured, the main item can be obtained, that being the mustard willow leaf.

# Quest: Lambda-98
betterquesting.quest.9PngQWDKQNCWI50sDbf3Eg.name=Lambda-98
betterquesting.quest.9PngQWDKQNCWI50sDbf3Eg.desc=The §3Lambda Launch Pad§r is a mechanism for launching the §6Lambda-98 Rocket§r, which can be used to launch satellites for cheaper and faster than the Soyuz. This launch pad works much faster than the Soyuz facility: loading the rocket and fueling takes noticeably less time, and instead of a 30 second wait after pressing the launch button, Lambda offers only 10 seconds. It also supports automatic launch after all preparation procedures are complete.%n%nThe launch pad constantly consumes §e200kHE/s§r. Each launch consumes 16000mB of §bLeaded Gasoline§r and §bHydrogen Peroxide§r. If the pad is in auto-launch mode, a countdown begins after all required slots and buffers are filled. In manual mode, the pad waits for your signal.%n%nQuest requirements: Build a §3Lambda Launch Pad§r, supply it with §e200kHE/s§r and stock §bLeaded Gasoline§r and §bHydrogen Peroxide§r. Launch a §6Lambda-98 Rocket§r. Optionally, enable auto-launch mode for automatic countdown and launch.%n%n[F1] For more information.

# Quest: High-Power Steam Condenser
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0Q.name=Високопотужний паровий конденсатор
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0Q.desc=The §3High-Power Steam Condenser§r is a steam condenser which runs on electricity. It processes up to 1,000,000 mB/t of §bLow-Pressure Steam§r.

# Quest: Leviathan Steam Turbine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1Q.name=Парова турбіна Левіафан
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1Q.desc=§3Парова турбіна Левіафан§r — це величезна турбіна, здатна одночасно переробляти гігантські обсяги §пари§r, обмежена лише швидкістю транспортування рідини в системі. За потужністю переробки сирої пари вона значно перевершує навіть §3Промислову парову турбіну§r. Ця турбіна працює з ККД §e85%%§r, тому для дуже великих реакторів рекомендується використовувати лише 1-2 таких турбіни.

# Quest: RBMK
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.name=РБМК
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.desc=The §3RBMK§r is a modular boiling-water type nuclear fission reactor which consists entirely of concrete columns. Each of these columns is either blank or has a specific function that it performs such as holding fuel rods, moderating neutrons, or storing §bWater§r to be boiled into §bSteam§r. Each column will also exchange heat with the column next to it such that temperature differences between columns will gradually equalize within the reactor. If any column reaches §e1500°C§r, the reactor will explode incredibly violently, spraying scrap and immensely radioactive material in every direction.%n%nDue to the complex and expansive nature of the RBMK, it is highly recommend that the wiki is checked out as it provides more information.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/RBMK[/url]%n%n§2This quest provides an optional retrieval task for a cheap and safe RBMK design which can produce High-Performance Solvent§r §2without cooling. Simply Place the RBMK Irradiation Channel next to the RBMK Fuel Rod, apply the covers on the collumns and surround them with a solid block. Watch the RBMK Console neutron-flux graph for spikes, insert control rods gradually (AZ-5), and cool with 50 mB/t cold PFM per cooler.

# Quest: Technetium/Cadmium Steel
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABg.name=Технецій/Кадмієва сталь
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABg.desc=§6Технецій/Кадмієва сталь§r — це сплав на основі сталі з додаванням технецію-99 та кадмію, що відрізняється надзвичайною корозійною стійкістю. Часто використовується на пізніх етапах гри та є одним із основних матеріалів для виготовлення енергетичних установок §3Ядерного поєднання§r та §3Ватз§r.

# Quest: PWR
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACg.name=ПВР
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACg.desc=§2§3ПВР§r — це модульний ядерний реактор. Він має менші можливості та обмеженіший вибір типів палива порівняно з §3РБМК§r, але є набагато безпечнішим і простішим у використанні завдяки більш плавному переплавленню та значно більшій стабільності в роботі.%n%nЧерез складність та масштабність ПВР, настійно рекомендуємо ознайомитися з вікі, де наведено більше інформації.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/PWR[/url]%n%n§2Цей квест вимагає найнеобхідніших деталей ПВР і не відображає кількості, необхідної для функціонування реактора. Існує також багато інших типів компонентів ПВР, які можна використовувати.

# Quest: Reformate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADQ.name=Реформат
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADQ.desc=§bReformate§r is a product of §bCrude Oil§r obtained via a §3Vacuum Refinery§r or by reforming §bcracked or coker naphtha§r in a §3Catalytic Reformer§r.%n%n§2Reformate can also be fractioned for BTX.%n

# Quest: Starmetal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJw.name=Зірметал
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJw.desc=§6Зірметал§r — це унікальний сплав, отриманий шляхом поєднання §6Сатурніту§r та §6Порошка метеорита§r у §3Доменній печі§r.

# Quest: Versatile Integrated Circuit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKA.name=Універсальна інтегральна схема
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKA.desc=§6Універсальна інтегральна схема§r є першою схемою, в якій використовується §6Бісмут/Миш'як§r. Вона застосовується в більш досконалих машинах, таких як §3Вакуумна нафтопереробна установка§r, і є одним з основних компонентів §6Універсальних друкованих плат§r.

# Quest: Liquidator Medal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALQ.name=Медаль ліквідатора
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALQ.desc=У разі розплавлення реактора §3РБМК§r §6Фрагменти палива§r будуть розкидані поблизу реактора. §6Медаль ліквідатора§r — це модифікація броні, яка пасивно знижує рівень радіації, що робить її дуже корисною під час роботи з радіоактивними предметами або при проникненні в зони радіаційного забруднення.

# Quest: Versatile Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMA.name=Універсальна друкована плата
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMA.desc=§6Універсальна друкована плата§r — це найвищий рівень друкованих плат, для виготовлення якої потрібні §6Бісмут/Миш'як§r та §6Пружні пластикові/ПВХ-пластини§r. Крім того, це на сьогодні найдорожча друкована плата: для виготовлення однієї штуки потрібно майже 55 ізоляторів. Використовується рідко, але в невеликих кількостях у сучасних машинах, таких як §3Термоядерний реактор§r, та у великих кількостях у компонентах для §3Реактор інерційного термоядерного синтезу (ICF)§r.

# Quest: Hard Plastic/PVC Bars
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANA.name=Пружні пластикові/ПВХ-пластини
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANA.desc=§6Пружні пластикові/ПВХ-пластини§ — це дуже міцні пластикові матеріали, необхідні для багатьох рецептів на пізніх етапах гри. %n%n§2Обидва матеріали можна використовувати в одних і тих самих рецептах.

# Quest: Pyrolysis Oven
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANg.name=Піролізна піч
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANg.desc=The §3Pyrolysis Oven§r is a mid-to-late game replacement for the §3Coker Unit§r that produces §6Solid Fuel§r instead of petroleum coke and allows easier production of §6Crystalline Fullerite§r, which is needed in bulk for late-game machines onwards. %n%nIt can process an item with an optional fluid to produce another item and/or fluid. Functionally, it works similar to the §3Combination Oven§r, mostly in bedrock ore processing.%nIts main use however is in production of §6Fullerene§r, as it can turn §6Tar§r into §6Fine Soot§r, eliminating the RNG of a §3Smokestack§r.%n%nOperating the pyrolysis oven will consume §e200kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Reformate Gas
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPg.name=Реформований газ
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPg.desc=§bReformate Gas§r is used in welding very durable materials, as well as used in making §6Saturnite§r. Its primary use is making §bhigh-performance solvent§r from §bchlorine gas§r in an §3Industrial Mixer§r.

# Quest: FEL and SILEX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQw.name=FEL та SILEX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQw.desc=§3FEL§r, або лазер на вільних електронах, — це великий багатоблоковий пристрій, який використовується разом із SILEX для генерації різних довжин хвиль лазера, необхідних для виконання всіх рецептів SILEX.%n%nОдин FEL може живити до 5 пристроїв SILEX. Щоб зупинити лазер, на його шляху може бути будь-який бетонний блок.%n%nЧим нижча довжина хвилі кристала, тим швидше будуть виконані рецепти.%n%n§6§3SILEX§r — це машина, яка розділяє ізотопи та елементи від сполук або інших матеріалів за допомогою процесу SILEX (Separation of Isotopes by Laser Exitation — розділення ізотопів за допомогою лазерного збудження). Це дозволяє легше збагачувати §6Уран§r, §6Плутоній§r та §6Австралій§r.%n%nSILEX також може переробляти §6Лазурит§r на §6Сірку§r, §6Алюміній§r і, що найважливіше, §6Кобальт§r. Він може використовувати §bПерекис водню§r для розрідження будь-якого матеріалу, що підлягає переробці, навіть якщо матеріал знаходиться у вигляді порошку. Перероблені матеріали виходять у праву частину колектора.%n%nSILEX повинен бути розміщений на відстані не менше 2 блоків від активованого лазера FEL, інакше він розплавиться.

# Quest: Saturnite
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASQ.name=Сатурніт
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASQ.desc=§6Сатурніт§r — це надзвичайно міцний, термостійкий і корозієстійкий сплав, який зазвичай використовують для виготовлення міцніших деталей зброї. Він також застосовується для виробництва §6Зірметалу§r і є важливим компонентом реактора §3Ватз§r.

# Quest: Gravity Gun
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASg.name=Граві-пушка
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASg.desc=§6Граві-пушка§ — це вдосконалений інструмент, здатний підіймати та кидати блоки. Вона особливо корисна для переміщення надзвичайно небезпечних блоків, таких як коріум, що утворився в результаті розплавлення реактора, або для кидання вибухових речовин.%n%n§2Гравитаційну гармату можна перезарядити в циклотроні за допомогою іонізованих частинок, що дозволить ще більше збільшити її дальність та потужність.

# Quest: Schrabidium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVg.name=Шрабідіум
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVg.desc=§6Шрабідіум§r — небезпечний матеріал, але він необхідний для створення інших предметів, таких як §6Магнітований вольфрам§r та §6Ферричний шрабідіат§r. Він також чудово підходить як паливо для реакторів. Його можна отримати, піддавши уранову руду радіації за допомогою ядерної зброї або, що простіше, підірвавши радіоактивні бочки, які можна знайти в покинутих атомних електростанціях у пустелях.%n%n§2Тримаючи шрабідій у руках, гравець отримає ефект сліпоти, тому рекомендується використовувати костюм, який забезпечує захист як від яскравого світла, так і від радіації.

# Quest: Advanced Oil Processing
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWw.name=Продвинута переробка нафти
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWw.desc=The §3Catalytic Reformer§r is an optional late-game oil processing machine. It converts certain oil products into more valuable ones.%n%nThe §3Hydrotreater§r is another optional late-game oil processing machine that allows for easier production of §bSour Gas§r, which can also turn §bCrude Oil§r into §bDesulfurized crude Oil§r. %n%n§2The Hydrotreater requires pressurized Liquid Hydrogen in all its recipes, requiring the use of a Compressor. For example, cracked naphtha reforms into reformate while desulfurized naphtha fractions into BTX.

# Quest: Soyuz-FG
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZw.name=Союз-ФГ
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZw.desc=§3Ракета Союз-ФГ§r — це надзвичайно потужна радянська ракета, яка є основною ракетою-носієм для всіх супутників. Ракета повинна запускатися з відповідної великої платформи — в даному випадку, §3Платформа запуску «Союз»§r.%n%nДля запуску потрібно 128,000 мБ §bКеросину§r та §bРідкого кисню§r, а також §e750kHE§r енергії. Натискання кнопки запуску починає 30-секундний відлік. Після завершення відліку «Союз» стартує.%n%n«Союз», окрім своєї основної функції — виведення будь-якого супутника на орбіту, — також може бути налаштований на вантажний режим, у якому він може доставити будь-який вантаж у віддалене місце по всьому світу. Очевидно, що це неймовірно дорогий спосіб транспортування вантажів, і на даний момент він не має великої користі.%n%n§2Креслення для «Союзу» можна знайти в будівлях або придбати через Бобмазон.%n

# Quest: Ferrouranium Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbw.name=Ковадло з фероурану
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbw.desc=Оновлена версія §3Ковадла§r, [Р4], яка відкриває доступ до додаткових рецептів.

# Quest: Neutrino Lens
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcA.name=Нейтрино лінза
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcA.desc=§6Нейтрино лінза§r — це модифікація броні, яка дозволяє виявляти та виділяти спеціальні блоки, такі як §eРодовища руди в корінних породах§r, §6Рожеву деревину§r та §6Александрит§r. %n%nЩоб лінза працювала, її спочатку потрібно підключити до §6Супутникового модуля сканування ресурсів на глибині§r, а потім вставити в елемент броні за допомогою §3Верстата модифікацій броні§r.%n%n§2Для роботи лінзи потрібно активувати клавішу HUD.

# Quest: ZIRNOX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcg.name=ZIRNOX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcg.desc=The §3ZIRNOX§r is the first and cheapest nuclear reactor one can make. Unlike the §3PWR§r and §3RBMK§r, it is a fully assembled reactor which requires §bWater§r and §bCarbon Dioxide§r to operate.%n%nDue to its modest steam output, the ZIRNOX can be paired with several §3Steam Engines§r, though an §3Industrial Turbine§r is recommended for its §e100%%§r efficiency. A single §3Steam Condenser§r handles the exhaust on lower power fuels. 24 §6Natural Uranium Fuel Rods§r using 14kmB of carbon dioxide will yield a power output of around §e240kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Cooling Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdQ.name=Cooling Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdQ.desc=The §3Cooling Tower§r is a larger version of the §3Auxiliary Cooling Tower§r, able to process up to 10,000 mB/t of §bLow-Pressure Steam§r.

# Quest: Ionized Particles
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAeA.name=Ionized Particles
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAeA.desc=§6Ionized Particles§r are the main product of the §3Fusion Reactor§r and are used in making §6Ferric Scrabidate§r, as well as some particle capsules needed in the §3Particle Accelerator§r.%n%n§2Ionized Particles can be infinitely produced by utilizing Ionic Gel.

# Quest: HEV Mark IV
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhA.name=HEV Mark IV
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhA.desc=The §6HEV Mark IV§r is a strong electric armor set, with the intent of keeping the user safe primarely from dangerous hazards, such as high levels of radiation, fire, certain air particles and more. The suit comes equiped with an §6Geiger Counter§r and custom hud.

# Quest: Bismuth
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhw.name=Bismuth
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhw.desc=§6Бісмут§r — важливий матеріал, необхідний для багатьох складних рецептів виготовлення. Бісмут можна отримати або шляхом виснаження палива §3Канального реактору великої потужності (РБМК)§r та його переробки за допомогою §3Лазеру вільних електронів(FEL)§r і §3Камери лазерного розділення ізотопів (SILEX)§r, або шляхом переробки руди з корінних порід за допомогою §bВисокоефективного розчинника§r. %n%n§6Миш'як§r вимагатиме додаткового §bПідкислювача руди§r, а також доступу до високоефективного розчинника.%n%n§2Через брак на Землі руди вісмуту в корінних породах та тривалість переробки палива РБМК рекомендується використовувати замість бісмуту деяку кількість миш'яку.

# Quest: Welded Technetium/Cadmium Steel Plate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjg.name=Welded Technetium/Cadmium Steel Plate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjg.desc=The §6Welded Technetium/Cadmium Steel Plate§r is the welded varient of the cast technetium/cadmium steel plate and is used in some recipes that require strong materials. %n%n§2Make sure to have good energy generation and storage infrastructure as each plate costs 1.2 Billion HE.

# Quest: Big-Ass Tank (9000)
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjw.name=Big-Ass Tank (9000)
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjw.desc=The §3Big-Ass Tank 9000§r is the largest fluid storage container, capable of storing 16000000mB of fluids, aswell as being able to hold strongly corrosive fluids. It has to be placed on the solid surface, otherwise it is going to break.%n%nThere is also a cheaper version available - §3Big-Ass Tank§r (no 9000 suffix). It is only capable of storing 2048000mB of fluids, but it is twice as cheap and does not require a solid surface,

# Quest: Heavy Magnetic Storage Tank
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAkA.name=Heavy Magnetic Storage Tank
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAkA.desc=The §3Heavy Magnetic Storage Tank§r is a large version of the §3Magnetic Antimatter Container§r. It will be particularly useful when making §6Gerald§r, as he will need very large quantities of §bStellar Flux§r.

# Quest: Vacuum Refinery
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAkw.name=Вакуумний нафтопереробний завод
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAkw.desc=The §3Vacuum Refinery§r is an oil refinery which processes §bpressurized crude oil§r (compress crude oil, then compress again from 1 PU to 2 PU) into 5 products - §bheavy heating oil§r, §bReformate§r, §bBTX§r, §bSour Gas§r and §bReformate Gas§r - most of which are fractioned again. It is a good way to make §bHigh-Performance Solvent§r by using §bReformate Gas§r and §bChlorine Gas§r in an §3Industrial Mixer§r.%n%n§2Compressors are needed for the oil to be inserted inside the Vacuum Refinery.

# Quest: BTX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAng.name=BTX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAng.desc=§bBTX§r is a high-grade powerful fuel which generates a lot of power when burnt. An important use of BTX is in the creation of §6Crystalline Fullerite§r and §6Hard Plastic Bars§r. BTX is obtained by fractioning §bReformate§r or §bdesulfurized naphtha§r in a §3Fractioning Tower§r; making §6Hard Plastic Bars§r from it also needs §bphosgene§r.

# Quest: Watz Powerplant
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAApg.name=Watz Powerplant
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAApg.desc=The §3Watz§r powerplant is a fission reactor which can produce §bPoisonous Mud§r, an important component of §6CMB Steel§r. Although the reactor is not really powerful in terms of energy output, it can be stacked ontop of eachother for increased mud and power production.%n%nIf the poisonous mud buffer reaches its maximum, the reactor will melt down and explode, irradiating a wide area around it and causing fallout to fall in a small area around it. As well as this, it will spew poisonous mud in a very wide area which will then corrode any blocks that it comes in contact with, similar to corium.

# Quest: Magnetized Tungsten
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAArQ.name=Magnetized Tungsten
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAArQ.desc=§6Magnetized Tungsten§r is the product of combining §6Schrabidium§r and §6Tungsten§r in a §3Blast Furnace§r. It can also be rarely dropped by cybercrabs in §eMeteorite Dungeons§r.

# Quest: Ferric Schrabidate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuA.name=Ferric Schrabidate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuA.desc=§6Ferric Schrabidate§r is an alloy made from §6Iron§r, §6Ionized Particles§r and §6Schrabidium§r. It can also be used to create schrabidate capacitors, which are a great way of storing energy.

# Quest: Solid Mud Brick
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuQ.name=Solid Mud Brick
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuQ.desc=§6Poisonous Mud§r is the byproduct of the §3Watz§r operating. This is the solidified version of it which can be used in a §3Crucible§r to create §6CMB Steel§r.

# Quest: CMB Steel
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAug.name=CMB Steel
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAug.desc=§6CMB Steel§r is an alloy made from §6Poisonous Mud§r and §6Magnetized Tunsten§r in a §3Crucible§r. This alloy is used in endgame machinery, such as the §3ICF§r and §3DFC§r.

# Quest: Crystalline Fullerite
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAww.name=Crystalline Fullerite
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAww.desc=§6Crystalline Fullerite§r is an material which is primarily used in endgame machines, such as the §3ICF§r and the §3FEnSU§r. It is made from fine soot captured by smokestacks and ash pits, processed and finally acidized with BTX.%n%n§2It is recommended that an Effectiveness 3 upgrade is installed on the Acidizer to increase the chance of not consuming the Fullerene, as fullerite can be expensive to produce large quantities.

# Quest: High-Performance Solvent
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABPQ.name=High-Performance Solvent
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABPQ.desc=§bHigh-Performance Solvent§r is a solvent which is used in an §3Ore Acidizer§r to further increase the products of bedrock ores, as well as other recipes. It can be created from §bReformate Gas§r, from a §3Vacuum Refinery§r, and §bChlorine§r in an §3Industrial Mixer§r or be obtained from an §3RBMK§r Irradiation Channel.%n%nTo transport High-Performance Solvent by hand, a §6Hazardous Material Tank§r is needed.%n%n§2Chlorinated wax bred in an RBMK irradiation channel can also be processed into High-Performance Solvent.%n

# Quest: Radiation-Powered Engine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABeA.name=Radiation-Powered Engine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABeA.desc=The §3Radiation-Powered Engine§r turns nuclear waste into decayed waste while also making energy in the process and giving guaranteed consistent decay times.%n%n§2Blueprints can be found in structures or purchased from Bobmazon.

# Quest: PWR powered Steel Furnace
betterquesting.quest.CYbDJkRORT-LPEInaoL3BQ.name=Сталеплавильна піч заживлена реактором ПВР
betterquesting.quest.CYbDJkRORT-LPEInaoL3BQ.desc=Instead of using the §bHot Coolant§r for power, one can use it to make the §3Steel Furnace§r go at ludicrous speeds.

# Quest: Uranium-238
betterquesting.quest.CYtQLn_VSx2QTnLEwpMGOw.name=Uranium-238
betterquesting.quest.CYtQLn_VSx2QTnLEwpMGOw.desc=§6Uranium-238§r is the most common uranium isotope in the game. %n%nThis material has many uses, some of which are: §6Ferrouranium§r, MOX fuel, depleted uranium ammunition, absorber Pellets for the §3Watz§r powerplant and can also be turned into §6Schrabidium§r later on in the §3Exposure Chamber§r.

# Quest: Space Laboratory
betterquesting.quest.D9pDxj8XRimvGcS1sT0wHQ.name=Space Laboratory
betterquesting.quest.D9pDxj8XRimvGcS1sT0wHQ.desc=Attaching a §3Drive Enclosure§r to one of the ports of a §3Satellite Ground Station§r which is linked to a satellite will allow it to receive data. §2A linked satellite ground station, when looking at it, will reveal information about the satellite.§r The §6Space Laboratory§r is a modular satellite which produces data for drives. §2All of the Space Laboratory related satellites must have the same ID.§r%n%nQuest requirements: Attach a §3Drive Enclosure§r to a §3Satellite Ground Station§r that is linked to a §6Space Laboratory§r satellite. Ensure all Space Laboratory related satellites share the same ID. Receive data from the satellite.%n%n[F1] For more information.

# Quest: Narrowband Emission Scanning Satellite
betterquesting.quest.DMCygjIOSOav8ZBlUlqEvQ.name=Narrowband Emission Scanning Satellite
betterquesting.quest.DMCygjIOSOav8ZBlUlqEvQ.desc=The §3Narrowband Emission Scanning Satellite§r precisely locates specific high-energy events within a 250-meter radius of a target point. It is the high-precision counterpart to the §3Wideband Radio Emission Detector Satellite§r, sensitive to: neutron radiation from nuclear reactors, high-energy particles from fusion reactors and particle accelerators, radar waves from ground radars, and radio waves from §3Satellite Ground Stations§r with an active TX signal.%n%nAll results are stored internally and accessed via §dRedstone-over-Radio§r. "esurvey" performs the scan. "ecount" writes the result count to RX. "egetinfo" followed by an index writes the emission type to RX. "egetposition" followed by an index writes the X/Z coordinates - separated by a semicolon - to RX.%n%n§2Events are time-limited. Run repeated scans at short intervals to avoid missing short-lived emissions.

# Quest: Orbital Precision Laser
betterquesting.quest.EQ8nf9eDQ-K9yPIxEaFQkw.name=Orbital Precision Laser
betterquesting.quest.EQ8nf9eDQ-K9yPIxEaFQkw.desc=The §3Orbital Precision Laser§r is a solar-powered orbital weapon, a lighter alternative to the §3Orbital Death Ray§r. It fires an instantaneous beam dealing massive damage to entities within a 5-block radius, though its explosive yield is only roughly equivalent to a single block of TNT. Recharge time between shots is §e5 seconds§r.%n%nIt is controlled via §dRedstone-over-Radio§r through a §3Satellite Ground Station§r. When paired with targeting data from a §3Radar Survey Satellite§r it can shoot down missiles. The "fire" command fires at the current target coordinates, or at a tracked entity if one has been set - entity target data is consumed after a single shot. The "canfire" command writes TRUE or FALSE to RX depending on whether the laser has finished recharging. The "setentitytarget" command accepts an entity ID from a §3Radar Satellite§r for precision tracking.%n%n§2Entity target data is consumed after one shot, reverting back to coordinate targeting.

# Quest: RBMKSim
betterquesting.quest.EZVGATGCSKCAChL2E07tXA.name=RBMKSim
betterquesting.quest.EZVGATGCSKCAChL2E07tXA.desc=There is a web-based RBMK simulator, in which you can build and test different RBMK setups, as well as check out other people's creations!%n%n[url]https://rbmksim.nvrsrv.com[/url]

# Quest: Additional Fusion Attachments
betterquesting.quest.JpsvBP1yQsu-XtkeZegA6A.name=Additional Fusion Attachments
betterquesting.quest.JpsvBP1yQsu-XtkeZegA6A.desc=The §3Fusion Reactor Coupler§r turns outgoing plasma energy from a torus into usable §eKyU§r which can then be used to power another torus. Some fuel combinations require this, as the minimum §eKyU§r energy needed to ignite the plasma exceeds what four §3Klystrons§r could deliver.%n%nThe §3Fusion Reactor Breeding Chamber§r uses neutron flux from a torus to in order to process materials. It can perform any recipe from an §3RBMK irradiation channel§r, with some additional recipes aswell. The neutron flux is not affected by port sharing rules, and the output level is the same on any side.%n%nThe §3Fusion Reactor Collection Chamber§r increases the byproduct production rate by §e50%%§r.

# Quest: Orbital Death Ray
betterquesting.quest.Ksafc-uMT02Uk0dvCx1JOQ.name=Orbital Death Ray
betterquesting.quest.Ksafc-uMT02Uk0dvCx1JOQ.desc=The §3Orbital Death Ray§r is a high-destruction orbital weapon, fired via §dRedstone-over-Radio§r through a §3Satellite Ground Station§r. Each shot deals as much damage as a high-yield mini nuke, but without the radiation.%n%nUnlike the §3Orbital Precision Laser§r, it has no entity-tracking capability and cannot intercept rockets or hit fast-moving targets. The beam strikes the first surface in its path, so targets in deep cover are safe. Recharge time is §e5 minutes§r. RoR commands: "fire" fires at the current target position if the weapon is ready; "canfire" writes TRUE or FALSE to RX depending on whether it has finished recharging.

# Quest: Desh Stamps
betterquesting.quest.MFweFzQDQg2L-9X4_I8o-Q.name=Desh Stamps
betterquesting.quest.MFweFzQDQg2L-9X4_I8o-Q.desc=§6Desh Stamps§r have infinite durability, perfect for automation.

# Quest: Chlorophyte
betterquesting.quest.PszZViltQjCHNmKB7QJcfA.name=Chlorophyte
betterquesting.quest.PszZViltQjCHNmKB7QJcfA.desc=§6Chlorophyte§r is a product of fusion and is used in the §3DFC§r and §6Digamma Particle§r.

# Quest: High-Performance Solvent Bedrock Ore Processing
betterquesting.quest.QusK-8T-TGmBWETwmxosJQ.name=High-Performance Solvent Bedrock Ore Processing
betterquesting.quest.QusK-8T-TGmBWETwmxosJQ.desc=§bHigh-Performance Solvent§r is the best tier of solvent which can be used in bedrock ore processing, yielding many rare materials such as§6 Bismuth§r and §6Technetium-99§r.%n%n§2These materials are not available from earth bedrock ores.

# Quest: Fusion Power
betterquesting.quest.WS2zNdGdTnmclQfj2ARCog.name=Fusion Power
betterquesting.quest.WS2zNdGdTnmclQfj2ARCog.desc=The §3Fusion Reactor Boiler§r is simplest method of extracting power from a fusion reactor, outputting §bSuper Dense Steam§r to be run through normal turbines.%n%nDue to using plasma energy, both the MHDT and the boiler are affected by port sharing rules, meaning that having multiple connected MHDTs, or boilers, decreases the amount of energy each turbine gets, but overall increases the total amount of extracted from the torus. MHD turbines need at least 5 MTU/t plasma input or efficiency halves, and convert TU to HE with a +35%% bonus.%n

# Quest: Fissile Materials
betterquesting.quest.X6nUcp16QUqawLXQTqFTBw.name=Fissile Materials
betterquesting.quest.X6nUcp16QUqawLXQTqFTBw.desc=With fissile materials obtained from either §3Gas Centrifuges§r or nuclear fuel processing, nuclear bombs are made available.

# Quest: RBMK Fuel Processing
betterquesting.quest.a0YRGBjSTGiD09r4LqD8EA.name=Обробка палива РБМК
betterquesting.quest.a0YRGBjSTGiD09r4LqD8EA.desc=За допомогою установки §3Бочки для утилізації ядерних відходів§r для розпаду відходів та пристрою §3SILEX§r ядерне паливо §3РБМК§r можна переробляти на безліч нових матеріалів.

# Quest: Nuclear Waste Disposal Drum
betterquesting.quest.eadYFbwuQTS39P9cW-D-Fw.name=Nuclear Waste Disposal Drum
betterquesting.quest.eadYFbwuQTS39P9cW-D-Fw.desc=§3Бочка для утилізації ядерних відходів§r використовується для розпаду ядерних відходів §3РБМК§r. Розкладені ядерні відходи можна потім використовувати разом із §3Лазером на вільних електронах (FEL)§r та §3Камерою лазерного розділення ізотопів (SILEX)§r для отримання деяких рідкісних елементів, таких як §6Бісмут§r.%n%n§2Бочка також випромінює радіацію, коли всередині знаходиться паливо.

# Quest: PUREX
betterquesting.quest.g3S9-75wTGyQKmZaQTZl5Q.name=PUREX
betterquesting.quest.g3S9-75wTGyQKmZaQTZl5Q.desc=The §3PUREX§r is a machine that can reprocess depleted nuclear fuel into various materials. Most recipes require both §bNitric Acid§r and §bKerosene§r to function.%n%n§6Schrabidium§r can also be extracted from certain recipes, which require §bSchrabidic Acid§r. The schrabidium extracted yields double the schrabidium used to make the acid.

# Quest: Chicago Pile
betterquesting.quest.g8IVppPpTceY55PbNbceJQ.name=Chicago Pile
betterquesting.quest.g8IVppPpTceY55PbNbceJQ.desc=The §3Chicago Pile§r is a low-tech, modular breeding reactor with no GUI, built to transmute §6Natural Uranium§r into plutonium isotopes such as §6Plutonium-239§r and §6Reactor-Grade Plutonium§r through neutron bombardment. It must be operated manually or via §dRedstone-over-Radio§r; §3Chicago Pile Fuel Loaders§r, §3Chicago Pile Vents§r, and §3Chicago Pile Control Rods§r can be automated with Redstone-over-Radio.%n%nBuild a filled rectangular prism of §6Chicago Pile Graphite Bricks§r, at minimum 5x5x5 and at most 15x15x15. It does not need to be a perfect cube. Shapes like 5x7x9 are valid as long as all dimensions stay within limits and the shape is filled. Once assembled, right-click with the §6Hand Drill§r on a non-edge block on one lateral face to establish the core and fix the reactor's channel orientation. Using the hand drill on other sides creates holes needed for the reactor's mechanisms. Channels are straight lines drilled through the pile and may not intersect.%n%nThe front side of the reactor houses the fuel inputs, and the opposite side houses the fuel outputs. Fuel channels share the core's face orientation and accept rods via a §3Chicago Pile Fuel Loader§r on the input port; spent rods are ejected from the opposite side. Ventilation channels run perpendicular to the core and require a §3Chicago Pile Vent§r supplied with §bCompressed Air§r at §e1 PU§r. Each vent cools only the fuel channels within one block above or below it. Vertical control rod channels on top are optional and reduce reactivity between channels; they are useful for more precise fuel breeding. None of these mechanisms can intersect with each other.%n%nEvery reaction requires a neutron source. The §6Ra226Be Neutron Source§r is the starter option; the more powerful §6Po210Be Neutron Source§r can replace it later. §6Natural Uranium Rods§r breed into §6Plutonium-239 Rods§r, which can be bred further into §6Reactor-Grade Plutonium Rods§r. Leaving fuel beyond that point produces §6Nuclear Waste Rods§r, which generate extreme heat and risk meltdown. To safely push out spent rods without fresh fuel, use §6Zirconium Rods§r. They are inert and transparent to neutrons.%n%n§2Verify cooling is working before loading any fuel. The pile melts down at 800°C, causing an explosion and widespread fire.%n%nQuest requirements: Build a §3Chicago Pile§r of at least 5x5x5 with a core established, attach a §3Chicago Pile Fuel Loader§r and a §3Chicago Pile Vent§r, and load a §6Ra226Be Neutron Source§r alongside at least one §6Natural Uranium Rod§r.%n%n[F1] For more information.

# Quest: Spent Fuel Pool Drum
betterquesting.quest.har7pEFcSRKNgIf4NgmcLA.name=Spent Fuel Pool Drum
betterquesting.quest.har7pEFcSRKNgIf4NgmcLA.desc=§3Барабан для басейну вичерпаного палива§r використовується для охолодження гарячих ядерних паливних стрижнів для §3РБМК§r, §3ЗІРНОКС§r та §3ПВР§r. Він має 12 слотів.%n%nДля роботи барабана хоча б одна з його сторін повинна стикатися з §bводою§r. Чим більше сторін стикаються з водою, тим швидше охолоджується паливо всередині.

# Quest: Technetium-99
betterquesting.quest.iJiX7wxoSBmljc9tITqIqQ.name=Technetium-99
betterquesting.quest.iJiX7wxoSBmljc9tITqIqQ.desc=§6Technetium-99§r is a common waste product from the fission of §6Uranium§r and §6Plutonium§r. Reprocess ZIRNOX or PWR fuel early on to get it; it can also come from some RBMK fuels or bedrock ore with high-performance solvent. It is mainly used in making §6Technetium Steel§r and §dAE2 Storage Components§r.

# Quest: Cargo Landing Pad and Asteroid Mining Ship
betterquesting.quest.kb1Cp9wuS3eIjRD2YxiJdQ.name=Cargo Landing Pad§r and Asteroid Mining Ship
betterquesting.quest.kb1Cp9wuS3eIjRD2YxiJdQ.desc=The §3Cargo Landing Pad§r receives resource shipments from §3Asteroid Mining Ships§r.%n%nAssign a §bSatellite ID§r to an Asteroid Mining Ship and launch it using a fueled §3Soyuz§r. Insert a §bSatellite ID Chip§r with the same ID into the landing pad. The miner operates at §6Dres§r and prepares a shipment every §b15 minutes of running game time§r, while the pad can receive deliveries on any planet.%n%nKeep the pad’s chunk loaded and the space above it unobstructed. If multiple pads share the same ID, the §efirst to request a ready shipment§r receives it; no planet has priority.

# Quest: Flight Data
betterquesting.quest.ltOp2GyWQzm3n_bmKj4DPw.name=Flight Data
betterquesting.quest.ltOp2GyWQzm3n_bmKj4DPw.desc=One Space Laboratory will produce §eFlight Data§r for §6Disk Drives§r every 15 minutes.%n%nFlight data needs to be processed in the §3Supercomputer§r.

# Quest: Helium-4
betterquesting.quest.mPHQk4_mRqi6o2onNs9qgg.name=Helium-4
betterquesting.quest.mPHQk4_mRqi6o2onNs9qgg.desc=§bHelium-4§r is a product of fusion and is mainly used in crafting §6Quantum Processing Units§r.

# Quest: Houston, We Have a Signal
betterquesting.quest.ocylWycmSd6r-mvYENYGEw.name=Houston, We Have a Signal
betterquesting.quest.ocylWycmSd6r-mvYENYGEw.desc=Satellites require dedicated infrastructure to launch, identify, and communicate with. Before anything leaves the ground, every satellite must be assigned a unique frequency using the §3Satellite ID Manager§r. Place the satellite in its right slot to generate a random frequency, then use the left and center slots to copy that frequency onto §6Satellite ID Chips§r or other linked devices such as designators. ID Chips must be prepared in advance. The assigned frequency appears in the item's tooltip. It is highly recommended that the ID of the satellite is copied over into a separate ID chip so as not to lose it. To copy an ID, simply place the ID chip in the ID slot and the desired satellite next to it.%n%nSatellites can be launched using a custom rocket or Soyuz-FG. Once a satellite is in orbit, a §3Satellite Ground Station§r handles communication. It does not process §dRedstone-over-Radio§r signals directly. It requires an external RoR receiver or transmitter. It connects to one satellite at a time, switched via the appropriate §6Satellite ID Chip§r or an RoR command. RX reads data transmitted down from the satellite; TX sends commands up to it. The §3Satellite Ground Station§r is used to send and receive Redstone-Over Radio signals from satellites in orbit. §2The Ground Station's capabilities expand significantly when paired with an §3AUTOCAL§r§2, enabling automated satellite tracking, data processing, and chained multi-satellite logic.§r%n%nQuest requirements: Build a §3Satellite ID Manager§r and a §3Satellite Ground Station§r. Assign a unique frequency to a §6Satellite§r using the ID Manager, copy that frequency onto a §6Satellite ID Chip§r, and launch the satellite into orbit using a custom rocket or Soyuz-FG. Then use the Ground Station with an external RoR receiver or transmitter to communicate with the satellite.%n%n[F1] For more information.

# Quest: Xenium Resonator Satellite
betterquesting.quest.qrbz8mP0Ry-RtTBVRTkruA.name=Xenium Resonator Satellite
betterquesting.quest.qrbz8mP0Ry-RtTBVRTkruA.desc=The §3Xenium Resonator Satellite§r provides teleportation within the same dimension. Before launch, its frequency must be linked to a §6Satellite Designator§r using the §3Satellite ID Manager§r. When using the standard designator, the Y value may be omitted to default to surface level.%n%nA standard §6Satellite Designator§r requires coordinates to be entered manually. A §6Satellite (Laser) Designator§r is simpler - aim the crosshair at a block and right-click.%n%n§2Interdimensional teleportation is not supported.

# Quest: Ferrouranium
betterquesting.quest.rHdJmpZPSNWIvMLqALvC_w.name=Ferrouranium
betterquesting.quest.rHdJmpZPSNWIvMLqALvC_w.desc=§6Ferrouranium§r is an alloy of §6Uranium-238§r and §6Steel§r, made in the §3Crucible§r.

# Quest: Heat Exchanging Heater
betterquesting.quest.rRJfZe74TXqpP-q2faX7bA.name=Heat Exchanging Heater
betterquesting.quest.rRJfZe74TXqpP-q2faX7bA.desc=The §4§3Heat Exchanging Heater§r is used to cool down coolants used in reactors while also generating §eTU§r. The GUI's top field sets fluid used per cycle, the bottom field the tick delay. A §3Boiler§r can be placed ontop of it to heat up other fluids, such as §bSteam§r, to be used in §3Steam Turbines§r.

# Quest: Nuclear Bombs
betterquesting.quest.sCe8OyBsQEeMrUpYXUn9Yw.name=Nuclear Bombs
betterquesting.quest.sCe8OyBsQEeMrUpYXUn9Yw.desc=With access to §6Tantalium§r for §6Control Units§r and fissile materials, it is possible to assemble a nuclear bomb. Control units are made as capacitor boards using tantalum. To detonate the bomb one can use a detonator or a redstone signal.%n%nA nuclear explosion will transform ores into more valuable ones, such as §6Coal§r to §6Diamonds§r or §6Uranium§r to §6Schrabidium§r. Be prepared with radiation resistant armor before venturing into the crater.%n%nMake sure to stand behind some strong cover if you wish to see the explosion from close by.%n%n§2This quest serves as a list of components needed for various bombs. Some of these components can be mounted onto rockets that will carry the payload over large distances.

# Quest: Arsenic
betterquesting.quest.tgpCNtEfScSyk-mdGhGxmQ.name=Arsenic
betterquesting.quest.tgpCNtEfScSyk-mdGhGxmQ.desc=§6Arsenic§r is a substitute of §6Bismuth§r which can be made from acidizing §6Oily Dirt§r, found near §ebedrock oil deposits§r or from the environmental damage the §3Fracking Tower§r does, with §bHigh-Performance Solvent§r.

# Quest: Radar Survey Satellite
betterquesting.quest.xQEUURH0RH-QWqDAqs7Gzw.name=Radar Survey Satellite
betterquesting.quest.xQEUURH0RH-QWqDAqs7Gzw.desc=The §3Radar Survey Satellite§r detects all radar-visible entities - players, missiles, and more - within a 1,000-block radius of its target position. It compiles results into a searchable list with entity types and exact coordinates, and can filter results by class name without requiring a new scan.%n%nRoR commands: "survey" scans the area and saves results to both a base list and a filtered list. "filter name" replaces the filtered list with only entries matching that class name - the original list is preserved, so this can be run multiple times for different types without rescanning. "count" writes the number of filtered results to RX. "gettargetid index" returns the unique entity ID for a given entry, which can be passed to other satellites for precise targeting. "getposition index" writes exact X/Y/Z coordinates - separated by semicolons - to RX. "getname index" writes the class name of the entry to RX.%n%n§2Pair this satellite with an §3AUTOCAL§r and the §3Orbital Precision Laser§r for automated missile interception.

# Quest: Deuterium Extraction Tower
betterquesting.quest.yYyMBFJrRUOt39If3zFaFg.name=Deuterium Extraction Tower
betterquesting.quest.yYyMBFJrRUOt39If3zFaFg.desc=The §3Deuterium Extraction Tower§r is a much larger version of the Deuterium Extractor, making it an easy and viable way of making cheap fuel for the §b§r§3Fusion Reactor§r.%n%n§2A Ferrouranium Anvil is required.§r


## Quest Line: LV3.5 - Space Age
betterquesting.questline.enTskTtvRdajee3UMSgXKg.name=LV3.5 - Space Age
betterquesting.questline.enTskTtvRdajee3UMSgXKg.desc=Explore Space and colonise planets. This chapter revolves around the content of NTM: Space.

# Quest: Duna
betterquesting.quest.-aAyklEkSHK7wGxEEzQJ9Q.name=Duna
betterquesting.quest.-aAyklEkSHK7wGxEEzQJ9Q.desc=The red planet, home to vast quantities of §6Iron§r. §6Molysite§r and §6Volcano Gems§r can be found here in basaltic caves, found within basins where vast oceans were theorized to once exist.

# Quest: CMB Insert
betterquesting.quest.3fvMK3HASiaG4E0wg7MTrA.name=CMB Insert
betterquesting.quest.3fvMK3HASiaG4E0wg7MTrA.desc=§6CMB Iserts§r are an armor modification which will protect its user from the corrosive atmosphere of §eEve§r. %n%nThe §3Gas Giant Harvester§r will return back with §bJool Air§r, to be processed by the §3Cryogenic Distillation Machine§r.

# Quest: Industrial Greenhouse
betterquesting.quest.4HLGI5HyQtSw1G-iuwI0kg.name=Industrial Greenhouse
betterquesting.quest.4HLGI5HyQtSw1G-iuwI0kg.desc=The §3Industrial Greenhouse§r converts §bCarbon Dioxide§r into §bOxygen§r via crop growth. The greenhouse can also be supplied with §6Fertilizer§r for faster growing.

# Quest: Cryogenic Distillation Machine
betterquesting.quest.7kkbpR6rS4CsUTUFQ5wd7g.name=Cryogenic Distillation Machine
betterquesting.quest.7kkbpR6rS4CsUTUFQ5wd7g.desc=The §3Cryogenic Distillation Machine§r can split atmospheric gases into 4 useful fractions, like for example, taking trace amounts of §bNitrogen§r out of the Dunaian atmosphere to produce soil for planting crops.

# Quest: Teleporter
betterquesting.quest.8j7JCxPeSaaBqlOTrRGtCg.name=Teleporter
betterquesting.quest.8j7JCxPeSaaBqlOTrRGtCg.desc=The §3Teleporter§r can be used to teleport players, and entities in general, to a specific location.%n%nRight-click a block with the §6Telelinker§r to set the desired exit position, then shift-click the teleporter with the telelinker to configure the teleporter.%n%n§2The teleporter is a one way trip so it is advised that multiple are made.%n%nInterdimensional teleportation using teleporters requires a very expensive type of fuel, so it is recommended that other teleportations methods are used, such as AE2 Spatial. For fuel-free same-dimension travel, see the §3Xenium Resonator Satellite§r quest.

# Quest: Occasionally Heavy Boots
betterquesting.quest.9S1Tw8UTRbi8Z9wq7frVJA.name=Occasionally Heavy Boots
betterquesting.quest.9S1Tw8UTRbi8Z9wq7frVJA.desc=Temporarily increases gravity on low gravity worlds when holding crouch.

# Quest: Steam Radiator
betterquesting.quest.AB-0K2UoQF-7uQ9XiO8mqw.name=Steam Radiator
betterquesting.quest.AB-0K2UoQF-7uQ9XiO8mqw.desc=The §3Steam Radiator§r is a steam condenser that works in the vacuum of space.

# Quest: Tectonic Missile
betterquesting.quest.CRR3Op6SQMefJL6r8uAfrA.name=Tectonic Missile
betterquesting.quest.CRR3Op6SQMefJL6r8uAfrA.desc=When a §6Tectonic Missile§r hits, it creates a volcano that immediately starts to splash volcanic lava everywhere. Which is what you need to get the volcanic gem!

# Quest: Gallium Arsenide
betterquesting.quest.DeOqQyXwQRq5RNcDa5l0ug.name=Gallium Arsenide
betterquesting.quest.DeOqQyXwQRq5RNcDa5l0ug.desc=§6Gallium Arsenide§r is made from mixing §6Gallium§r, which can be procured by processing rich mineral deposits from §eMoho§r or §eIke§r, and §6Arsenic§r which is found on Ike in bedrock ore, or on §eEarth§r via dirt and stone that has been damaged by hydraulic fracking.

# Quest: Gas Giant Harvester
betterquesting.quest.EE3856t_QVu_cAG6P033_Q.name=Gas Giant Harvester
betterquesting.quest.EE3856t_QVu_cAG6P033_Q.desc=The §3Gas Giant Harvester Station§r is a device for collecting atmospheric air samples from gas giants.%n%nThe concept is quite simple: on a planet that is a satellite of the giant (for example, to fly to the green giant Jool, you need to go to Laythe), the station is set up. After refueling with §bLiquid Oxygen§r and §bHydrogen§r, the §3harvester rocket§r is sent for air. In one trip, it delivers 16,000 mB§r. As you can understand, the harvester's§r functionality is completely analogous to the operation of §3MiningModules§r.

# Quest: Mun Cow?!
betterquesting.quest.EVr_kBsgS2Wb6Knw0wuihw.name=Mun Cow?!
betterquesting.quest.EVr_kBsgS2Wb6Knw0wuihw.desc=This is something new; don't ask questions like how a cow survives on the Mun without food or where it got a PLSS module. The fact is, they feel quite well on the Mun, and due to the vacuum, the milk inside them has curdled.

# Quest: Vacuum Solderer
betterquesting.quest.G3Em4SXiQee1Yu-Rd0yGaA.name=Vacuum Solderer
betterquesting.quest.G3Em4SXiQee1Yu-Rd0yGaA.desc=The §3Vacuum Solderer§r is a machine that can only function in a vacuum, and produces vacuum circuits. They can be placed into the §3Drive Processor§r to enable it to process higher tier planetary drives.

# Quest: Space Equipment
betterquesting.quest.HvPzivF4SWWIDt5syO87xA.name=Space Equipment
betterquesting.quest.HvPzivF4SWWIDt5syO87xA.desc=The §6PLSS§r is an armor modification which will allow you to breathe in space. It will only work on airtight sealed suits.%n%nThe §6Heavy Boots§r can be used to quickly descend down in low-gravity environments.

# Quest: Ike
betterquesting.quest.KItM5UOCSNmCMNKnohadaQ.name=Ike
betterquesting.quest.KItM5UOCSNmCMNKnohadaQ.desc=§eIke§r, the sole moon of §eDuna§r, has hints of a past as a significant hazardous waste dump, with large spires and pyramids reminiscent of potential designs on Earth for warning future civilizations of great danger in relation to nuclear waste. §eMeteor dungeons§r spawn more frequently here, and pools of §bAlkyl Bromide§r can be found on the surface.%n

# Quest: Atmospheric Liquefaction Tower
betterquesting.quest.KQqx-tttRfG2DNO4tLbSCw.name=Atmospheric Liquefaction Tower
betterquesting.quest.KQqx-tttRfG2DNO4tLbSCw.desc=The Air Liquefaction Tower is intended for obtaining liquid nitrogen from compressed air.

# Quest: Drive Processor Tier 3
betterquesting.quest.LKTbDe35Rte7XOisZoywOQ.name=Drive Processor Tier 3
betterquesting.quest.LKTbDe35Rte7XOisZoywOQ.desc=The §3Drive Processor Tier 3§r allows for travel to §eLaythe§r.

# Quest: Atmospheric Scanner
betterquesting.quest.MqqnLpS-RLK6oNw12wzI7Q.name=Atmospheric Scanner
betterquesting.quest.MqqnLpS-RLK6oNw12wzI7Q.desc=The §6Atmospheric Scanner§r shows the atmospheric consistency of planets. Useful for when terraforming.

# Quest: Mobile Orbital Station
betterquesting.quest.NBDAp_kvThGG5C4yE0SiPA.name=Mobile Orbital Station
betterquesting.quest.NBDAp_kvThGG5C4yE0SiPA.desc=By having an orbital station have an §3Orbital Station Computer§r and §3Drop Pods§r, one can move their station to any destination they wish, massively cutting down on material costs needed to make new rockets.

# Quest: Drop Pod
betterquesting.quest.Ou1Dd0LTTgqox9lIWWOLNg.name=Drop Pod
betterquesting.quest.Ou1Dd0LTTgqox9lIWWOLNg.desc=With a §3Drop pod§r, one can access their space station without needing to build new rockets. They can also be used to land on other planets once the station has reached them.%n%n§2Make sure to keep spare drives.§r

# Quest: Stainless Steel
betterquesting.quest.Q0hC3CjIR4GB7MtYPpxXgA.name=Stainless Steel
betterquesting.quest.Q0hC3CjIR4GB7MtYPpxXgA.desc=§6Stainless Steel§r is an alloy made of §6Steel§r and §6Nickel§r. Combine them in a §3Blast Furnace§r or a §3Crucible§r.

# Quest: Drive Processor Tier 2
betterquesting.quest.QVJAi3JOR5in6VwMOEyL6w.name=Drive Processor Tier 2
betterquesting.quest.QVJAi3JOR5in6VwMOEyL6w.desc=The §3Drive Processor Tier 2§r allows for travel to §eDres§r and §eEve§r.

# Quest: Jool
betterquesting.quest.Rln_1bNXSHmwrz3lNURhwA.name=Jool
betterquesting.quest.Rln_1bNXSHmwrz3lNURhwA.desc=Jool is a gas giant planet with Laythe and two other small unnamed planets orbiting it.%n%nAs is logical, landing on a gas giant is impossible, but this doesn't prevent us from gathering resources from this giant.%n%n§2Jool's atmosphere consists of §bHelium-3§r §2(25%%), §bLiquid Hydrogen§r §2(25%%), §bChlorine§r §2(20%%), and §bNeon§r §2(12%%). To collect all these gases, we will need a §3Harvester§r. See the §3Gas Giant Harvester Station§r quest for the collection setup.§r

# Quest: Hafnium
betterquesting.quest.S0AQWdCYSeiUnhi2CmLszA.name=Hafnium
betterquesting.quest.S0AQWdCYSeiUnhi2CmLszA.desc=§6Hafnium§r is a rare light metal needed to produce the §6Hafnium chips§r, which at this stage in progression can only be obtained by centrifuging niobium crystals, which must be created from niobium ore, only found on §eDres§r and §eEve§r.

# Quest: Mun/Minmus
betterquesting.quest.SyNchvx5TpG6S7lF4jtiOA.name=Mun/Minmus
betterquesting.quest.SyNchvx5TpG6S7lF4jtiOA.desc=Your first destination! Absolutely chock full of §6Lithium§r, §6Quartz§r and most importantly your first source of §6Nickel§r to start producing §6Stainless Steel§r for space-grade machinery. The §eMun§r is the first atmosphere-less body available in a regular playthrough, necessary for making the first tier of §6Drive Processors§r in the §3Vacuum Solderer§r.%n%nThe B-Side destination alternative to the Mun, §eMinmus§r is characterized by a distinctive mint-choc-chip ice-cream aesthetic. §3Pumps§r function here, but instead of producing §bWater§r, this moon bizarrely produces §bMilk§r, allowing for full automation of §6Butter§r, §6Milkshakes§r and §6Ice-Cream§r.

# Quest: Laythe
betterquesting.quest.Tz9bzhSZQLGbAIEh4Zckbg.name=Laythe
betterquesting.quest.Tz9bzhSZQLGbAIEh4Zckbg.desc=A beautiful water world, teeming with life, oceans lit up with fields of glowgrass. §bJool gas§r can be harvested from here using a §3Gas Giant Harvester§r.

# Quest: Drive Processor Tier 1
betterquesting.quest.VetSLWDYS8OTb7T4X9aAEw.name=Drive Processor Tier 1
betterquesting.quest.VetSLWDYS8OTb7T4X9aAEw.desc=§3Drive Processor Tier 1§r allows for travel to §eDuna§r, §eIke§r and §eMoho§r.

# Quest: Brine Processing
betterquesting.quest.WRZqHx4ZRia4S1zEWYFg-Q.name=Brine Processing
betterquesting.quest.WRZqHx4ZRia4S1zEWYFg-Q.desc=§bBrine§r is extracted with a §3Derrick§r on the moons §eMun§r, §eMinmus§r and §eIke, and processed to obtain materials such as §6Nickel§r (purify pentlandite with brine), §6Copper§r and §6Sulfur§r, and fluids such as §bHydrogen§r and §bOxygen§r.

# Quest: Rocket Preparations
betterquesting.quest.XFyuo3SLQbmHtU7FcYdZ1g.name=Rocket Preparations
betterquesting.quest.XFyuo3SLQbmHtU7FcYdZ1g.desc=Build the rocket stage by stage in the §3Vehicle Assembly Base§r (each stage flies one journey), program each drive in the §3StarDar§r, process it in a §3Drive Processor§r, load the flight plan, then fuel the rocket on the §3Rocket Launch Pad§r - its GUI shows what is missing.

# Quest: The Mun is Cheese...
betterquesting.quest.XzMOPvBIS9uEkD5JEXBvUw.name=The Mun is Cheese...
betterquesting.quest.XzMOPvBIS9uEkD5JEXBvUw.desc=When a century-old joke gets out of hand... At least you can make a juicy quesadilla.

# Quest: CO2 Scrubber
betterquesting.quest.Z-fgT88oSuSYcPPLotHREg.name=CO2 Scrubber
betterquesting.quest.Z-fgT88oSuSYcPPLotHREg.desc=The §3CO2 Scrubber§r is a mechanism for cleaning air in sealed environments under increased pressure.%n%nThe device absorbs §bCarbon Dioxide§r from the surrounding air and collects it. It only works if two conditions are met: the room is sealed and isolated, and the air pressure is elevated (above 1.0 atm). The latter can be achieved by adding a stream of §bOxygen§r from the ventilation to the Earth's air (resulting in a total pressure of 1.1 atm).%n%n§2The maximum number of scrubbers in a room is 5; any additional units placed will not collect carbon dioxide.§r

# Quest: Orbital Station
betterquesting.quest.ZPHsRbLaQm60QluCeA8pVQ.name=Orbital Station
betterquesting.quest.ZPHsRbLaQm60QluCeA8pVQ.desc=The §3Orbital Station§r is a space station which is located at the orbit of §eEarth§r. §3Solar Panels§r in combination with §3Air Vents§r can be used to make a sustainable living environment in the station. Make sure to make airlocks to minimise air loss.

# Quest: Stardar and Drive Processor
betterquesting.quest.ZPfHiJvPQIutgvhSROlbeQ.name=Stardar and Drive Processor
betterquesting.quest.ZPfHiJvPQIutgvhSROlbeQ.desc=The §3StarDar§r is your base of operations for mission planning, helping you to locate and scan potential landing zones on planets, and §6Program Drives§r that can be inserted into your rocket's astronavigational systems to make journeys to said planets.%n%nThe §3Drive Processor§r processes drives that have been programmed by the StarDar, allowing them to be inserted into rocket navigation computers. In the Vehicle Assembly Base flight planner, place the drive for the body or station you launch from in the top slot and the target destination in the bottom slot.

# Quest: Atmospheric Compressor
betterquesting.quest.aZBaZGfVRHeXWmLqDHjuUw.name=Atmospheric Compressor
betterquesting.quest.aZBaZGfVRHeXWmLqDHjuUw.desc=The §3Atmospheric Compressor§r collects air from different planets. In combination with a §3Cryogenic Distillation Machine§r it can produce many useful fluids and gasses.

# Quest: Solar Panel
betterquesting.quest.dVwxKlQ5SzaxZjGNcLFMEw.name=Solar Panel
betterquesting.quest.dVwxKlQ5SzaxZjGNcLFMEw.desc=The §3Solar Panel§r converts sunlight into §eelectricity§r. §2(Incredible)§r%n%nIt can operate on planet surfaces or in space. The device uses the general light level, so the panel's spatial orientation does not affect energy production. The energy output port is at the back.%n%n§2Energy production calculations for planets and their orbits:%n%nKerbin - §e2kHE/s§2%nMun - §e2kHE/s§2%nMinmus - §e2kHE/s§2%nDuna - §e880HE/s§2%nIke - §e880HE/s§2%nMoho - §e13.3kHE/s§2%nDres - §e240HE/s§2%nEve - §e3.84kHE/s§2%nLaythe - §e80HE/s§r

# Quest: Magma Drill
betterquesting.quest.gaeSExcOTaawSPifbbIVtg.name=Magma Drill
betterquesting.quest.gaeSExcOTaawSPifbbIVtg.desc=Unlike its counterpart from the original mod, the Magma Drill does not literally drill into the depths. It is designed for extracting magma from Moho, which, as known, is abundant on this planet both on the surface and in caves. To start working, the mechanism must be installed directly on the surface of a lava lake so that the lava touches the drill head and reaches the edges of the recess. Supply power to the drill, and it will operate automatically.%n%nMagma is output through casting channels into molds. Cooled magma forms Vulcanite, which should then be processed to obtain useful resources.%n%nIn addition to volcanite, the device extracts regular slag (much more than Vulcanite).

# Quest: Orbital Station Computer
betterquesting.quest.hG3STfQVT8uxD0PMB58DOQ.name=Orbital Station Computer
betterquesting.quest.hG3STfQVT8uxD0PMB58DOQ.desc=The §3Orbital Station Computer§r, when having a drive inserted into it, can move the station to its destination.%n%n§3Thrusters§r with fuel are required to be attached to the station.

# Quest: Alkylation Unit
betterquesting.quest.icj9Y8q0QiWjFk2g7dTnww.name=Alkylation Unit
betterquesting.quest.icj9Y8q0QiWjFk2g7dTnww.desc=The §3Alkylation Unit§r is designed to convert lighter hydrocarbons into useful heavier hydrocarbon products. From §bNatural Gas§r it can produce §bUnsaturated§r and §bAromatic hydrocarbons§r, commonly used for §6Rubber§r and §6Bakelite§r, and even produce §bBTX§r via the use of §bHigh-Performance Solvent§r. As a utility, it can also alkylate §bPetroleum Gas§r into §bLight Oil§r.

# Quest: Microgravity Algae Film
betterquesting.quest.nfgxBE2jRE2InE-vMVEfRQ.name=Microgravity Algae Film
betterquesting.quest.nfgxBE2jRE2InE-vMVEfRQ.desc=The §3Microgravity Algae Film§r is a machine is made of specialized layers of laythe plants that will convert §bCarbon Dioxide§r directly into §bLiquid Oxygen§r. They however only function when in orbit.%n%nThe §3CO2 Scrubber§r allows you to recover carbon dioxide from a pressurized room. This is occasionally useful when building space stations.

# Quest: Dres
betterquesting.quest.rkMKa7TCT5u0jJsdH6TWnw.name=Dres
betterquesting.quest.rkMKa7TCT5u0jJsdH6TWnw.desc=This planet has some of the most prized resources in the whole system, with even the primary fraction of bedrock ore consisting of incredibly valuable metals and materials. §6Niobium§r, §6Coltan§r, and §6Lanthanium§r ore is present here in vast quantities.

# Quest: StarDar Remote Access Console
betterquesting.quest.seA5V2QkTCO9NcMwAjcDIA.name=StarDar Remote Access Console
betterquesting.quest.seA5V2QkTCO9NcMwAjcDIA.desc=Links to a §3StarDar§r to give remote access to mission planning (drive programming and landing-zone scans). See the §3Stardar and Drive Processor§r quest.

# Quest: Tekto
betterquesting.quest.tryLG0jySbGKMHzTFhvWOA.name=Tekto
betterquesting.quest.tryLG0jySbGKMHzTFhvWOA.desc=A strange world, similar to §eEarth§r, where life is different because the vegetation, the only form of life there, is made of complex polymers, like rubber§r and plastic§r.%n%nTekto bedrock ore doesn’t have the non-metal variant; instead, it is replaced by the plastic variant, from which the player can obtain §6Polymer§r, §6Rubber§r, §6Semtex§r and §6PVC§r.

# Quest: My First Volcano!
betterquesting.quest.vTg3C5JATXuER43bG5IiiQ.name=My First Volcano!
betterquesting.quest.vTg3C5JATXuER43bG5IiiQ.desc=The formation of a volcano is driven by the §3volcanic core§r, a block that continuously erupts §blava§r, allowing the volcano to grow. The §blava§r cools quickly, turning into §6basalt§r or §6basaltic ore§r.%n%nThe resulting volcano grows quite slowly, reaching about 60 blocks in height over 20-30 minutes.%n%n§bVolcanic lava§r differs from §bregular lava§r not only in appearance. It "melts" any non-explosion-resistant blocks, so the volcano can extend underground.%n%n§6Basaltic ores§r (§6asbestos§r, §6sulfur§r, §6fluorite§r, §6molysite§r) form when the §blava§r cools, each with a 0.5%% chance.%n%n§6Volcanic gem ore§r spawns with a 5%% chance if the following conditions are met:%n- All 6 blocks around the cooling §blava§r are §6basalt§r or §blava§r;%n- The block 10 blocks above the cooling §blava§r is §6basalt§r or §blava§r;%n- There are fewer than 3 §blava§r blocks around the cooling §blava§r.%n%nThe §6ore§r also forms after §bvolcanic lava§r contacts §6diamond ore§r.%nThis means §6volcanic gems§r most often appear near the §3core§r or §3crater§r of the volcano.%n%n§3Forming a Radioactive Volcano§r%nIf the §3volcanic core§r is exposed to radioactive fallout (e.g., after a nearby nuclear explosion) for some time, the §3core§r will begin generating new §bvolcanic radioactive lava§r (yellow in color), ultimately leading to the formation of a so-called §3radioactive volcano§r. Such a volcano will consist not of §6basalt§r but of various types of §6quenched sellaphite blocks§r and §6sellaphite ores§r. The §blava§r will convert §6diamond ores§r into §6radioactive gem ore§r.

# Quest: Eve
betterquesting.quest.vWpv_FM5QYqYHsRsaNNwog.name=Eve
betterquesting.quest.vWpv_FM5QYqYHsRsaNNwog.desc=While it is possible to travel here with only a tier 2 drive processor to exploit the incredibly powerful schrabidic resources that exist here, players will not last long without the appropriate armor inserts, due to the highly corrosive atmosphere melting any armor it comes into contact with.%n

# Quest: Rocket Assembling and Launching
betterquesting.quest.w4uLB-JtTW-fCQA_qF6_ww.name=Rocket Assembling and Launching
betterquesting.quest.w4uLB-JtTW-fCQA_qF6_ww.desc=The §3Vehicle Assembly Base§r is a structure which is one of the most vital parts of your space-faring efforts. It'll allow you to stack your rockets and plan out each segment of your journey. Note that each rocket stage allows for one launch from a celestial body to another, so a two-stage rocket can make a round-trip between, say, the Earth and the Mun.%n%nThe §3Rocket Launch Pad§r is the only launch pad capable of supporting the various fuel loads and complex requirements of the stacked rockets. This is the only way to fuel up a rocket too, so you'll want to make multiple stages for launching from bodies without a pad. The pad itself has a GUI that'll indicate what your rocket requires to be launched. Note that satellite launches require regular drives, not station drives.

# Quest: Volcanic Gem
betterquesting.quest.xbXJIo86R_-J4iKK6DY-6w.name=Volcanic Gem
betterquesting.quest.xbXJIo86R_-J4iKK6DY-6w.desc=A very valuable gemstone that is used to create a §6Cast Pickaxe§r, §6Meteorite Talisman§r, §6Black Diamond§r, §6Composite Euphemium Plates§r and §6Special 227mm Shells§r.

# Quest: Hydrazine
betterquesting.quest.xo0vihnyQgq8RTEi2c_ZZQ.name=Hydrazine
betterquesting.quest.xo0vihnyQgq8RTEi2c_ZZQ.desc=§bHydrazine§r is a powerful rocket fuel which is needed to operate a §3Drop Pod§r.

# Quest: Rocket Transporter Pad
betterquesting.quest.y2yrIQ6QRve-p9fRVJD0YA.name=Rocket Transporter Pad
betterquesting.quest.y2yrIQ6QRve-p9fRVJD0YA.desc=The §3Rocket Transporter Station§r is essential for sending and receiving cargo between celestial bodies.%n%n§3Transport rockets§r, similar to §3resource modules§r or §3Gas Giant Harvesters§r, automatically move various cargoes. To make the system work, you need at least one pair of linked platforms§r.%n%nThe platforms have compartments for outgoing and incoming items (blue and orange, respectively)§r, and they can handle liquids with §3dedicated buffers§r.%n%nTo link platforms, Shift+Right-Click with the §6Rocket Transporter Connector§r on one platform to save it, then Right-Click on another platform. To open the linker interface§r, Right-Click on a platform with the connector: it will display information about the linked platforms' locations.%n%nTo designate one of these points as the receiving point, click the button at the beginning of the row§r.%n%nTo launch the transporter rocket§r, the station must be fueled with §bliquid oxygen§r and §bhydrogen§r.

# Quest: Moho
betterquesting.quest.yWu2LtytQjGg65tFXTo2ow.name=Moho
betterquesting.quest.yWu2LtytQjGg65tFXTo2ow.desc=A fair-dinkum planet, hot as hell, and full of rare resources generally only found in the Nether. §6Australium§r is only found here, in vast quantities deep under the surface. Some of the largest caves ever generated within Minecraft can be found here.


## Quest Line: LV4 - End Game
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAw.name=LV4 - End Game
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAw.desc=Delve into Impossible Physics, Quantum Computing, Magic and maybe even destroy the world.%nThis chapter is about building the most advanced machines to reach the end goal of the mod.

# Quest: ICF Fuels
betterquesting.quest.2BKf-swBTG61f8eVn9ynhw.name=ICF Fuels
betterquesting.quest.2BKf-swBTG61f8eVn9ynhw.desc=The §3ICF§r can process different combinations of fuels at different laser power levels. A cheap and renewable fuel that can be used to gather the §bStellar Flux§r needed for §6Gerald§r and make decent power is §bHelium-4 - Hydrogen§r.%n%nApplying a Muon Particle to a fuel pellet will decrease the power that is needed to run it. Xenon-based fuels are also usable.

# Quest: Dineutronium Armor
betterquesting.quest.6PZEF2npTwy_exs-JQAKYg.name=Dineutronium Armor
betterquesting.quest.6PZEF2npTwy_exs-JQAKYg.desc=§6Dineutronium armor§r (helmet, plate, legs and boots): an endgame protective suit crafted from §6dineutronium§r.

# Quest: Particle Capsules
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA8A.name=Particle Capsules
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA8A.desc=Particles are important items required to create exotic materials which are needed for most of the endgame content. Detection needs empty capsules and a defocus of 0 - provide enough quadrupoles; the source block's error messages tell you what is wrong.

# Quest: Quantum Computer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFg.name=Quantum Computer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFg.desc=The §6Quantum Computer§r is the most powerful out of any other control unit. It currently only used to build §6Gerald§r and §6DFC§r.%n%n§2A whole stack of them will be required, so now would be the time to upgrade circuit crafting infrastructure.

# Quest: Solid State Quantum Processor
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGA.name=Solid State Quantum Processor
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGA.desc=The §6Solid State Quantum Processor§r is the first quantum circuit related component needed to make §6Quantum Processing Units§r and §6Quantum Computers§r.

# Quest: DNT Nanosuit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANQ.name=DNT Nanosuit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANQ.desc=The §6DNT Nanosuit§r is final goal of the mod. By crafting this armor you have reached the end of progression.%n%n§5Thanks for playing!

# Quest: DFC
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANw.name=DFC
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANw.desc=The §3DFC§r is the last reactor of the mod and as such is very expensive to craft. Apart from the DFC parts, two §6Catalysts§r are needed for the reactor to work.%n%nIt is recommended that the wiki is checked out.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/DFC[/url]

# Quest: Chicken Nugget
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATQ.name=Chicken Nugget
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATQ.desc=The §6Chicken Nugget§r is the best food item in the mod, completely filling up both hunger and saturation. It is made by colliding 2 raw chickens in a §3Particle Accelerator§r.

# Quest: Exposure Chamber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZg.name=Exposure Chamber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZg.desc=The §3Exposure Chamber§r is a machine in which many materials can be created by exposing ingots to certain particles, most important of which being §6Dineutronium§r. It also processes uranium-238 into schrabidium.

# Quest: Euphemium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_A.name=Euphemium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_A.desc=§6Euphemium§r is a fictional material which serves as one of the mod's most endgame materials. It's extremely expensive to produce in large amounts and you will need great advancement through the mod to use it effectively.

# Quest: Dineutronium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_Q.name=Dineutronium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_Q.desc=§6Dineutronium§r is the mod's (almost) ultimate material. It's a final tier material and is a higher tier than even §6Euphemium§r. It is very difficult to produce and it's used to make the most absurd and broken items this mod has. The only material that is more difficult to make, would be §6Osmiridium§r.

# Quest: The Digamma Particle
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_g.name=The Digamma Particle
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_g.desc=The §c§r§4§r§6Digamma Particle§r is created by colliding a §6Sparkticle Capsule§r with a §6Higgs Boson Capsule§r in a §3Particle Accelerator§r. Making it in the particle accelerator will require §6Chlorophyte Coils§r and momentum of 70,000.%n%nThe digamma particle emits a different kind of radiation, §4DRX§r, which currently can only be countered by the use of digamma medication, most notably §6Enteramine Pills§r, which provide full immunity against DRX for 10 minutes. After the §3DFC§r, Fau armor can be crafted which provides full resistance against DRX.

# Quest: Murky Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_w.name=Murky Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_w.desc=The§3 Murky Anvil§r is the ultimate version of the §3Anvil§r, having all recipes unlocked.

# Quest: Quantum Processing Unit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbQ.name=Quantum Processing Unit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbQ.desc=The §6Quantum Processing Unit§r is the first quantum circuit one makes, used in the §3Particle Accelerator§r and §3ICF§r reactor.

# Quest: ICF
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAig.name=ICF
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAig.desc=The §3ICF§r reactor is a very expensive and powerful reactor, which can produce a substantial amount of energy. Apart from the multiblock itself, §3ICF Lasers§r must be constructed for the reactor to work. §bStellar Flux§r will be produced during its operation which is needed to craft §6Gerald§r. Consider making use of §bLiquid Lead§r as it is a very efficient coolant for the ICF. §bBlood§r also works as an ICF coolant (turning into hot blood), and §bxenon§r can be used in fuels.%n%nIt is recommended that the wiki is checked out as it has built-in calculators for the laser power consumption and the amount of hot coolant it produces.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/Inertial_Confinement_Fusion_Reactor[/url]

# Quest: Spark Laser Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBA.name=Spark Laser Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBA.desc=The §6Spark Laser Crystal§r unlocks new recipes, most importantly it is used to create §6Osmiridium§r.

# Quest: The Book of Boxcars
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBQ.name=The Book of Boxcars
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBQ.desc=The §6Book of Boxcars§r is an item which allows the crafting of many special items. The book can be found inside §eMeteorite Dungeons§r found randomly in the wilderness on extra-terrestial bodies, indicated by a black pillar, or in §eRed Rooms§r.

# Quest: Digamma Laser Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBw.name=Digamma Laser Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBw.desc=The §6Digamma Laser Crystal§r is the fastest and final laser crystal which can be used in a SILEX.%n%n§2If the laser touches any block, the surrounding area will be atomized.

# Quest: Dineutronium Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABEA.name=Dineutronium Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABEA.desc=An upgraded version of the §3Anvil§r, [T7], which unlocks additional recipes.

# Quest: Spark Singularity
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABFQ.name=Spark Singularity
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABFQ.desc=The §6Spark Singularity§r is a singularity made from combining all the types of singularities with §6Dineutronium§r.

# Quest: FEnSU
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABFg.name=FEnSU
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABFg.desc=The §3FenSU§r is the ultimate energy storage block, being able to store over §e9 EHE§r (a 9 followed by 18 zeros) of energy.

# Quest: Gerald the Construction Android
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHw.name=Gerald the Construction Android
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHw.desc=§6Gerald the Construction Android§r is the most powerful explosive weapon in the mod. Using this has the side effect of setting the world on fire but also getting tektite, which contains §6Osmiridium§r.%n%nGerald is the hardest recipe of the mod requiring hundreds of thousands of items, mainly circuit related.%n%nVast quantities of §6Bismuth§r, §6Tantalium§r and §6Silicon§r are needed, so dont hold back on bedrock ore processing and parallelisation of many processes. If you havent already used §dAE2§r, it is highly recommended at this stage of the game.%n%nLaunching Gerald will result in a global firestorm that will decimate all life, including all trees and grass. Make sure to keep a backup of your world before launching him.%n%n§2Blueprints for Gerald and the Orbital Module can be found in structures or purchased from Bobmazon.

# Quest: Osmiridium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABIQ.name=Osmiridium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABIQ.desc=§6Osmiridium§r is the second most expensive material and is used primarily in the §3DFC§r. Obtain impure osmiridium powder by splitting §bosmiridic solution§r with gamma waves in a §3SILEX§r.

# Quest: Yharonite Billet
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABKg.name=Yharonite Billet
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABKg.desc=The §6Yharonite Billet§r is created in a tungsten crate that has §6Polonium Billets§r in it while being shot from a §3DFC Emitter§r. This is the final material obtained in the mod.

# Quest: The Crucible
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABLw.name=The Crucible
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABLw.desc=The §6Crucible§r is a weapon that deals extreme amount of damage. It can be recharged inside a Tungsten Crate shot by a §3DFC Emitter§r.

# Quest: Schrabidium Hammer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABMA.name=Schrabidium Hammer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABMA.desc=The §6Schrabidium Hammer§r is one of the most powerful melee weapons in the mod, able to one-shot almost everything.

# Quest: Magnetohydrodynamic Turbines
betterquesting.quest.DOSq2NdFQ3Ojsk2F4OtgMQ.name=Magnetohydrodynamic Turbines
betterquesting.quest.DOSq2NdFQ3Ojsk2F4OtgMQ.desc=§3Magnetohydrodynamic Turbines§r are advanced components of the fusion reactor that make electricity out of the plasma energy directly without needing additional turbines. While more expensive and requiring §bPerfluoromethyl§r cooling, they have a §e+35%%§r convertion bonus from §eTU§r to §eHE§r. In addition, the MHD turbine requires a minimum input of%n§e5MTU/t§r of plasma energy to operate normally, otherwise efficiency will be halved.

# Quest: Crystal Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.EmH6dgR3QM-VsLSlbNmeyQ.name=Crystal Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.EmH6dgR3QM-VsLSlbNmeyQ.desc=The §6Crystal Circuit Board§r is an end game circuit used for making §6Gerald§r and the §3DFC§r. The finished item will be received via the §3Cargo Landing Pad§r.

# Quest: Done
betterquesting.quest.FmWwl9ntTjeMSWhXcVcTdg.name=§cDone
betterquesting.quest.FmWwl9ntTjeMSWhXcVcTdg.desc=Phew, that was quite a journey... Hopefully there is more to come with some modpack updates!%n%nNow [warn]GO TOUCH SOME GRASS IMMIDIATELY[/warn].%n%n§6§lRATE OUR MODPACK: §r[url]https://moddex.gg/modpack/ntnewhorizons[/url]

# Quest: Secret Catalogue
betterquesting.quest.J9dwgncgSUydHFPUoI85oQ.name=Secret Catalogue
betterquesting.quest.J9dwgncgSUydHFPUoI85oQ.desc=In order to obtain a hidden catalog, you have to do a few things:%n%nGet a regular sign%nAnswer the four questions and put the answers on said sign in the same order (all lowercase)%nRight click the written sign%nThere will be answers with more characters than signs allow, just type out as many as possible.%n%nThere will be no hints, so don't even try it.%nYou'll need the bobmazon level 6 achievement to order anything.%n%n%n%n1%nWhen we scream into the distance, who will answer?%n%n2%nThe invisible force, sometimes subtle and sometimes not, covers our eyes directed at the skies.%n%n3%nThe fluorescent oscilloscope gives us the passcode of random numbers. Who holds the answers?%n%n4%nEver revolving, never still, a sight for the patient that reeks of tobacco, dancing perpetually.

# Quest: 0G Assembler
betterquesting.quest.JPSr8DfOQY2PeUK1AsgLvA.name=0G Assembler
betterquesting.quest.JPSr8DfOQY2PeUK1AsgLvA.desc=§60G Assemblers§r allow for the production of certain items in orbit, mainly the §6Crystal Circuite Board§r. Launching more assemblers will speed up the recipe. The input items must be launched from a rocket.

# Quest: Sensor Relay
betterquesting.quest.Z7AE9BtERMKxVRrSH2Zo3Q.name=Sensor Relay
betterquesting.quest.Z7AE9BtERMKxVRrSH2Zo3Q.desc=The §6Sensor Relay Satellite§r is used to produce §eOrbital Data§r. A single relay takes §e100 hours§r to produce one drive worth of orbital data. It can be sped up by installing more relays. Each additional Relay reduces the time linearly, meaning that a satellite with 100 relays will produce orbital data in just §eone hour§r.

# Quest: Particle Accelerator
betterquesting.quest._nmJ1zrSQp22psctX6Uq2A.name=Particle Accelerator
betterquesting.quest._nmJ1zrSQp22psctX6Uq2A.desc=The §3Particle Accelerator§r is a highly modular machine that uses high strength superconducting magnets to accelerate particles to relativistic speeds in order to collide them together. For recipes that demand high momentum, additional loops are needed. This quest serves as a guide on how to change the direction of particles.%n%nBelow is a miniature particle accelerator built for showcasing purposes. It is not connected to power or coolant and does not have any coils. It does not have RF cavities and uses two particle detectors as outputs. A compass is also provided in the image.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_PA1.png[/img]%n%nAfter constructing your Particle Accelerator, assuming the beamlines face the right directions, head over to the magnet that bridges the first and second loops.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_PA2.png[/img]%n%nOpen its GUI and configure the dipole magnet. The first line is for particles that have not reached the desired momentum. The second line is for particles that have reached the desired momentum. The third line is for particles that have reached the desired momentum AND are powered by redstone. The §cRed Line§r shows the direction the particle will travel towards and the §9Blue Line§r shows where the player is facing.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_PA3.png[/img]%n%nMake sure that for this specific dipole magnet the third line has the particle orientation facing towards the second loop, NORTH in this case.%n%nAfter this, the redstone logic must be set in order to be able to turn the particle orientation when powered. Simply provide power underneath the dipole magnet as such. A redstone signal should only exist when a particle needs momentum greater than what the first tier of coil allows.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_PA4.png[/img]%n%nHead over, WEST in this case, to the dipole magnet which is after the transitionary dipole and right before the detector, and which connects to the rest of the loop.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_PA5.png[/img]%n%nOpen its GUI and configure it. Make sure the second line is facing towards the particle detector and the first line towards the other dipole magnets.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_PA6.png[/img]%n%nDue to the complex and expansive nature of the particle accelerator, it is highly recommended that the wiki is checked out as it provides more information.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/Particle_Accelerator[/url]%n%n§2This quest demands the most essential parts of the particle accelerator, and does not represent the amount needed for it to function.§r%n%nQuest requirements: Build a §3Particle Accelerator§r with at least two loops, two dipole magnets, and two particle detectors. Configure the first dipole magnet so its third line faces toward the second loop when powered by redstone. Configure the second dipole magnet so its second line faces the particle detector and its first line faces the other dipole magnets. Provide redstone power underneath the first dipole magnet. Visit the Particle Physics quest chapter.%n%n[F1] For more information.

# Quest: HOW THE FUCK?!
betterquesting.quest.fbvQbC3JTKOtI2b8e3cB0A.name=§c§l§4§lHOW THE FUCK?!
betterquesting.quest.fbvQbC3JTKOtI2b8e3cB0A.desc=Here ya go, your reward

# Quest: ICF Laser Turbocharger
betterquesting.quest.hmwBFeuMQXiUrjE-WdD6-g.name=ICF Laser Turbocharger
betterquesting.quest.hmwBFeuMQXiUrjE-WdD6-g.desc=The §3ICF Laser Turbocharger§r can be placed next to §3ICF Laser Capacitors§r to increase the laser's power by a substantial amount, allowing for the §3ICF§r to run higher grade fuels.

# Quest: Orbital Data
betterquesting.quest.iBuyLOsSRcGJ6QBSIPZgMA.name=Orbital Data
betterquesting.quest.iBuyLOsSRcGJ6QBSIPZgMA.desc=Orbital Data is used for making §6Gerald§r. Due the amount it requires, it is highly recommended that a large amount of §6Satellite Sensor Relays§r are launched.

# Quest: Balls-O-Tron
betterquesting.quest.k-HwTdGiQVmikRwAeg_fkQ.name=Balls-O-Tron
betterquesting.quest.k-HwTdGiQVmikRwAeg_fkQ.desc=§4Balls-O-Tron§r is the second boss of §dNTM§r. It can be summoned by interacting the mechanist's circle, found in the §eEnargite Temple§r which spawns in jungles, with a §6Silver Key§r, made using the Maskman Coin, or from crafting the Balls-O-Tron spawn item.

# Quest: ICF Laser
betterquesting.quest.nqmqybchRzWn-T46-3vHmQ.name=ICF Laser
betterquesting.quest.nqmqybchRzWn-T46-3vHmQ.desc=§2This quest provides an optional retrieval task for a small laser capable of running Helium-4 - Hydrogen Fuel at 15MHE.§r

# Quest: UFO
betterquesting.quest.q0Q4S7F-QlCzGWDkdOBMqw.name=UFO
betterquesting.quest.q0Q4S7F-QlCzGWDkdOBMqw.desc=The Martian Invasion Ship is a late-game boss which is killed to get the §6UFO Coin§r, used in crafting Gerald.

# Quest: Welded Osmiridium Plate
betterquesting.quest.xYmNHPDAQkSwXHOow8--4g.name=Welded Osmiridium Plate
betterquesting.quest.xYmNHPDAQkSwXHOow8--4g.desc=§6Welded Osmiridium Plates§r cost 300 Billion §eHE§r to produce, so good energy generation and storage infrastructure is needed.


## Quest Line: Tips and Tricks
betterquesting.questline.MJP4MeAmSTm_Di0iRHoQuw.name=Tips and Tricks
betterquesting.questline.MJP4MeAmSTm_Di0iRHoQuw.desc=Tips and Tricks. It does what it says.

# Quest: Infinite Water Sources
betterquesting.quest.xlNjQwC6S3S5o_B7nIciBQ.name=Infinite Water Sources
betterquesting.quest.xlNjQwC6S3S5o_B7nIciBQ.desc=Tired of using buckets to give water to your machines? Try using water pumps or infinite water tanks!%n%nInfinite Water Tank will give 50mb/t%nLarge Infinite Water Tank will give 500mb/t%nPump will give 1000mb/t but requires steam to operate. Pumps must sit below Y:70; the Electric Groundwater Pump moves up to 10,000 mB/t.


## Quest Line: Advanced Logistics
betterquesting.questline.vNAB2bS7S9uSc1gAlAccnA.name=Advanced Logistics
betterquesting.questline.vNAB2bS7S9uSc1gAlAccnA.desc=Manage your factory and tackle logistical challenges with advanced redstone features.

# Quest: Displays, Buttons and More
betterquesting.quest.CXh5IW4AQaqb-p6bJlX2-A.name=Displays, Buttons and More
betterquesting.quest.CXh5IW4AQaqb-p6bJlX2-A.desc=ROR §3Panels§r can be used to craft useful ROR components such as Gauges, Switches, Graphs and more. Shift-Click with a screwdriver to configure them once placed.

# Quest: Network Separator
betterquesting.quest.E6WKf8t9SO2uzwcUHfkMtQ.name=Network Separator
betterquesting.quest.E6WKf8t9SO2uzwcUHfkMtQ.desc=The §3Network Separator§r can be used to split up a power network into multiple. It has a power gauge integrated into it and can be shut off by providing power from beneath.%n%nYou can control the priority and throughput of each network separator.

# Quest: Conveyor Upgrades
betterquesting.quest.Hw_8hujlQsGL2XyuZe-ndw.name=Conveyor Upgrades
betterquesting.quest.Hw_8hujlQsGL2XyuZe-ndw.desc=Conveyors ejectors can be equiped with two different types of upgrades.%n%n§6Stack Ejection§r, which outputs more items at once.%n%n§6Ejection Speed§r, which outputs items at a faster rate.

# Quest: Better Conveyors
betterquesting.quest.Jss-h7UPRO2s89rbuH-28g.name=Better Conveyors
betterquesting.quest.Jss-h7UPRO2s89rbuH-28g.desc=Multi-Lane Conveyor Belts can be used to transport items on different lanes on the same block, while the Express Conveyor transfers the items twice as fast.

# Quest: Fluid Overflow
betterquesting.quest.MTiLxFNwSxKjViwIaQJePA.name=Fluid Overflow
betterquesting.quest.MTiLxFNwSxKjViwIaQJePA.desc=Redstone-Over Radio§r in combination with a §3Redstone Fluid Valve§r can be used to detect when a tank is starting to fill up, and release the insides. This is useful for having buffers without having all the fluids being wasted.%n%n§2Here is an exmaple of a tank that will only output fluid once its full:§r%n%nFirstly, place a §6ROR Transmitter§r on one port of the tank, provide an ID and enable Polling.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Fluid1.png[/img]%n%nAfter that, place a §6ROR Logic Receiver§r next to the fluid valve and input the desired settings. Make sure that your signal is >= of your desired buffer. One redstone level equals to 16k mb.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Fluid2.png[/img]

# Quest: Gauges
betterquesting.quest.P_IpX7K7QbGEwCyd3wB2bQ.name=Gauges
betterquesting.quest.P_IpX7K7QbGEwCyd3wB2bQ.desc=§3Gauges§r are used to measure the amount of energy or fluid passing through the network.

# Quest: Conveyor Grabber
betterquesting.quest.QaxG5jTfQv2p5_rvauacdg.name=Conveyor Grabber
betterquesting.quest.QaxG5jTfQv2p5_rvauacdg.desc=The §3Conveyor Grabber§r grabs items straight off of the conveyor belt without having the line go into it. It does not have an internal buffer.%n%n§2Factorio inserter says "Hi!"

# Quest: Item Counter
betterquesting.quest.WvfpO4ICRQSzLpydFY-pTA.name=Item Counter
betterquesting.quest.WvfpO4ICRQSzLpydFY-pTA.desc=The ROR §6Item Counter§r is used to count the amount of items inside a container. It can transmit up to 3 signals, the items of which need to be specified with filters.

# Quest: Conveyor Boxers
betterquesting.quest.ZOQcs7g_SfylNX4zb39yGQ.name=Conveyor Boxers
betterquesting.quest.ZOQcs7g_SfylNX4zb39yGQ.desc=§3Conveyor Boxers§r package a certain amount of items into a box, configurable inside a §3Conveyor Boxer§r, and output them as a single item on a conveyor belt. They are then unpackaged at the §3Conveyor Unboxer§r.

# Quest: Combinator Funnel
betterquesting.quest.c3lGUKvHQpOUIBi6XoRoLQ.name=Combinator Funnel
betterquesting.quest.c3lGUKvHQpOUIBi6XoRoLQ.desc=The Combinator Funnel is used to perform crafts of the same item in a 3x3 or 2x2 grid. It becomes extremely useful for §eBedrock Ore Processing§r.

# Quest: New Quest
betterquesting.quest.c4m68dpfQXyH4q-ilwLZcQ.name=New Quest
betterquesting.quest.c4m68dpfQXyH4q-ilwLZcQ.desc=§2This quest serves as a guide on how to precisely input items in an arc furnace as not to waste electrode durability.§r%n%n§2By SkippyPlaysMC§r%n%nAssuming no upgrades are inserted in the §3Arc Furnace§r, there are exactly 20 slots available for items. To start, route all input items into a §3Conveyor Boxer§r which will send items into a §3Conveyor Unboxer§r. Adding speed ejection and stack ejection upgrades to the unboxer is highly recommended as so the items are inputed fast enough.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_ARC1.png[/img]%n%nPlace a §3Redstone-Over-Radio Item Counter§r on one side of the boxer, set the item filter and give it an ID.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_ARC2.png[/img]%n%nThen place a Redstone-Over-Radio Logic Receiver, give it the correct ID, and set it to emit redstone when item count is 20.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_ARC3.png[/img]%n%nMake sure that the boxer has its mode set to redstone.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_ARC4.png[/img]

# Quest: Redstone-Over Radio
betterquesting.quest.pj-4ZmrUToOlwxPjWw3m7A.name=Redstone-Over Radio
betterquesting.quest.pj-4ZmrUToOlwxPjWw3m7A.desc=§dNTM§r introduces §eRedstone-Over Radio§r, which is a system of sending redstone signals wirelessly. There are many ROR components which serve different purposes, from maintaining a certain amount of fluid in a tank to reading item amounts in containers.%n%nThe foundational components of this system are the ROR §6Transmitter§r and §6Receiver§r. As their name suggests, they can send and receive redstone signals. For them to be linked together, both need the same §eID§r.

# Quest: Telex
betterquesting.quest.q7VK8XTHQBOwq1mXC4RadA.name=Telex
betterquesting.quest.q7VK8XTHQBOwq1mXC4RadA.desc=The §3Telex Machine§r is used to send signals to other Telex Machines. It can also send signals if it receives a message and can print out messages on a piece of paper.

# Quest: AUTOCAL Automatic Calculator
betterquesting.quest.t2HnBelkRiKkjGv9JoKjLw.name=AUTOCAL Automatic Calculator
betterquesting.quest.t2HnBelkRiKkjGv9JoKjLw.desc=The §3AUTOCAL Automatic Calculator§r is a basic machine that reads a script, line by line, and performs actions based on those lines. This means it can be programmed with behavior, doing math, and handling signals. It communicates with the outside world exclusively using ROR signals, allowing RoR to supply it with values to be processed, and returning RoR signals to be displayed or for controlling RoR receiving devices.%n%n§2A documentation button exists inside the machine for people that want to learn how to use it.§r

# Quest: Logic Receiver
betterquesting.quest.v7HxbdInTsWOGVEmy4zaow.name=Logic Receiver
betterquesting.quest.v7HxbdInTsWOGVEmy4zaow.desc=The ROR §6Logic Receiver§r is a more advanced version of the receiver with a more extensive UI which can be used to specify the conditions that are needed for a signal to be received.

# Quest: Automatic Crafting Table
betterquesting.quest.z9LdlLLQRP64Psk4rxEDhQ.name=Automatic Crafting Table
betterquesting.quest.z9LdlLLQRP64Psk4rxEDhQ.desc=The §3Automatic Crafting Table§r is able to perform crafts when supplied with power and a blueprint inside of it is set. The Blueprint is located at the blue crafting area and the items can be defined by using either items inside the player's inventory or by dragging them fron the NEI menu.


## Quest Line: Building and Decorating
betterquesting.questline.7-1bBIkKRc6xhh5bwIGsjg.name=Building and Decorating
betterquesting.questline.7-1bBIkKRc6xhh5bwIGsjg.desc=Improve your builds by using Chisel, Architecturecraft and Better Builder's Wands.

# Quest: Building Gadget
betterquesting.quest.8voIl_BdSZWqZcTPQVjo9Q.name=Building Gadget
betterquesting.quest.8voIl_BdSZWqZcTPQVjo9Q.desc=The §6Building Gadget§r is an advanced building tool which allows the user to create many complex shapes with ease. Press the ALT key to open its menu.%n%n§2It consumes power for blocks placed.§r

# Quest: Auto Chisel
betterquesting.quest.QS-1ophNScaPpKGGoCqFMQ.name=Auto Chisel
betterquesting.quest.QS-1ophNScaPpKGGoCqFMQ.desc=The §3Auto Chisel§r allows for automated chiseling of blocks. Simply insert any chisel in the machine and the block that will act as the template.

# Quest: Chisel
betterquesting.quest.TA6SPr3KTbKsgRFceNMZmA.name=Chisel
betterquesting.quest.TA6SPr3KTbKsgRFceNMZmA.desc=The §6Chisel§r is a building tool which can be used to change the textures of blocks, and even unlock new and unique designs.

# Quest: Schematica
betterquesting.quest.VyF-RUbsSuS8J2hbI5CIkw.name=Schematica
betterquesting.quest.VyF-RUbsSuS8J2hbI5CIkw.desc=With §dSchematica§r, you can create schematics of your builds and post holograms of them on other worlds. Check out the keybinds to get started.

# Quest: Modern Markings
betterquesting.quest.j9eLuGnhRVWn5uJS_KI5lg.name=Modern Markings
betterquesting.quest.j9eLuGnhRVWn5uJS_KI5lg.desc=§dModern Markings§r adds wall and floor decorations suited for many purposes. Use the §6Chisel§r on the floor or wall signs to change their design.

# Quest: Better Builder's Wands
betterquesting.quest.mPZ8D32cT5WrvlKuPNq90g.name=Better Builder's Wands
betterquesting.quest.mPZ8D32cT5WrvlKuPNq90g.desc=The §6Building Wand§r allows one to place many blocks at once, making walls and roads easier to construct. The stronger material the wand is made out of, the more blocks it can place.%n%n§2To replace water blocks using wands bind the key, Change Fluid Mode, in settings.

# Quest: ArchitectureCraft
betterquesting.quest.p7NNm2NvRgWz37LQO6yraw.name=ArchitectureCraft
betterquesting.quest.p7NNm2NvRgWz37LQO6yraw.desc=§dArchitectureCraft§r introduces the §3Architect's Workbench§r which can be used to change the shapes blocks.%n%nThe §6Architect's Hammer§r can be used to easily rotate the blocks.%n%nThe §6Architect's Glowbrush§r can be used to apply light to any block.

# Quest: Sign Pictures
betterquesting.quest.wAu-q390TlKihyp-bEI2lw.name=Sign Pictures
betterquesting.quest.wAu-q390TlKihyp-bEI2lw.desc=The §dSignPicture§r mod allows one to put any image on a sign, opening the door to many unique building designs. Press  to get started.


## Quest Line: Farming and Cooking
betterquesting.questline.UJ4N6pDhQ5aGBxBW9j-BVw.name=Farming and Cooking
betterquesting.questline.UJ4N6pDhQ5aGBxBW9j-BVw.desc=Everything about how to farm and cook.


## Quest Line: Applied Energistics 2
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQ.name=Applied Energistics 2
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQ.desc=Automate your factory using Applied Energistics 2.

# Quest: P2P ME Networking
betterquesting.quest.1bFqt414QEOwMpAVRSd3zg.name=P2P ME Networking
betterquesting.quest.1bFqt414QEOwMpAVRSd3zg.desc=§3P2P ME§r can be used to transport massive amounts of channels without laying many cables.%n%n§2This quest serves as a guide on how to effectively use P2P ME.§r%n%nOnce an §3Energy Acceptor§r has been set up, it is highly recommended (and likely needed) that an §3Energy Cell§r is placed next to it as to ensure that there is enough power going to the system, as more components increase the energy demands of the ME system.%n%nAfter that, 2 §3ME Controllers§r are required, one to provide the channels that machines will use, and another to transport the other's channels by the P2P connections. The top controller can be made bigger by attaching more controllers next to it.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller1.png[/img]%n%nAfter the controllers are placed, on the top controller, a P2P Tunnel - ME needs to be placed on any side. The §9Blue Cable§r will serve as the cable that connects the P2P connections, and as such, it needs to be connected to the bottom controller.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller2.png[/img]%n%nBy linking the P2P connections together using a §6Memory Card§r, the 32 channels from one side of the top controller will only use 1 channel from the bottom controller to be transported to any destination. The §cRed Cable§r now has access to 32 channels.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller3.png[/img]%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller4.png[/img]%n%nBy expanding on the previous example, more connections can be added to fully utilize all channels.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller5.png[/img]%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_controller6.png[/img]%n

# Quest: P2P Interface Parallelisation
betterquesting.quest.1rIaClFKQbGXrdGi5-Eppg.name=P2P Interface Parallelisation
betterquesting.quest.1rIaClFKQbGXrdGi5-Eppg.desc=Parallelisation of processes can significantly cut down on waiting time and as such it is highly recommended that P2P Interfaces are used.%n%n§2This quest serves as a guide on how to use P2P Interfaces.§r%n%nAs any P2P Connection goes, there needs to be one input, which in this case, holds the §6ME Patterns§r.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface1.png[/img]%n%nAfter patterns are inserted in the first P2P interface, place down the rest of the output interfaces you want and link them together using a §6Memory Card§r.%n%nIn the image below, the P2P interface highlighted in green stores the patterns, while the ones in blue, are the output ones which will connect machines to the ME system.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface2.png[/img]%n%nMake sure to have blocking mode enabled on all output P2P interfaces as to prevent clogging and having multiple recipes trying to be executed at once in the same machine.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface3.png[/img]%n%nFinally, place your desired machines at the output P2P interfaces and add a way of retrieving the items once the operation is done, in this case import buses.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface4.png[/img]%n

# Quest: ME IO Port
betterquesting.quest.4DM_-wpzThCM_KaSMIPmNA.name=ME IO Port
betterquesting.quest.4DM_-wpzThCM_KaSMIPmNA.desc=The §3ME IO Port§r can transfer the contents of storage cells into an ME Network and back.

# Quest: Spatial IO
betterquesting.quest.5PE7heWhR4qG8AcOcZ0VWQ.name=Spatial IO
betterquesting.quest.5PE7heWhR4qG8AcOcZ0VWQ.desc=§3Spatial IO§r is a way to cut-and-paste physical volumes of space in your world. It works by swapping the defined volume with an identically-sized volume in the spatial storage dimension, sending whatever's in the pylon array to the spatial storage dimension, and whatever's in the dimension to the pylon array.%n%nSpatial IO requires a specific arrangement of its components in order to function, and define the volume to be cut-and-pasted. All of the components must be on the same network in order to function, and you can have only one spatial IO setup on a network. Thus, a subnetwork is recommended.%n%nThe §3Spatial IO Port§r controls the spatial IO operation. It shows stats on the multiblock setup, and holds the spatial cells%n%nTo perform a spatial IO operation, place a §6Spatial Storage Cell§r in the input slot and give the spatial IO port a redstone pulse. It will then swap the volume in the pylons with the volume in the spatial storage dimension. This means that if you send some set of blocks to the spatial storage dimension, then put another set of blocks in the pylons, put the cell back in the input slot, and trigger the IO port again, the 2nd set of blocks will disappear and the 1st set of blcks will reappear.%n%nAny entity in the defined volume, including you, will be carried along, and if you have no way of getting out, you will be trapped in the spatial storage dimension.%n%n§3Spatial Pylons§r are the main part of a spatial IO setup, and define the volume to be affected. The volume is defined by the bounding box of the outside of the pylons, contracted in by 1 block in all directions.

# Quest: AE2 Changes
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARg.name=AE2 Changes
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARg.desc=In this modpack, §dApplied Energistics 2§r has been changed to fit in more with §dNTM§r. Many components have been changed to include NTM materials and some machines, like ore processing and inscription, are handled with the §3Shredder§r (ore doubling) and the §3Press§r (plates and wires). The meteors have also been removed, but §6Skystone§r can still be crafted for building purposes.%n%nThis Chapter of the quests has its information derived from the FTB Wiki. If anything else is missing from the quest book, please visit the wiki.%n%n[url]https://ftbwiki.org/Applied_Energistics_2[/url]

# Quest: Certus Quartz Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARw.name=Certus Quartz Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARw.desc=§6Certus Quartz§r is an important material in AE2. It is dropped when mining or processing certus quartz ore at the rate of one to four, the yield is affected by a tool's Fortune enchantment. Certus Quartz is often interchangeable with vanilla §6Nether Quartz§r in the recipes for basic tools, such as the §6Quartz Cutting Knife§r. Certus quartz ore can be acidized or centrifuged for an increased yield.%n%n§2Certus quartz can later be made in a Chemical Plant from quartz powder and a crystal seed.

# Quest: Crystal Growth Chamber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATA.name=Crystal Growth Chamber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATA.desc=The§3 Crystal Growth Chamber§r is a machine in which crystals can grow at an increased speed, while also being in a block instead of being dropped in the ground.

# Quest: Wireless Terminal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXQ.name=Wireless Terminal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXQ.desc=The §3Security Terminal§r can be used to specify what players are allowed to interact with in the ME network which can be useful in multiplayer. It can also be used to link a §6Wireless Terminal§r to the ME network. Atleast one §3Wireless Access Point§r is required, and its range can be expanded using §6Wireless Boosters§r.

# Quest: Storage Components
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYQ.name=Storage Components
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYQ.desc=The §6ME Storage Housing§r is the outer shell of a §6Storage Cell§r. There are many tiers of storage cells, all of which require the use of NTM machines to be crafted.

# Quest: Fluix Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbA.name=Fluix Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbA.desc=§6Fluix Crystals§r are another crystal type which is used in crafting recipes throughout the mod. The crystal comes in two forms, the regular fluix crystal and the §6Pure Fluix Crystal§r.%n%nTo create a fluix crystal, 1§6 Charged Certus Quartz§r, 1 §6Nether Quartz§r, and 1 §6Redstone Dust§r must be dropped into a pool of §bWater§r. They will be consumed and output 2 fluix crystals.%n%n§2Quartz fiber for cables can be made in a Chemical Plant from quartz powder, fiberglass and water.

# Quest: Crystal Growth Accelerator
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcQ.name=Crystal Growth Accelerator
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcQ.desc=The §3Crystal Growth Accelerator§r is a machine that uses energy to accelerate the process of crystal purification. This process transforms crystal seeds into pure versions of their fully developed counterparts.

# Quest: Charger
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcw.name=Charger
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcw.desc=The §3Charger§r is a machine which will charge §6Certus Quartz Crystals§r into their charged form at the expense of power.

# Quest: Cable Fluix
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAeQ.name=Cable Fluix
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAeQ.desc=The §6ME Glass Cable - Fluix§r is a cable used to transmit data and energy between devices in an ME Network. It is capable of transmitting §f§e8 channels§r simultaneously.%n%nThe §6Quartz Fiber§r is used to transfer energy, but not channels.%n%n§6Cable Anchors§r can be used to seperate ME cable connections. They can also be used to make §6Facades§r for the cables.

# Quest: Energy Acceptor
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAew.name=Energy Acceptor
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAew.desc=The §3Energy Acceptor§r transfers energy into the ME system. In combination with an §3HE to RF Converter§r, the ME system can be powered.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_EnergyAcceptor.png[/img]

# Quest: ME Terminal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfA.name=ME Terminal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfA.desc=The §3ME Terminal§r is used to access all available items in the ME Network, including craftable ones.

# Quest: ME Drive
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfQ.name=ME Drive
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfQ.desc=The §3ME Drive§r serves as the storage of the ME system, in which §6Storage Cells§r can be put and store items.

# Quest: ME Interface
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfg.name=ME Interface
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfg.desc=The §3ME Interface§r is a block which allows the ME Network to interact with machines and inventories. On their own, they can be used to automatically stock inventories, but can be used with §6ME Patterns§r later on for autocrafting.

# Quest: ME Controller
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgA.name=ME Controller
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgA.desc=The ME Controller acts as the routing hub of an ME network. It can support up to 8 devices connected to it.

# Quest: ME Buses
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgg.name=ME Buses
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgg.desc=The §3ME Export Bus§r is an ME component which is used to export items from the ME network into a machine or other input inventory. %n%nThe §3ME Import Bus§r is an ME component which is used to import items directly into the ME Network from a machine or other output inventory.%n%n§2It is recommended that Interfaces are used over Export/Import buses for performance reasons.

# Quest: Infinity Booster Card
betterquesting.quest.EPrM6umbSw2e8c3-9XF9Wg.name=Infinity Booster Card
betterquesting.quest.EPrM6umbSw2e8c3-9XF9Wg.desc=The §6Infinity Booster Card§r allows one to access their ME system across any distance and dimension. To apply simply open the §6Wireless Crafting Terminal§r and insert the card in it.

# Quest: Void ME Storage Cell
betterquesting.quest.IPYh87hoSIS50cO0v3TkRQ.name=Void ME Storage Cell
betterquesting.quest.IPYh87hoSIS50cO0v3TkRQ.desc=The §6Void ME Storage Cell§r, when filtered, will void all of that specific item that enters the ME system.

# Quest: P2P
betterquesting.quest.Ig84-U5cRH-rxH76bIGE9A.name=P2P
betterquesting.quest.Ig84-U5cRH-rxH76bIGE9A.desc=§6P2P§r Tunnel or "Point to Point Tunnels" are a versatile configurable system to move items / redstone / power / and fluids from one location to another though an existing ME Network without storage.%n%nTunnels are §e1 input to N outputs§r. This means you can output to as many points as you want, but only input at a single point per tunnel.%n%nNetworks can support any number of tunnels, of any different types, and they all function independently.%n%nME tunnels can be used to carry channels from one location to another, and can carry up to §e32 channels§r, same as a §6ME Dense Cable§r, while only requiring a single channel per point, making tunnels a very powerful tool to expand me networks, especially over a distance. However with the great flex-ability they give you comes a limitation, the channel of a p2p tunnel cannot be carried by another p2p tunnel, meaning that you cannot nest them recursively.%n%nTo configure a P2P tunnel you must first attune the tunnel to carry what you want it to, then you need to configure the outputs to their input. You configure the connections by using the §6Memory Card§r. First Shift+Right Click the input to save it on your memory card, then simply right click the different outputs to store the input onto the outputs. this also sets the type of the output to match the type of the input.%n%n§2An advanced version of the Memory Card can also be made, which interacts with the entire network.

# Quest: ME Storage Reshuffle
betterquesting.quest.InB-Oh2tQ_eQ5zN69917QA.name=ME Storage Reshuffle
betterquesting.quest.InB-Oh2tQ_eQ5zN69917QA.desc=The §3ME Storage Reshuffle§r organises the items in your ME Storage Cells, reducing item type uses by combining them to save up space.%n%n[warn]Disconnect Storage Buses or else the system will pull them in and deposit them in Storage Cells.[/warn]

# Quest: Wireless Crafting Terminal
betterquesting.quest.Iyj0bDhVRpCgzmAF4vP30A.name=Wireless Crafting Terminal
betterquesting.quest.Iyj0bDhVRpCgzmAF4vP30A.desc=An upgraded version of the §6Wireless Terminal§r, capable of crafting items on the go.

# Quest: Interface P2P
betterquesting.quest.Kcfw9puQQo-iehBFrlOp4g.name=Interface P2P
betterquesting.quest.Kcfw9puQQo-iehBFrlOp4g.desc=The §3P2P Interface§r is a P2P device which can be used to easily paralellize recipes across many machines.

# Quest: Energy Cell
betterquesting.quest.Npl3Ifl9RvW8JZRicJaP2A.name=Energy Cell
betterquesting.quest.Npl3Ifl9RvW8JZRicJaP2A.desc=The §3Energy Cell§r acts as a battery for the ME network. It becomes useful when the ME system begins to consume large amounts of energy, so a buffer is needed so it doesnt turn on and off constantly.

# Quest: Modifier Cards
betterquesting.quest.Qxy7Wf9WRnG-vIisndmV0g.name=Modifier Cards
betterquesting.quest.Qxy7Wf9WRnG-vIisndmV0g.desc=§6Modifier Cards§r allow for modification to various ME components, such as speeding them up or being able to toggle them on and off using redstone.

# Quest: Wireless Connectors
betterquesting.quest.ReqBRrKdR2WFSp9ILSPk5w.name=Wireless Connectors
betterquesting.quest.ReqBRrKdR2WFSp9ILSPk5w.desc=§3Wireless Connectors§r allow for channel linking without ME cables, making it possible to send channels through walls. The further away the connectors are the more energy consuming they become.%n%nA §3Wireless Hub§r can be used to link channels between multiple wireless connectors.

# Quest: Network Tool
betterquesting.quest.VE7Ty89_SMW45uAVQdD32g.name=Network Tool
betterquesting.quest.VE7Ty89_SMW45uAVQdD32g.desc=The §6Network Tool§r, when right-clicking on any network device will bring up the tool's interface showing all devices connected to the network as well as network details. As any wrench, shift clicking on a cable will remove it.

# Quest: AE2 Autocrafting
betterquesting.quest.WUUIPZ-KQFCpsXAcpOxwqw.name=AE2 Autocrafting
betterquesting.quest.WUUIPZ-KQFCpsXAcpOxwqw.desc=§2This quest serves an a guide on how to order items using the ME system. The example item will be an Analog Circuit.§r%n%nWith an §3ME Drive§r providing item storage, a §3Crafting CPU§r and §3Interfaces§r, one can request any item to be crafted. The image below makes use of a §3Molecular Assembler§r, a §3Soldering Station§r, an §3Electric Press§r aswell as two §3Import Buses§r which serve as an output for the solderer and press.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto1.png[/img]%n%nThe first step in automating crafting recipes is to encode §6ME Patterns§r. There are two types of patterns, crafting and processing. The crafting pattern is created by having the §3Pattern Terminal§r set to the crafting table. After placing the items in the terminal, press the arrow to finish encoding the recipe.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto2.png[/img]%n%nFor recipes which arent made in a crafting table, such as the §6Wires§r and the §6Analog Circuit§r itself, the pattern terminal needs to be switched to the processing mode, which has a furnace icon.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto3.png[/img]%n%nAfter all the patterns have been created, insert them into their respective interfaces.%nMake sure to enable blocking mode on the interfaces as not to have multiple different recipes enter the interface at once.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto4.png[/img]%n%nFinally, after everything has been set up, the option to order items will be shown in the ME terminal.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto5.png[/img]%n

# Quest: Cell Workbench
betterquesting.quest._RJ-wMmFRWepNEgav4H2ZQ.name=Cell Workbench
betterquesting.quest._RJ-wMmFRWepNEgav4H2ZQ.desc=The §3Cell Workbench§r allow to filter cells to accept specific items. It can prove useful for when making a subnet for §eBedrock Ore Processing§r.

# Quest: ME Storage Bus
betterquesting.quest.b4Wb4VV0RkSBMjTUJj8Idg.name=ME Storage Bus
betterquesting.quest.b4Wb4VV0RkSBMjTUJj8Idg.desc=The §3ME Storage Bus§r, when attached to an block/tile entity with an inventory (generally a storage unit, such as chests or a §3Drawer Controller§r), will include that inventory's contents in the ME System.%n

# Quest: Pattern Capacity Card
betterquesting.quest.d4NudAjPT3G3f26jL0-SaA.name=Pattern Capacity Card
betterquesting.quest.d4NudAjPT3G3f26jL0-SaA.desc=The §6Pattern Capacity Card§r can be used to add 9 more slots for patterns in an §3ME Interface§r. Up to 3 cards can be inserted.

# Quest: Quantum Network Bridge
betterquesting.quest.di_RfA7kSDGB_3iCgsfVaQ.name=Quantum Network Bridge
betterquesting.quest.di_RfA7kSDGB_3iCgsfVaQ.desc=A §3Quantum Network Bridge§r is a multiblock structure that connects 2 potentially distant, or even in different dimensions, network fragments together. Created by crafting 8 §3ME Quantum Ring§r and a §3ME Quantum Link Chamber§r and placing the ME quantum link chamber in the center, and sourrounding it in the 8 ME quantum rings.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Qring1.png[/img]%n%nEach quantum network bridge requires power to function. This power must be provided from the network fragment it is attached to until the bridge is linked; at which time power from either side will be available. However if power is lost, connectivity will fail and power will be drained from the side the bridge is on in attempt to restore connection.%n%nTo establish a link between 2 quantum network bridges, you must create a pair of §6Quantum Entangled Singularities§r. One of each will be placed inside of a particular connection. Each Bridge may only connect to one other bridge.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Qring2.png[/img]%n%nAE2 Singularities are created by dumping 256k of any block inside a §3Matter Condenser§r. Singularities can become quantum entangled by dropping a singularity and ender dust and then exploding them together.

# Quest: Acceleration Card
betterquesting.quest.g0hMKPOqRWKCKtSyhQtPsA.name=Acceleration Card
betterquesting.quest.g0hMKPOqRWKCKtSyhQtPsA.desc=The §6Acceleration Card§r increases the speed of various AE2 devices.

# Quest: Dense ME Cable
betterquesting.quest.gZL_U2jPTZe5oDt8FcJ2QQ.name=Dense ME Cable
betterquesting.quest.gZL_U2jPTZe5oDt8FcJ2QQ.desc=The §6Dense ME Fluix Cables§r can be used to transmit §e32 channels§r from an §3ME Controller§r.%n%nOne controller is capable of connecting up to 6 dense cables, in turn each can branch off to 4 smaller cable lines connecting up to 192 ME devices to the network.%n%nThe §6Smart Dense Cable§r also displays the amount of channels that are been used, but is known to be less performance friendly than the dense covered cables.%n%nIn addition there are 16 colored cables made with the appropriate dye. The colored cables allow contact with other cables without sharing the signal or connecting to any other cable but the ones of the same colour.

# Quest: Molecular Assembler
betterquesting.quest.h0nPHR-TSQWbZhxIF9pAsA.name=Molecular Assembler
betterquesting.quest.h0nPHR-TSQWbZhxIF9pAsA.desc=The §3Molecular Assembler§r is used to autocraft anything that can be made in a crafting table.

# Quest: Crafting CPU
betterquesting.quest.ku71W0ZTQkOsyV4SQ0pPLA.name=Crafting CPU
betterquesting.quest.ku71W0ZTQkOsyV4SQ0pPLA.desc=The Crafting CPU is a multiblock structure composed of §3Crafting Co-Processing Units§r and §3Crafting Storage§r. When placed next to eachother they form one CPU which is used when placing orders via §3Interfaces§r. The more crafting co-processing units the more tasks the CPU can do in parallel while more crafting storage allows for bigger orders to be made.

# Quest: ME Pattern
betterquesting.quest.lFAX1X73QMiTSYhQ3ozq_g.name=ME Pattern
betterquesting.quest.lFAX1X73QMiTSYhQ3ozq_g.desc=§6ME Patterns§r are used to encode recipes to be used in §3Interfaces§r. They can be encoded in a §3Pattern Terminal§r.

# Quest: Network Visualisation Tool
betterquesting.quest.mH0ic-3aRnOZ8FjP-n9qYw.name=Network Visualisation Tool
betterquesting.quest.mH0ic-3aRnOZ8FjP-n9qYw.desc=The §6Network Visualisation Tool§r is used to visuallize an ME Network by right-clicking on any of its blocks, making it very useful when making a large network, especially one that uses §3P2P§r.

# Quest: ME subnetting
betterquesting.quest.n0clnMBkRw2Y4Asw6b1vJQ.name=ME subnetting
betterquesting.quest.n0clnMBkRw2Y4Asw6b1vJQ.desc=§eSubnetworks§r are ME networks which can be accessed from a §eMain Network§r. In §dNTM§r§r they can be useful for storing items from passive processes without flooding the main storage network.%n%n§2This quest serves as a guide on how to set up a subnet, which can be used to store the resourses that Bedrock Ore Processing produces.§r%n%nIn the image below are two ME networks, the §cRed§r one as the §cMainnet§r, and the §9Blue§r one as the §9Subnet§r.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET1.png[/img]%n%nFor the purposes of this quest, the main network will store dirt blocks, while the subnet will store copper blocks.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET2.png[/img]%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET3.png[/img]%n%nTo make the contents of the subnet, the copper blocks, visible to the main net, one must make an §3Interface§r-§3Storage Bus§r§r combo. The storage bus must be on the side of the main network.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET4.png[/img]%n%nMake sure to filter the main network storage bus, and to also make it "Extract Only".%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET5.png[/img]%n%nNow the main network has access to materials stored on the sub network, which can be used for crafting.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET6.png[/img]

# Quest: Overflow Void Card
betterquesting.quest.xyHVMuUHQjSWbujlx1EMqw.name=Overflow Void Card
betterquesting.quest.xyHVMuUHQjSWbujlx1EMqw.desc=The §6Overflow Void Card§r acts as a voiding upgrade for AE2 §6Storage Cells§r. It can be added to a storage cell using the §3Cell Workbench§r.


## Quest Line: OpenComputers
betterquesting.questline.7qWugdC9QfGJ31NktB0YqA.name=OpenComputers
betterquesting.questline.7qWugdC9QfGJ31NktB0YqA.desc=Use OpenComputers to monitor and control complex machinery.

# Quest: Memory
betterquesting.quest.-0Jqqg9TRmCEikNnquKeuA.name=Memory
betterquesting.quest.-0Jqqg9TRmCEikNnquKeuA.desc=§6Memory§r is like the §6CPU§r, an essential part in all computers.%n%nDepending on the CPU's architecture, the memory has a very essential effect on what a computer can and cannot do. For the standard Lua architecture, for example, it controls the actual amount of memory Lua scripts can use. This means that to run larger and more memory-intensive programs, you will need more memory.

# Quest: CPUs
betterquesting.quest.-SW2UUweSLCzJBCGcIm3nw.name=CPUs
betterquesting.quest.-SW2UUweSLCzJBCGcIm3nw.desc=The §6Central Processing Unit§r (CPU), is a core part for each computer or §6Server§r. It defines the architecture of the computer, and the number of components that can be connected to the computer before it stops working. %nHigher tier CPUs also provide a higher per-tick direct call limit to the computer - in simpler terms: better CPUs run faster.

# Quest: Internet Card
betterquesting.quest.1azNAAjWQLaNJLrVXT0W9w.name=Internet Card
betterquesting.quest.1azNAAjWQLaNJLrVXT0W9w.desc=The §6Internet Card§r grants computers access to the internet. It provides ways to perform simple HTTP requests, as well as to open plain TCP client sockets that can be read and written to.%n%nInstalling an internet card in a computer will also attach a custom file system that contains a few internet related applications, such as one for downloading and uploading snippets from/to pastebin as well as a "wget" clone that allows downloading data from arbitrary HTTP URLs.

# Quest: Transistors
betterquesting.quest.43PzmZVaTwS5ZaPt_fhugg.name=Transistors
betterquesting.quest.43PzmZVaTwS5ZaPt_fhugg.desc=The §6Transistor§r is one of the most basic crafting ingredients in OC. It is mainly used to craft §6Microchips§r and other electronic goods.

# Quest: Microchips
betterquesting.quest.5uHqD8E4RmWlcVca_5CJnQ.name=Microchips
betterquesting.quest.5uHqD8E4RmWlcVca_5CJnQ.desc=§6Microchips§r are the bread and butter of electronic component crafting. They come in different tiers, for crafting different tiers of components.

# Quest: Floppy Disks and Disk Drive
betterquesting.quest.6wQAgmUHTxavpGXJvZVhmA.name=Floppy Disks and Disk Drive
betterquesting.quest.6wQAgmUHTxavpGXJvZVhmA.desc=The §3Disk Drive§r can be used to read §6Floppy Disks§r using a computer connected to it.%n%nThis is useful to get started, since the lower tier §3Computer Cases§r do not have a built-in floppy slot, and you'll need an operating system to boot up the computer.

# Quest: Card Base
betterquesting.quest.70KciiqATFCPJR3s6eoIMg.name=Card Base
betterquesting.quest.70KciiqATFCPJR3s6eoIMg.desc=The §6Card Base§r is a common crafting material for card components in OC, such as §6Graphics Cards§r and §6Network Cards§r.

# Quest: Electronic Assembler
betterquesting.quest.7gCyEqlyTQqqnNxQ1cLt-A.name=Electronic Assembler
betterquesting.quest.7gCyEqlyTQqqnNxQ1cLt-A.desc=The §3Electronic Assembler§r is an advanded workstation that can be used to build more complex electronic devices, such as §3Robots§r, §3Drones§r and §6Tablets§r. %n%nThey require a large amount of energy to assemble devices, so it is recommended to power them sufficiently with a §3Capacitor Bank§r.

# Quest: Wireless Network Card
betterquesting.quest.8Bbui0CiRRm3hXTYH-ELpQ.name=Wireless Network Card
betterquesting.quest.8Bbui0CiRRm3hXTYH-ELpQ.desc=The §6Wireless Network Card§r is an upgraded §6Network Card§r that can send and receive wireless network messages.%n %nTier two cards can also send and receive wired messages. The signal strength directly controls the distance up to which a sent message can be received, where the strength is equal to the distance in blocks.

# Quest: Welcome to OC!
betterquesting.quest.90cLqSYpT8OevVo7UEEaGA.name=Welcome to OC!
betterquesting.quest.90cLqSYpT8OevVo7UEEaGA.desc=§dOpenComputers§r is a very useful mod which will let one automate many processes which normaly couldnt be done even with an ME system.%n%nMake sure to always check the §6OC Manual§r as it provides additional information of stuff that the quest book doesnt cover.

# Quest: Control and Arithmetics Units
betterquesting.quest.ABODDDQgRrGXZdmgdHJ7Sg.name=Control and Arithmetics Units
betterquesting.quest.ABODDDQgRrGXZdmgdHJ7Sg.desc=The §6Control Unit§r is used to create §6CPUs§r and §6Component Buses§r.%n%nThe §6Arithmetic Logic Unit§r is used for crafting components that perform calculations, such as CPUs and §6Graphics Cards§r.

# Quest: PWRangler
betterquesting.quest.DkfWKyKpReuU8BkzSMH3Xw.name=PWRangler
betterquesting.quest.DkfWKyKpReuU8BkzSMH3Xw.desc=§dNTM§r має вбудовану §6Дискету§r для моніторингу реактора §3ПВР§r.%n%n§2Цей квест є посібником з налаштування комп'ютера OC за допомогою дискети PWRangler.§r%n%nПерш за все, необхідно зібрати комп'ютер з ОС OpenOS. Для цілей цього квесту комп'ютер буде складатися з компонентів §bРівня 3§r.% n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_OC1.png[/img]%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_OC2.png[/img]%n%nПісля завантаження ПК встановіть OpenOS.%n%nПісля перезавантаження ПК замініть дискету з OpenOS на дискету з PWRangler. Після вставки введіть §oinstall§r, щоб встановити PWRangler у систему.%n%nPWR потрібно підключити до комп'ютера за допомогою кабелів OC безпосередньо на контролері.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_OC3.png[/img]%n%nНарешті, введіть §oPWRangler§r у комп'ютері, щоб запустити програму.% n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_OC4.png[/img]%n

# Quest: Hard Drives
betterquesting.quest.EdeL97xNTSmiLfPQpCJiow.name=Hard Drives
betterquesting.quest.EdeL97xNTSmiLfPQpCJiow.desc=The §6Hard Disk Drives§r are a higher tier storage medium in OC.%n%nAll storage media perform at the same speed: higher tier storage provides more space. There are also some devices that can only use disk drives (although servers could use an external disk drive, for example). Hard drives can be placed inside a §3Raid§r, allowing multiple drives to share the same file system. Note that placing a hard drive in a raid wipes the drive of its contents.

# Quest: Component Buses
betterquesting.quest.GWpBgrTUR6aiNelNbOLRWQ.name=Component Buses
betterquesting.quest.GWpBgrTUR6aiNelNbOLRWQ.desc=A §6Component Bus§r is a server-specific upgrade that allows the server to communicate with more components at the same time, without shutting down. %n%nLike with §6CPUs§r, higher tier buses provide higher component limits. Higher tier servers are also capable of taking more component buses, allowing for communication with many more components.

# Quest: Servers
betterquesting.quest.QFKT5L7RSrKQIz-qYhUsVg.name=Servers
betterquesting.quest.QFKT5L7RSrKQIz-qYhUsVg.desc=§6Servers§r are a form of higher tier computer. %n%nThey can be configured by holding them in the hand and using them - like opening a backpack for example. Servers can also be configured after having been installed into a Rack by activating them (aiming at the corresponding position on the frong face on the rack). To operate, the server has to be placed inside a §3Rack§r.

# Quest: Computer Casings
betterquesting.quest.XfkIHFJDRgSIyYD_F5b05g.name=Computer Casings
betterquesting.quest.XfkIHFJDRgSIyYD_F5b05g.desc=§3Computer Casings§r come in 3 different tiers, which limit the amount of components that ca be placed inside of them.

# Quest: Graphics Cards
betterquesting.quest.b14L2QcPTRiHysGkQNkTUQ.name=Graphics Cards
betterquesting.quest.b14L2QcPTRiHysGkQNkTUQ.desc=The §6Graphics Card§r is an essential part for most computers and allows the computer to display text on a connected §6Screen§r. %n%nGraphics cards come in several tiers, and like screens, support different resolutions and color depths.

# Quest: Screens
betterquesting.quest.fS6P083FQGWwxARPYM4eaA.name=Screens
betterquesting.quest.fS6P083FQGWwxARPYM4eaA.desc=A §3Screen§r is used in combination with a §6Graphics Card§r, to allow computers to display text. Different screen tiers have different capabilities, such as supporting different resolutions and olor depths. Screens range from low-resolution, monochrome displays to high-resolution displays with up to 256 colors.

# Quest: OC Power
betterquesting.quest.l3OJx_niTg-UyYUoyOXYfg.name=OC Power
betterquesting.quest.l3OJx_niTg-UyYUoyOXYfg.desc=The §6Cable§r serves as a way of connecting computers and machines that are far apart. If you have a compact build where all components touch each other (directly or indirectly, most blocks also behave the same way as cables) you will usually not need cables.%n%nThe §3Power Converter§r serves as the fastest way to convert energy from other mods' power systems to OpenComputers' internal energy. Placing an §3HE to RF Converter§r next to the PC will also work.%n%nThe §3Capacitor Stores§r energy to be used by the network, acting as an energy buffer when needed. It is very useful for tasks that demand a lot of energy, such as assembling or charging devices such as robots and drones.

# Quest: Computer
betterquesting.quest.zElcW5PDQwGOvbKnyroWEQ.name=Computer
betterquesting.quest.zElcW5PDQwGOvbKnyroWEQ.desc=A §3Keyboard§r is needed to type text on §3Screens§r, be they in the world or built into devices such as §3Robots§r or §6Tablets§r.%n%nFor the keyboard to work with a screen in the world, it has to be placed next to the screen, facing that screen, or placed directly on the screen (on top or on one of the sides).%n%nThe §6EEPROM§r is what contains the code used to initialize a computer when it is being booted. %n%nThis data is stored as plain byte array, and may mean different things to different §6CPU§r architectures. For example, for Lua it is usually a small script that searches for a file systems with an init script, for other architectures it may be actual machine code.%n%nAn §6OpenOS Disk§r can be crafted using an empty floppy disk and a manual.


## Quest Line: Kill All the Things
betterquesting.questline.DR3m8TVpSxKspj_MDcVlIA.name=Kill All the Things
betterquesting.questline.DR3m8TVpSxKspj_MDcVlIA.desc=You monster.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Pig)
betterquesting.quest.0LPqIRRCTuayXjyNUaboNA.name=Time to Kill (Pig)
betterquesting.quest.0LPqIRRCTuayXjyNUaboNA.desc=Mmm... turn on the grill. We need more meat.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Pigman)
betterquesting.quest.2R1OOnI5S0K57TglRYmGng.name=Time to Kill (Pigman)
betterquesting.quest.2R1OOnI5S0K57TglRYmGng.desc="Zombie Pigman"? What the hell is going on with you zombies?! Maybe you should encase your animals better at night...

# Quest: Time to Kill (Cow)
betterquesting.quest.6nKJ4mC3QB-i5nx8UXrPew.name=Time to Kill (Cow)
betterquesting.quest.6nKJ4mC3QB-i5nx8UXrPew.desc=I think I need a new backpack. Let's slaughter a few cows.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Witch)
betterquesting.quest.8G4ZvwvWQpihM6NfflMw7A.name=Time to Kill (Witch)
betterquesting.quest.8G4ZvwvWQpihM6NfflMw7A.desc=Witches bring stitches because they are always infernal and very dangerous. Be careful since they throw potions at you.

# Quest: MEGAKILL!
betterquesting.quest.C7CLvAjyQUy2aNW1HiA7Ow.name=§4§lMEGAKILL!
betterquesting.quest.C7CLvAjyQUy2aNW1HiA7Ow.desc=You killed them all! §cYou're monster!

# Quest: Time to Kill (Chicken)
betterquesting.quest.G8aNnibAQVuX1SG7XfuaeQ.name=Time to Kill (Chicken)
betterquesting.quest.G8aNnibAQVuX1SG7XfuaeQ.desc=Screaming doesn't help. You're going in the soup.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Magma Cube)
betterquesting.quest.JVB4_UIXR9SI2W66FWBnMw.name=Time to Kill (Magma Cube)
betterquesting.quest.JVB4_UIXR9SI2W66FWBnMw.desc=Now a Hell version of your slime!

# Quest: Time to Kill (Sheep)
betterquesting.quest.NASNKN6AQ52JY7XDbODGYQ.name=Time to Kill (Sheep)
betterquesting.quest.NASNKN6AQ52JY7XDbODGYQ.desc=Oh no, not the poor sheep! Fluffy and red, I'm so sad.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Blaze)
betterquesting.quest.Q70rGIFTR6uMPmobimGr9g.name=Time to Kill (Blaze)
betterquesting.quest.Q70rGIFTR6uMPmobimGr9g.desc=You should be careful with this task. Fire protection is highly recommended. [warn]Blazes are always spawning infernal.[/warn]

# Quest: Martian Invasion Ship
betterquesting.quest.Q8FZdwiURgC2PoD4IziLJg.name=Martian Invasion Ship
betterquesting.quest.Q8FZdwiURgC2PoD4IziLJg.desc=The Martian Invasion Ship is a late-game boss which is killed to get the UFO Coin, used in crafting Gerald.%n%nIt can be summoned by crafting the Martian Invasion Ship item.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Slime)
betterquesting.quest.Z-RsAsrVRM2a3zWP5a0OsQ.name=Time to Kill (Slime)
betterquesting.quest.Z-RsAsrVRM2a3zWP5a0OsQ.desc=Sticky and bouncy! Now in many variations. Say hello to my little friend, Lemon Slice!

# Quest: Balls-O-Tron
betterquesting.quest.ZeBLQUsPS72HAxsrR9s_3g.name=Balls-O-Tron
betterquesting.quest.ZeBLQUsPS72HAxsrR9s_3g.desc=Balls-O-Tron is the second boss of NTM. It can be summoned by interacting the Mechanist's circle, found in the Enargite Temple which spawns in jungles, with a Silver Key, made using the Maskman Coin, or from crafting the Balls-O-Tron spawn item.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Spiders)
betterquesting.quest.ZpKjClvCTGe4ytw_Yu6mYQ.name=Time to Kill (Spiders)
betterquesting.quest.ZpKjClvCTGe4ytw_Yu6mYQ.desc=Eeeek! Wall climbing monsters, gross! Slay them. Quickly! Watch out for the witch spiders, they can give as good as they get.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Creeper)
betterquesting.quest.fsdmCm47S3KB0X1A5MZwJg.name=Time to Kill (Creeper)
betterquesting.quest.fsdmCm47S3KB0X1A5MZwJg.desc=Who hasn't experienced this... You're just minding your own business, mining a few diamonds, and suddenly, you wake up in your bed, all your items gone. %n%nTime to strike back!

# Quest: Time to Kill (Zombie)
betterquesting.quest.gLK6mwA4ShOoVbZQZlM94w.name=Time to Kill (Zombie)
betterquesting.quest.gLK6mwA4ShOoVbZQZlM94w.desc=Nobody knows who they are, or where they came from. They're just annoying at night, and too stupid to make a crafting table.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Squid)
betterquesting.quest.hGvVPGL0SHmF0FpB4r600A.name=Time to Kill (Squid)
betterquesting.quest.hGvVPGL0SHmF0FpB4r600A.desc=Delicious squid. We're making Tom Yum seafood.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Ghast)
betterquesting.quest.j_v3k9rtT0CrTh_RsbyO6g.name=Time to Kill (Ghast)
betterquesting.quest.j_v3k9rtT0CrTh_RsbyO6g.desc=They shoot you with explosive fireballs but they are weak when you hit them or knock the fireballs back with a weapon. Better upgrade your armor with fire and blast protection.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Skeleton)
betterquesting.quest.lf-pKhIVShSHFv38Gg56lg.name=Time to Kill (Skeleton)
betterquesting.quest.lf-pKhIVShSHFv38Gg56lg.desc=Arrows are nice, if you shoot them. If one hits you, well, bad things happen.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Silverfish)
betterquesting.quest.pSowjULQT4ep05MVXa7BJQ.name=Time to Kill (Silverfish)
betterquesting.quest.pSowjULQT4ep05MVXa7BJQ.desc=Be wary, they like to disguise and clone themselves in stone-related blocks! (Applies to Vanilla blocks only) Can be found within dungeons and hills. Can also be found in Drowning Creeper spawned cobblestone blocks.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Wither)
betterquesting.quest.q1ilrpayTHWJ-bajd9WM1A.name=Time to Kill (Wither)
betterquesting.quest.q1ilrpayTHWJ-bajd9WM1A.desc=After collecting a couple of those wither skeleton heads, you feel like you could use some more action. So why not kill a wither?


### Quests in multiple quest lines ###

# Quest: Armor Modifications
betterquesting.quest.3J7vD46NQg6IMMDRALpT-A.name=Armor Modifications
betterquesting.quest.3J7vD46NQg6IMMDRALpT-A.desc=The §3Armor Modification Table§r allows for armor modifications to be inserted in armor, giving either buffs, new abilities or extra resistance.

# Quest: Dyson Swarms
betterquesting.quest.3WDOW4oRQoO6WN6291ZuNw.name=Dyson Swarms
betterquesting.quest.3WDOW4oRQoO6WN6291ZuNw.desc=§3Dyson Swarms§r consist of thousands of swarm members encircling the parent star of a system, and energy production from the swarm scales based on the number of members in a swarm. These satellites do not last indefinitely however, they attenuate (decay) over time, with the chance of decay increasing as the number of swarm members increase.%n%n§6Dyson Swarm Members§r must be launched into solar orbit via the use of a huge centrifugal launch platform, known as the §3Spinlauncher§r. The spinlauncher launches 4 swarm members at a time, consuming a large amount of electricity to do so.%n%nThe §3Dyson Receiver§r is the main machine required for collecting energy from the swarm. It collimates the immense energy collected from the swarm into a immensely powerful beam. Setting up requires only a satellite ID chip that is matched to an existing swarm. The energy beam must be pointed towards a Dyson Power Converter.%n%nThe §3Satellite Dyson Relay§r can be used to allow dyson swarms to provide power during night time.

# Quest: Quests information
betterquesting.quest.45ow6xFKTQ6GHVi3FG_dtQ.name=Quests information
betterquesting.quest.45ow6xFKTQ6GHVi3FG_dtQ.desc=[warn]This Questbook was originally made by _SkippyPlaysMC_ for NT:I/ST:I modpacks and modified by Bufka2011.[/warn]%n%nNotes:%n%n§b1) This questbook does not contain all the content from the mod, such as the guns, many armor sets and others. Make sure to browse NEI.%n%n2) §lThere are two types of quests §r§3§b- primary and secondary. Primary quests are quests with unique shape and bold lines between each other.%n%n3) When updating the modpack to newer versions that has introduced changes to the questbook, in case the quests dont update, delete the betterquesting folder in the world file.%nAfter it is deleted, turn on cheats and do "/bq_admin edit true", head over to the chapter of your choice, press the designer button (the one with many squares), click on your quest of choice and finally press the autocomplete button (checkmark) to complete the quests previously completed.%n%n§r§bSpecial thanks to everyone on discord who helped out with questions and recommendations while making the quests, as well as the official NTM Wiki for providing information used in the quests.

# Quest: Modpack information
betterquesting.quest.5VAtBoWDTLmFNrWxLbn9IA.name=Modpack information
betterquesting.quest.5VAtBoWDTLmFNrWxLbn9IA.desc=§cWelcome to Nuclear Tech: New Horizons!§r%n%nPlease read the following information before starting out.%n%n§b1) Quests ARE important, they explain a lot of things. Search the questbook before asking questions!%n%n2) While questbook tries to have as much info as possible, there is also a guidebook developing! A wiki that is always with you, can be opened by a keybind (Ctrl + G by default).%n%n3) Remember to Claim your base and Chunkload your reactors using Server Utilities (from the inventory).%n%n4) If shaders are glitching out try to use fancy textures.%n%n5) If you are encountering any rendering problems, try to scroll around in NEI.%n%n6) If you are playing with friends, make sure to invite them in your BetterQuesting Party as to share progression and rewards.%n

# Quest: Dyson Anatmogenesis Terraformer
betterquesting.quest.6k-JrbD-S8GO9PRRthWNRA.name=Dyson Anatmogenesis Terraformer
betterquesting.quest.6k-JrbD-S8GO9PRRthWNRA.desc=The §3Dyson Anatmogenesis Terraformer§r provides the most utility out of all the currently available §3Dyson converters§r, accepting a beam from a receiver and providing a direct energy to mass conversion, producing planetary scale atmospheric gases, terraforming any planet or moon as a player sees fit.%n%nBy default it will release oxygen into an atmosphere, making it breathable once it crosses the 0.1atm threshold for breathing. A fluid identifier can be used to switch the gas emitted, and a screwdriver can switch it between emitting or extracting gases from the atmosphere.%n%nIf powered with §e150THE/s§r power from a swarm (equivalent to a swarm size of 1,024), it will take 8 hours to reach 0.1atm of pressure.

# Quest: Maskman
betterquesting.quest.8b6batCvQvCiGknitRMrSQ.name=Maskman
betterquesting.quest.8b6batCvQvCiGknitRMrSQ.desc=Maskman is the first NTM boss. To summon it, you need to be under radiation poisoning (50 rad). A 20-minute timer starts per player when requirements are met. Once it runs out, Mask Man spawns. A warning appears 1 minute before spawn. If you are no longer irradiated, the timer resets.

# Quest: Glyphids
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQ.name=Glyphids
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQ.desc=§6Glyphids§r are large insects that have many different types. They primarily spawn with naturally generated §6§rhives§r structures. All of the types are armored and they take less damage than against normal mobs. Glyphids are normally attracted to pollution created by the player, and usually have to be dealt with by the player.%n%n§6§r§6Hives§r can spawn naturally in all non-ocean biomes and can also be created by glyphid scouts. They contain several glyphid egg blocks and some low-tier loot inside, lying on top of eggs. glyphid egg blocks spawn glyphids and drop glyphid eggs upon destruction.%n%nGlyphids now periodically retarget the closest player every 5 seconds if their current target is farther. 1/3 of glyphids do not have this behavior to prevent infinite trapping.%n%n§2It is recommended that all hives are destroyed as soon as possible as to prevent their spread later on.

# Quest: Useful Tools
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACA.name=Useful Tools
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACA.desc=There are many tools which will help you progress through the mod, the most important ones being:%n%n§6Tungsten Reachers§r, which reduce the radiation the player gets exposed to from items in their inventory, as well as allowing them to hold some very hot items.%n%nThe §6Crowbar§r, which is used to open crates for loot such as food and ammunition found in various structures.

# Quest: Conveyor Belt
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKg.name=Конвеєрна смуга
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKg.desc=§3Conveyors§r provide the simplest way of moving items around. There are multiple blocks that can interface with machines as well as items moving along conveyor belts.%n%n§3Conveyor Belts§r are blocks used to transport items. They can pick up dropped items or items from conveyor ejectors. Conveyor inserters can take items from conveyor belts. If there are no conveyor inserters present, the item will be dropped at the end of the conveyor belt line.%n%n§3Conveyor Inserters§r are blocks that take items from conveyor belts and outputs them into a storage space. Conveyor ejectors are the opposite, they take items from storage and place them onto conveyor belts. %n%nInserters have an option to destroy surplus items if the input buffer has run full, otherwise the items that can neither be inserted in the target nor the inserter's buffer is simply dropped.%n%nThe ejector has a whitelist/blacklist system (the default mode is blacklist with no restrictions - this means that everything will go through). Right-clicking the white arrow will toggle between whitelist and blacklist. An item can be added to the blacklist/whitelist by "depositing" it into the blue inventory square - the item will not be consumed, however.%n%nThe §3Conveyor Splitter§r is a type of conveyor belt that splits items evenly onto 2 lanes.%n%n§3Conveyor Sorters§r are blocks that can sort various items to a specific conveyor belt. They do not have a buffer and simple move items to connected conveyor belts based on their filter options, therefore they can sort items as quickly as they receive them.%nThe sorter has six outputs with five slots each, making it able to route multiple items to one belt.

# Quest: Transport Drones
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdg.name=Transport Drones
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdg.desc=§3Transport Drones§r are flying machines which will transport items and fluids between different containers. The drones require no power, and can transport both up and down. §3Waypoints§r can be used to make a better path for the transport drones to move around.

# Quest: Tantalium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiw.name=Tantalium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiw.desc=§6Tantalium§r is a material needed for the creation of some items, most importantly §6Capacitor Boards§r, which are crucial for the control units of most nuclear bombs. Tantalium Polycrystal production requires §6Coltan§r which can be located by the use of a §6Coltas§r. Coltan can also be obtained by using the mining drill in a §eBedrock Ore Coltan Deposit§r located randomly on planet Dres. Tantalum can also be obtained via §3Watz Reactor§r.%n%n§2Coltan Processing at its early stage can provide Niobium needed for Catalytic Cracking Towers.

# Quest: Hunger System
betterquesting.quest.Fio9CeHtR9-O6cehKBCH5g.name=Система голоду
betterquesting.quest.Fio9CeHtR9-O6cehKBCH5g.desc=§dHunger Overhaul§r перетворює голод на справжню загрозу, а не на незначну незручність.%n%nТепер рівень голоду пасивно знижується з часом, навіть у стані бездіяльності. Досягнення нульового рівня призводить до миттєвої смерті. До цього моменту низький рівень голоду спричиняє уповільнення, слабкість та зниження швидкості видобутку. Прийом їжі надає ефект §6Ситий§r, який прискорює відновлення здоров’я - чим ситніша їжа, тим довше триває ефект.%n%nХарчові цінності перебалансовані відповідно до розміру страви. Сирі інгредієнти відновлюють дуже мало; готові страви відновлюють значно більше. Більші страви їсти довше, і їх менше вміщається у вашому інвентарі.%n%nРослини ростуть лише вдень, і дозрівання займає набагато більше часу. Дерев'яні та кам'яні мотики видалено - для обробки ґрунту вам потрібна щонайменше залізна мотика. Сільськогосподарські угіддя повинні бути розташовані поруч із водою, інакше вони не працюватимуть.%n%n§dSpice of Life: Carrot Edition§r винагороджує різноманітність раціону. Кожна унікальна страва, з’їдена вперше, назавжди збільшує ваш максимальний запас здоров’я. Повторне вживання однієї й тієї ж страви не дає жодних бонусів.%n%n§2Чим різноманітніший ваш раціон, тим більше у вас сердець - побудуйте різноманітну ферму якомога раніше.§r

# Quest: Red Key
betterquesting.quest.NB6qs0xZSHaY5Sik2IoTxg.name=Red Key
betterquesting.quest.NB6qs0xZSHaY5Sik2IoTxg.desc=The §6Red Key§r is able to open any container that requires a regular key, regardless of the pin configuration of the lock, and it is one of the only two keys capable of opening the keyhole found on strange stone, in order to open a §eRed Room§r. The key has no durability, and can be reused indefinitely.%n%n

# Quest: Safes and lockpicking
betterquesting.quest.VoxsH2isSheNEKaJ3_Ikgg.name=Safes and lockpicking
betterquesting.quest.VoxsH2isSheNEKaJ3_Ikgg.desc=The §6Screwdriver§r is used to rotate conveyor blocks and to extract rods from a §3Chicago Pile§r; assemble and drill the pile itself with a §6Hand Drill§r. It can also be used in combination with §6Bobby Pins§r to unlock §6Safes§r found in various structures.

# Quest: The End of Space...
betterquesting.quest.XbTJRWJNTKa4UEeLPV0urg.name=The End of Space...
betterquesting.quest.XbTJRWJNTKa4UEeLPV0urg.desc=Well, you've completed the space stage of the game; now the entire space knows and fears you (you are a true space pirate). Here are a couple more nuances about the §3Dyson swarm§r:%n%n§2Do not place §3converters§r directly next to the §3receiver§r - this will cause a malfunction.§r%n%n§2Multiple players in the same game world can create multiple §3swarms§r, but keep in mind that different swarms reduce each other's §eefficiency§r. This can encourage players to either work together on one common §3swarm§r or compete to extract more §eenergy§r from their own §3swarm§r.§r

# Quest: Agriculture and Farming
betterquesting.quest.Zpwlu-OeTpCvf7vTFz-BIA.name=Сільське господарство та фермерство
betterquesting.quest.Zpwlu-OeTpCvf7vTFz-BIA.desc=Three mods overhaul farming and food in this pack.%n%n§dPam's HarvestCraft§r adds 40+ crops, many fruit trees, 10 fish, beekeeping, and 75+ foods. Key blocks: §3Presser§r (produces oils, honey, etc.), §3Market§r (buys seeds and saplings for emeralds), §3Shipping Block§r (sells crops for emeralds). Right-clicking a mature crop harvests and replants it.%n%n§dAgriCraft§r adds genetics-based crop breeding. Plants have six stats - Growth, Gain, Strength, Resistance, Fertility, and Mutativity - inherited from parent crops when cross-breeding. Higher stats are dominant. Mutations can unlock new crop species entirely. Weeds will compete with and eventually kill unmanaged crops. Plants have specific soil, light, and fluid requirements, so placement matters.%n%n§dHunger Overhaul§r requires farmland to be placed adjacent to water - untouched dry tilled soil will not function.%n%n§2Note that the crops should be planted on the Crop Sticks.

# Quest: Compressor
betterquesting.quest.jcaOirN6QCOC50YJbil2rQ.name=Compressor
betterquesting.quest.jcaOirN6QCOC50YJbil2rQ.desc=The §3Compressor§r is a specialized multiblock machine for compressing fluids. It can perform this operation on any fluid to increase its pressure, for use in other machines. Some of these fluids are compressed into different fluids entirely as special recipes for this machine. Each compressor only does a single PU increase step, compressed fluids cannot be stored in tanks, and compressing perfluoromethyl to 2 PU turns it into cold PFM.

# Quest: Pneumatic Pipes
betterquesting.quest.pTXtLJnPRu6lyiOqGVP7lw.name=Pneumatic Pipes
betterquesting.quest.pTXtLJnPRu6lyiOqGVP7lw.desc=§3Pneumatic Pipes§r are an instant form of item transportation which can cover large distances. The pipes must have a compressed gas inside them to work.%n%nA §6Screwdriver§r is needed to create a connection, and right clicking on the connection with a fluid id will set the gasseous fluid it will use.

# Quest: Flow Control Pump
betterquesting.quest.qHqokbvIRPSKbDzjTfQE0g.name=Flow Control Pump
betterquesting.quest.qHqokbvIRPSKbDzjTfQE0g.desc=The §3Flow Control Pump§r is used to set priorities for fluid pipes aswell as to limit fluid throughput.


### Quests in no quest lines ###

# Quest: Additional Fluid Tools
betterquesting.quest.dIUUo_wJTR6juTJGlEfuBQ.name=Additional Fluid Tools
betterquesting.quest.dIUUo_wJTR6juTJGlEfuBQ.desc=The §6Siphon§r is a tool used to extract input fluids from a machine. Right-clicking a machine with content in it's input tanks will fill any fluid barrels, universal tanks or pipettes (if the fluid amount cannot fill any of the previous options).%n%n§6Pipettes§r can be used to input specific amounts of fluids. Right-clicking or Shift-Right-clicking will increase or decrease the fluid amount.

# Quest: Brine Processing
betterquesting.quest.yi8dF0M0QNC7loTi7LDKDw.name=Brine Processing
betterquesting.quest.yi8dF0M0QNC7loTi7LDKDw.desc=§bBrine§r is extracted with a §3Derrick§r on the moons §eMun§r, §eMinmus§r and §eIke, and processed to obtain materials such as §6Nickel§r (purify pentlandite with brine), §6Copper§r and §6Sulfur§r, and fluids such as §bHydrogen§r and §bOxygen§r.
